<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1SA" style="id">- Ndendeule Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">1 Chamwele</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kitabo Chu Kutumbula Cha Akanahota akanahotawele</para>
  <para style="toc2">1Samwele</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Chamw</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kitabo Chu Kutumbula Cha</para>
  <para style="mt1">Chamwele</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabo chukutumbula cha Chamwele na kitabo chuubhele cha Chamwele, makacho kikibha kitabo chimo kikolongwa, chikimanyikina ngita, “Kitabo cha Chamwele.” Kitabo chenio ngakibhaghinwa nukubhe itabo ibhele mulilaghano lya Makacho, “Seputuajente.” Lende ndi likibha litafuchile lyukutumbula lya lilaghano lya Makacho, mukilonge cha Kiyunane. Liina lya tafuchile jhenio mana ghake kubhehe kikajhandikwe na bhando makome chaba bhibhachomite Kiyahude. Mu kuhumbula mukilonge cha Kigilike, kitabo chukutumbula na chuubhele ya Chamwele, ikemitwa unahota nkolongwa ghu kutumbula na unahota nkolongwa ghu ubhele, mulitafuchile lya Kilatine lilikengime pilipeta lyenio, itabo yenio ngaibadilichwa nu kukemwa unahota nkolongwa ghukutumbula na unahota nkolongwa ghuubhele. Yene ndi itabo imanyikana kipinde chenje anda unahota nkolongwa ghu Kutumbula na unahota nkolongwa gwa ubhele mu tafuchile jhenio ikemitwa unahota nkolongwa utato nu unahota nkolongwa gwa ncheche. Kitabo chu Kutumbula cha Chamwele na kitabo chu Ubhele cha Chamwele ghichimulila malobhe gha ughome gwa nnondole Chamwele na munahota nkolongwa Sauli na munahota nkolongwa Daude. Chamwele akibha kilongoche jhukujhomolela kipiende kilambo chuku Ichilahele pikijhangingina kuhumi kulongochwa na Nkenga na kutumbu kulongochwa na munahota nkolongwa. Chamwele jwenio ndi jwabhamiminila mahuta Sauli na Daude kubhehe Akanahota akolongwa bhibhatumbwila kulongocha ku Ichilahele. Itabo ya Chamwele jhukutumbula na Chamwele jhuubhele ichimulila chikipitila ya kilambo chuku Ichilahele mu kipinde chenio.</para>
  <para style="ip">Abhii jhe jwaimanye ghane jwajhandike itabo yenio, kitabo chukutumbula cha Chamwele nu kitabo chubhele cha Chamwele. Jwajhandika akilongii jhe jwenie muitabo yenio, pange akibha ghome mukipinde choha chuulongoche gwa munahota nkolongwa Daude na pange akabhi ghome ata bada jhuulongoche gwenio, na pange hele akibha nuuhotolo ghukulola nukuchoma baluwa henge jhichimulile ughome gwa Sauli na Chamwele. Iwechekana akahotwi kuchoma baluwa henge ichimulila ughome gwa Sauli na Chamwele. Kunhwalo gwangamanyika kwa mundo amu bhando bhibhajhandike itabo henge, hele imanyikana jhe itabo henge ikajhandikwe ligha.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ghughabhii mukitabo</para>
  <para style="io">Kubhelukwa nu kukemwa kwa nnondole Chamwele mu utumiche gwa Bhambo Chapanga, mu chula jha 1 ade 3</para>
  <para style="io">Akafilichite pibhatoila lichanduko lya lilaghano lya Chapanga kubhoke kwa Akaichilahele, na namuna chililetita uhangabhano gwa miche jha Akafilichite na pilikibha mu miche jhenio mu chula jha 4 ade 7.</para>
  <para style="io">Akaichilahele pibhapaila bhabhehe na munahota nkolongwa, hele namuna Chamwele pampakiya Sauli mahuta kupala abhehe munahota nkolongwa jhukutumbula jhuku Ichilahele na namuna Bhambo Chapanga pankanita Sauli, mu chula jha 8 ade 15.</para>
  <para style="io">Chamwele pampakiya mahuta Daude kubhehe munahota nkolongwa jhuubhele jhuku Ichilahele na namuna Sauli pajhighita kunkoma Daude, mu chula jha 16 ade 31.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1SA 1" />
  <para style="s">Elikana na nyumba jhake ku Shilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 1:1" />Pakibha na mundo jhumo jwatamita ku Lama, kukilambo cha itombe yuku Efulaimo, jwakemitwa Elikana jwa likabila lya Efulaimo. Elikana jwapapitwe na Yelohamo na Yelohamo, jwapapitwe na Eliho na Eliho jwapapitwe na Tohu na Tohu jwapapitwe Sufu. <verse eid="1SA 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 1:2" />Jwenio Elikana akibha na matala, jhumo akemitwa Hana na jhonge akemitwa Penina. Penina akapapite yana, nambo Hana akapapite jhe yana. <verse eid="1SA 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 1:3" />Kila chaka Elikana ngakwelita kujhenda kunnyinamii Bhambo Chapanga jhuna Makakala ghoha nu kumpiikiya litambiko kwenio ku shilo. Kipinde chenio, yana ibhele inalome ya Ele, Holifine na Finehase, ndi bhakibha akapiya matambiko bha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="1SA 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 1:4" />Kila kipinde Elikana papiita litambiko, ngampila Penina nhwanamundo lipungo limo lya nyama pamonga na yana mundo yoha ikeghe na inalome. <verse eid="1SA 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 1:5" />Nambo Elikana nganchochikiya Hana lipungo limo likolongwa nhwalo akampahi hake, pamonga nu kubhehe Bhambo Chapanga akampii jhe mota ya yana. <verse eid="1SA 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 1:6" />Ku nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga akantehi ntonga Hana, Penina mwikeghe nnyake akibha namilomo, kupala anchimwicha. <verse eid="1SA 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 1:7" />Mihalo jhenio ngaijhendilila kila chaka. Kila kipinde Hana pajhendita ku Nyumba jha Bhambo Chapanga, Penina ngantendila chanake Hana ade ngalelita nu kukana kulye chochoha. <verse eid="1SA 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 1:8" />Elikana Unganamundo, ngankonyita, “Nike chimilela? Nike chimikana kulyegha? Nike mmii ngolongonde kumwojho gwino? Bho, ne jwamaha jhe kwino kuliku yana kome inalome?”<verse eid="1SA 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hana na Ele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 1:9" />Lichiko limo, pubhajhomolila kulye nu kunywelekeya pa Nyumba jha Bhambo Chapanga, kwenio ku Shilo, Hana ngajhemita. Kipinde chenio, mpiya litambiko Ele akibha atamite mu kigoda chake pahina na lifelemo lya nnyango gwa Nyumba jha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="1SA 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 1:10" />Hana kwa lipyanda hake, ngalelita nu kunnyopa Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="1SA 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 1:11" />Hana ngabhekita nachile kukulonge, “Mwe ma Bhambo Chapanga jhuna Makakala ghoha, ngaulingulila ling'ahe lya ntumiche gwino nukunkomboka, changa kunyehwa nantumiche gwino, nukumbe mwana munalome, chanimpela mwenga mwana jwenio, abhehe jwino kwa machiko ghoha gha ughome gwake, hilu majhunjo ghake naghachekulwa jhe.” <verse eid="1SA 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 1:12" />Hana ngajhendilila kunnyopa Bhambo Chapanga na mpiya litambiko Ele ngalolekiya nnomo gwake. <verse eid="1SA 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 1:13" />Hana akibha anyopita Bhambo Chapanga kinunokinuno nnomo gwake ubhonikina ukinakina, nambo lilobhe lyake lyakajhokonikike jhe. Yene Ele ngahambwika Hana ate kulobhela. <verse eid="1SA 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 1:14" />Ndi Ele ngankonyita “Bho, nanyendelela kulobhela ade digha? Nneke kunywe divaye.”<verse eid="1SA 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 1:15" />Nambo, Hana ngannyangwila, “Nahi jhe manahota bhango! Ne namukeghe jhuna lipyanda hake, nenywi jhe divaye hilu kulobhela, nambo ne mbihita ghighabhii umwojho gwango nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="1SA 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 1:16" />Manganhwachii jhe nenga kubhehe ndi mwikeghe jwanganandela. Kwa kipinde choha chenio nighalonge malola ghango na mang'ahe ghango.”<verse eid="1SA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 1:17" />Peniya, Ele ngalongila, “Nnyenda ku uteeke, na Bhambo Chapanga jwa Ichilahele ampe chela chunnyopite.”<verse eid="1SA 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 1:18" />Hana ngalongila, “Na nenga ntumiche gwino nijhopa ungoto kunhwachii ghanganandela nnonge jhino.” Bhahe, ngabhokita nukujhenda kulye na akibha jhe nu ungolongonde kabhele.<verse eid="1SA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubhelukwa kwa Chamwele nu kubhekwa nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 1:19" />Lichiko lilikengima, ngabhajhimwika putepute, Elikana na akalongo mundo ngabhanyinamila Bhambo Chapanga, nukukelebhuka kajhabhe kwenio ku Lama. Elikana ngagholwika na nhwana mundo Hana, na Bhambo Chapanga ngankombwika. <verse eid="1SA 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 1:20" />Yene, Hana ngagheghita ndumbo, nukupapa mwana munalome. Hana ngantinita liina mwana jwenio Chamwele, ngalongila kubhehe, “Nhwalo nikanyopite kuhumii kwa Bhambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="1SA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 1:21" />Elikana na nyumba jhoha ngabhahowika kabhele kujhenda ku shilo, nu kumpiikiya Bhambo Chapanga litambiko jha chaka nu kutimicha nachile jhake. <verse eid="1SA 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 1:22" />Nambo mwanja gwenio Hana akajhahwii jhe. Nhwalo akannobholii ungana mundo kubhehe, “Nijhenda jhe nenga hilu mwana gwango ade papakulekechwa kujhonga, peniya, ndi pambakumpeleka nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, na jwenie natama kwenio machiko ghoha ghangapeta.”<verse eid="1SA 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 1:23" />Elikana ungana mundo ngannyangwila, “Ntenda chumibhona chamaha. Nnendela ade pumpa kunnekecha kujhonga. Bhambo Chapanga antangatile kutimicha nachile jhino.” Bhahe, Hana ngahighilika ukajha kunnela mwanamundo ade pannekicha kujhonga.<verse eid="1SA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 1:24" />Pannekicha tu kujhonga, ngalongohina nako nukumpeleka mu Nyumba jha Bhambo Chapanga, kwenio ku Shilo, kongo akibha na litohe lya ng'ombi lya nkambako lya yaka itato na kilo ticha ya ukobha na lihako lya limbendela lya divaye. <verse eid="1SA 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 1:25" />Pubhajhomolila kunchinja ng'ombi jwenio, ngabhampelika mwana Chamwele kwa mpiya litambiko Ele. <verse eid="1SA 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 1:26" />Hana ngannobholila Ele, “Chakaka ngita chimitama mwe manahota gwango, ne ndi jhola mwikeghe jwakajhemite nnonge jhino, akinyopita Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="1SA 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 1:27" />Nakannyopite ambele mwana jhonjo, na Bhambo nganyangwila chela chininyopite. <verse eid="1SA 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 1:28" />Ku nhwalo gwenio, nimpela Bhambo Chapanga mwana jhonjo, kipinde choha chapakubhehe ghome, abhekitwe kwa lihengo lya Bhambo Chapanga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 1:28">Peniya, ngabhanyinamila Bhambo Chapanga kwenio ku Shilo.<verse eid="1SA 1:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1SA 2" />
  <para style="s">Majhopo gha Hana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 2:1" />Bhahe, Hana ngajhopita nu kulonge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:1">“Mwojho gwango nhwanganii Bhambo Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:1">Ninnomba Bhambo Chapanga jwabhii makakala ghango.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:1">Naheka akamakoko bhango,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:1">nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga andangatile.”<verse eid="1SA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 2:2" />Abhii jhe jwabhii nyahinyahi ngita Bhambo Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:2">abhii jhe jhojhoha jwabhii ngita jwenie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:2">abhii jhe jwahoto kutulonda ngita Bhambo Chapanga gwito.<verse eid="1SA 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 2:3" />Nkoto kukikweya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:3">nkoto kulonge kwa ngandango.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:3">Ku nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga ndi jwaimanya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:3">Jwenie ughapema matendwa ghoha gha bhando.<verse eid="1SA 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 2:4" />Mbinde jha akakomana ngondo bhina makakala, imetukine.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:4">Na bhaleghelaho bhabhii na makakala.<verse eid="1SA 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 2:5" />Bhala bhibhabhila na yakulya mbwe makacho, ngohe bhihenga mahengo kupala bhapata chakulya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">Nambo bhala bhibhabhila na njala, ngohe bhihangani kujhukuta</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">Mwikeghe ntonga apapite yana chaba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">Nambo majhe jhuna yana mbwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">ahighilike changa mwana.<verse eid="1SA 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 2:6" />Bhambo Chapanga ikoma nu kuyokecha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:6">jwenie ubhahuluwa pahe ade kukilambo cha bhando bibhawile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:6">na kabhele uyokecha.<verse eid="1SA 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 2:7" />Bhambo Chapanga utenda bhange kubhehe akahocho, na bhange kubhehe bhina ilebhe mbwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:7">Bhange ubhahuluwa na bhange ubhajhinula.<verse eid="1SA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 2:8" />Ujhinula akahocho kuhumii mulutukunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:8">na ubhajhinula bhina malola kubhoke mumaliho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:8">kupala abhatamicha pamonga na ilongoche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:8">nu kwabheka mu igoda ya ichima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:8">Nhwalo, michinge jha nnema ndi jha Bhambo Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:8">na panane jhake abhekite nnema.<verse eid="1SA 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 2:9" />“Jwenie ulonda ughome gwa bhando bhake bhibhahobholeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:9">nambo ughome gwa bhanganandela uuleke mulubhendo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:9">Nhwalo, mundo ipata jhe kuhotolo kwa makakala ghake.<verse eid="1SA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 2:10" />Akamakoko bha Bhambo Chapanga nabhakomelekelwa pulutu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:10">Kuhumii kunane kwa Chapanga, nabhabula kwa mbamba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:10">Bhambo Chapanga nauhadabula nnema gwoha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:10">nampela makalala munahota nkolongwa jwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:10">jwenie naujhinula uhotolo gwa jwakihaghulile.”<verse eid="1SA 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 2:11" />Peniya, Elikana ngakelehwika ukajha kwenio ku Lama. Nambo mwana Chamwele, ngahighilika kuntumikii Bhambo Chapanga pahe jhu ulongoche gwa mpiya litambiko Ele, kwenio ku Shilo.<verse eid="1SA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yana inalome ya mpiya litambiko Ele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 2:12" />Yana inalome ya mpiya litambiko Ele ikibha yanganandela hake, bhakanyokonikii jhe Bhambo Chapanga, <verse eid="1SA 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 2:13" />na hilu ilebhe yiipalwa bhando kwapela akapiya matambiko. Kila mundo pakibha abhoita litambiko lyake, kongo nyama ikabhela, ntumiche jwa mpiya litambiko ngahikita na kilebhe chukujhipuli likolo, china mino matato, <verse eid="1SA 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 2:14" />ngakihomika kilebhe chenio chukujhipulii likolo mukiteleko chenio, nyama jhojhoha jhiipakujhokolwa mwenio na kilebhe chenio, chaibha jha mpiya litambiko. Akaichilahele bhoha bhibhajhahwila kwenio ku Shilo kupiya matambiko ghabhe, ngabhatendilwa yene. <verse eid="1SA 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 2:15" />Kuchocha kwa gheniya, mahuta nukujhocha jhe, ntumiche jwa mpiya litambiko uhika nu kunnobholela mundo jwapiya litambiko lyenio, “Mpiikiye mpiya litambiko nyama jhu kubanika, nhwalo jwenie napokela jhe nyama jhino jhukututuwa, nambo jhibhii mbehe.”<verse eid="1SA 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 2:16" />Anda mundo jwenio annyangwii, “Dendela hote nnyoche mahuta, peniya, nantola chochoha chimipala,” peniya, ntumiche jwa mpiya litambiko unnyanguu, “Nai jhe, mbela ngohengohe. Anda jhe chandola kwa makakala.”<verse eid="1SA 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 2:17" />Uhakaho ghongo gwa ingombo yenio ya mpiya litambiko Ele, ukibha nkolongwa hake nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. Nhwalo ingombo yenio ikapuchite matambiko gha Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="1SA 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chamwele kwenio ku Shilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 2:18" />Kipinde chenio, Chamwele ngajhendilila kuntumikii Bhambo Chapanga, kongo awalite kichubao kinhuo. <verse eid="1SA 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 2:19" />Kila chaka majhemundo ngampumila likanjo lichokombe, nu kumpelekela pajhenda na nnganamundo kupiya litambiko lya kila chaka. <verse eid="1SA 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 2:20" />Mpiya litambiko Ele kila chaka ngampila mota Elikana na nhwanamundo, kukulonge,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 2:20">“Bhambo Chapanga ampela yana henge kwa mwikeghe jhonjo, kupala bhatola pwache jha jhola jhumpile Bhambo Chapanga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 2:20">Peniya, ngabhakelewika kajhabhe. <verse eid="1SA 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 2:21" />Bhambo Chapanga ngammonila kiya Hana, na jwenie ngapatita yana henge itato inalome na ikeghe ibhena. Na jwenie Chamwele ngajhendelila kukola nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="1SA 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ele na yanamundo inalome</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 2:22" />Kipinde chenio Ele akibha aghogholwike hake. Na jwenie ngajhoina malobhe ghoha yana yake ibhatendila Akaichilahele bhoha. Helehela chibhagholwika na akakeghe bhibhahengita mahengo pa chehemo jha kujhingilila mu lihema lya Kukonganikila, <verse eid="1SA 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 2:23" />Ele ngabhakonyita, “Kilebhe ghane mitenda ilebhe ngita yenehe? Nhwalo nyoine kubhokee kwa bhando bhoha, panane jha itendwa ino yanganandela yimihenga. <verse eid="1SA 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 2:24" />Mangatenda jhe yene mayanango, nhwalo malobhe ghenia ghoha ghinijhoha kuhumii kwa bhando bha Bhambo Chapanga, ghanganandela. <verse eid="1SA 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 2:25" />Mundo anda annemwii nnyake, ahoto kujhopelwa kwa Chapanga, kupala Chapanga annekekeye. Nambo mundo anda annemwii Bhambo Chapanga, ghane jwahoto kunnyopela alekekelwe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 2:25">Nambo yana yenio ikannyokonikii jhe tate gwabhe, ku nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga akapangite njwe kwakomelekeya. <verse eid="1SA 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 2:26" />Na kangombo Chamwele ngajhendilila kukola, ngachochita kupalwa na Bhambo Chapanga na bhando helahela.<verse eid="1SA 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lilobhe lya Chapanga kwa Ele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 2:27" />Lichiko limo, mundo jwa Chapanga nganyendila Ele nukunnobholela, Bhambo Chapanga ilonge naha, Bho, nakakilangi jhe hotuhotu kwa nyumba jha Alune na ighogholo ino, pibhakibha akabhanda bha Falao, kukilambo chuku Michile. <verse eid="1SA 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 2:28" />Pakate jha makabila gha Akaichilahele, Alune na akalongomundo ngabhahaghulilwa kubhehe akapiya matambiko bhango bhandumikile, bhandumikile pa chehemo jhu kupiikiya matambiko, bhatutukiye ubane nukuhwala kichubao nnonge jhango. Helahela nganapila matambiko ghango hokolo gwino Alone, matambiko ghango ghipiitwe kwa mwotu na Akaichilahele. <verse eid="1SA 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 2:29" />Ku nhwalo ghane mikola wiho mu matambiko ghango gha nalaghalakii bhando bhanetele? Kilebhe ghane miijhokonikii yana ino kuliku nenga kwa kukikendecha mabhene kukulye chehemo jhambone jha kila matambiko ghinipelwa na bhando bhango bhuku Ichilahele? <verse eid="1SA 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 2:30" />Kuyene, Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jhuku Ichilahele, ilonge naha, nakalaghile kubhehe nyumba jhino na nyumba jha tate gwino, niika nnonge jhango kundumikila machiko ghoha ghangapeta. Nambo ngohe, Bhambo Chapanga ilonge naha, Kilebhe chenio ngohe kipechwike! Bhala bhibhanyokonikiya nane hele nanajhokonikiya na bhala bhibhambucha nane hele chanapuchwa. <verse eid="1SA 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 2:31" />Dola, machiko ghabhandikile chanakoma ingombo inalome yoha munyumba jhino na mulukolo lwino, napabhe jhe na munalome jhojhoha mulukolo lwino, jwapakutama ade aghogholoke. <verse eid="1SA 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 2:32" />Nunkola kiholo namakolela ajhino wiho kwa mota yoha yanipakwape Akaichilahele, nambo abhii jhe mundo jhojhoha pakate jha munyumba jhino jwapakulama ade mughogholo. <verse eid="1SA 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 2:33" />Jhumo pakate jha ibhelukwa ino nahighilika, na jwenio nandumikila ngita mpiya litambiko, nambo nanintenda kubhehe jwangalola na kuhobhoya kihobholelo na ibheluko ino nabhakomwa ku ukokotoko. <verse eid="1SA 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 2:34" />Na chenje nakibhaha nginyililo jha uchakaka kwino ghala ghighapakwakole yana ino inalome Hofini na Finehasi, bhoha bhabhele nabhakomwa lichiko limo. <verse eid="1SA 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 2:35" />Peniya, nanihaghula mpiya litambiko jhonge jwahobholeka kwango, jwapakuhenga telatela, ghala ghinipala ahenge. Nanimpela kibheluko chikibhii nganganga, jwenie natumikila machiko ghoha nnonge jha munahota nkolongwa gwango jhuninhagwile. <verse eid="1SA 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 2:36" />Jhojhoha jwapakuhighala munyumba jhino, nanyendela mpiya litambiko jwenio nukunnyopa madine gha feza amu kipande cha libumunda, nu kunnobholela, “Chonde umeke mulihengo lya kwatangatila akapiya matambiko, kupala mbate kilebhe chukulyegha.”<verse eid="1SA 2:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1SA 3" />
  <para style="s">Chamwele inkemwa na Bhambo Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 3:1" />Kipinde chenio, mwana Chamwele pantumikila Bhambo Chapanga pahe jha ulongoche gwa Ele, malobhe kuhumii kwa Bhambo Chapanga ghakibha ghandina tugha na helahela Chapanga ngabhalangiya bhando bhake ilebhe yandina tugha. <verse eid="1SA 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 3:2" />Mu kipinde chenio, mpiya litambiko Ele akibha aghogholwike hake ade miho ghake ghalolita jhe maha, lichiko limo uhiko akibha agholwike mu chumbe chake, <verse eid="1SA 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 3:3" />na Chamwele akagholwike mu Nyumba jha Bhambo Chapanga, pahina na lichanduko lya lilaghano lya Bhambo Chapanga. Na lumule lwa Bhambo Chapanga lwakahimike jhe, ku nhwalo pakachii mbone jhe. <verse eid="1SA 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 3:4" />Peniya, Bhambo Chapanga ngankemita Chamwele,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:4">Na Chamwele, ngajhangwila, “Ne pamba.” <verse eid="1SA 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 3:5" />Peniya, Chamwele ngajhahwila kajhombe kwa Ele nu kunnobholela “Ne pamba, nhwalo undekungema.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:5">Nambo Ele ngannobholila, “Ne ninkemiti jhe. Nyenda makagholoke.” Chamwele ngajhahwila kugholoka.<verse eid="1SA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 3:6" />Bhambo Chapanga ngankemita kabhele, “Chamwele!” Chamwele ngajhimwika ngannyendila Ele nuku nnobholela, “Nhikite, nhwalo undekungema.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:6">Nambo Ele ngannobholela, “Ninkemiti jhe mwanango, nnyende makagholoke.” Chamwele ngajhahwila kugholoka. <verse eid="1SA 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 3:7" />Kipinde chenio, Chamwele akammanyite jhe Bhambo Chapanga, hilu Bhambo Chapanga akalongi jhe na jwenie.<verse eid="1SA 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 3:8" />Bhambo Chapanga ngankemita Chamwele mala jhu utato. Chamwele ngajhimwika, ngannyendila Ele nukunnobholela, “Nhikite, nhwalo undekungema.” Peniya, Ele ngang'amwiya kubhehe Bhambo Chapanga ndi jwankemita Chamwele.<verse eid="1SA 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 3:9" />Kuyene Ele ngannobholela Chamwele, “Jhenda makagholoke, anda ankemite kabhele, munnobholela naha, ‘Dongela, Bhambo Chapanga, ne ntumiche gwino ninyokonikiya.’ ” Yene Chamwele ngajhahwila kugholoka.<verse eid="1SA 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 3:10" />Ndi Bhambo Chapanga ngahikita nu kujhema peniya, ngankemita Chamwele ngita chukutumbula, “Chamwele! Chamwele!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:10">Chamwele ngajhangwila, “Dongela, mwe Bhambo, ne ntumiche gwino ninnyokonikiya.” <verse eid="1SA 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 3:11" />Peniya, Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Chamwele, “Dola, mbala kutenda kilebhe ku muche gwa ku Ichilahele, kila mundo jwapakujhoha nachituka hake. <verse eid="1SA 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 3:12" />Lichiko lyenio nanenganikiya ghala ghoha ghinnongila chanintendela Ele na nyumba jhake, kuhumii pukutumbula ade upehekelo, chanintendela. <verse eid="1SA 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 3:13" />Ku nhwalo ninnobholile njwe kubhehe nanihadabula nyumba jhake machiko ghoha ghangapeta, kunhwalo gwa uhakaho gwaumanye, ghubhatei yana yake inalome kukunigha nenga na jwenie ngalekita kwaibhilikiya. <verse eid="1SA 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 3:14" />Yene, nilapanikiya nyumba jha Ele, kubhehe uhakaho gwabhe naupepulilwa ng'o ku litambiko lya kukomelekeya amu kwa litambiko lenge.”<verse eid="1SA 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 3:15" />Chamwele ngagholwika pala ade lukela, peniya, ngajhimwika nukudinduu milyango jha Nyumba jha Bhambo Chapanga. Nambo Chamwele ngajhogwipa kunnobholela Ele maloto ghala. <verse eid="1SA 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 3:16" />Ata yene Ele ngankemita Chamwele, “Chamwele mwanango.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:16">Jwenie ngajhangwila, “Ena, munahota!” <verse eid="1SA 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 3:17" />Ele ngankonyita, “Bho, Bhambo Chapanga annobholii nike? Unobholele hotuhotu manganhiya jhe, channobholile. Anda mihiya channobholile, Bhambo Chapanga nanchwapula chiipalwa.” <verse eid="1SA 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 3:18" />Bhahe, Chamwele ngannobholila Ele ghoha ghalobholilwe, changa nhiya chochoha. Peniya Ele ngalongila, “Jwenie ndi Bhambo Chapanga, na ahenge chela jwenie chakibhona chambone.”<verse eid="1SA 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 3:19" />Chamwele ngajhendilila kukola na Bhambo Chapanga ngabhila pamonga na jwenie, na ghoha ngaghatendika ngita chalongila Chamwele. <verse eid="1SA 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 3:20" />Bhando bhoha kukilambo chuku Ichilahele, kuhumii ku Dane, upande gwa kachikachine, ade ku Beel sheba, upande gwa kuchine, ngabhamanyita kubhehe Chamwele ndi nnondole jwa Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="1SA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 3:21" />Bhambo Chapanga ngachochita kukilangiya kwenio ku Shilo. Kwenio ngampitila Chamwele nukulonge nako. Na jwenie Chamwele palongila kilebhe, Akaichilahele bhoha ngabhannyokanikiya.<verse eid="1SA 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1SA 4" />
  <para style="s">Kupukilwa kwa Lichanduko lya lilaghano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 4:1" />Kipinde chenio, Akafilichite ngabhakonganika pamonga, kupala bhakomane na Akaichilahele. Akaichilahele ngabhabhekita kighono chabhe ku Ebenezeli, na Akafilichite ngabhabhekita kighono chabhe ku Afeka. <verse eid="1SA 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 4:2" />Akafilichite ngabhajhingilila Akaichilahele, ngondo piikondita Akaichilahele ngabhalepelila ngondo. Yene akakomana ngondo ngita elufo ncheche bha Akaichilahele ngabhakomitwa mulubhanja lwa ngondo. <verse eid="1SA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 4:3" />Akakomana ngondo bhibhahighilike pibhakelehwika kukighono chabhe, ighogholo yuku Ichilahele ngabhakonyina bhene chika, “Bho, kunhwalo ghane Bhambo Chapanga abhalekite Akafilichite bhatuhotole? Tijhangana takatole Lichanduko lya Lilaghano lya Bhambo Chapanga ku Shilo, kupala Bhambo Chapanga abhehe pamonga na twenga, atukombola kubhoka kwa akamakoko bhito.” <verse eid="1SA 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 4:4" />Yene, ngabhatumita bhando kujhenda ku Shilo, na bheniya ngabhaliletita Lichanduko lya Lilaghano lya Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jhuna makakala ghoha, jwaitama panane jha ihumbe ina mapapanilo iikemwa Makelube. Yana inalome ya mpiya litambiko Ele yane Hofini na Finehache, ndi bhibhahikita na Lichanduko lya Lilaghano lya Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="1SA 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 4:5" />Kipinde Lichanduko lya Lilaghano lya Bhambo Chapanga pilihikichwa kukighono, Akaichilahele ngabhachobhila kukuhangana, na kilambo choha ngakinyukwinyika. <verse eid="1SA 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 4:6" />Akafilichite pubhajhoina njobhelo yenio yukuhangana ngabhakonya, “Bho, njobhelo yenio yoha kukighono cha Akaebulaniya kipitii nike?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 4:6">Pibhamanyita kubhehe lichanduko lya Lilaghano lya Bhambo Chapanga lihikichwe mukighono cha Akaichilahele, <verse eid="1SA 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 4:7" />ngabhajhogwipa hake Akafilichite, ngabhalongila, “Pange ichapanga jhabhe ijhingii mukighono chabhe. Natulola choto, kilebhe ngita chenje kinawahi jhe kupitila. <verse eid="1SA 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 4:8" />Natulola choto! Bho, meneke jwahoto kutughombola na ichapanga jhenje ina makakala? Yenio ndi ichapanga ijhakomita Akamichile kwa mabulo ghangalandana, kwenio kunjenga. <verse eid="1SA 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 4:9" />Ngohe, ma Akafilichite mangajhoghopa jhe. Mmaa, nganganga kupala mangabhe jhe akabhanda bha Akaebulaniya ngita bheniya chibhakibha akabhanda kwa twenga. Mma nganganga mukakomane nabho.”<verse eid="1SA 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 4:10" />Bhahe, Akafilichite ngabhakomina ngondo na Akaichilahele, na Akaichilahele ngabhalepelila, na kila mundo ngatilila mukighono chake. Na akakomana ngondo elufo chelachine bhuku Ichilahele bhibhatyanga kwa magholo, ngabhakomitwa lichiko lyenio. <verse eid="1SA 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 4:11" />Lichanduko lya Lilaghano lya Bhambo Chapanga ngalipukilwa kwa makakala na Akafilichite, na helehela yana inalome ya mpiya litambiko Ele, Hofini na Fineache, ngabhakomitwa.<verse eid="1SA 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwe kwa Ele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 4:12" />Lichiko lele, nkomana ngondo jhumo jwa likabila lya Benjamine ngabhutwika kubhoka pulubhanja lwa ngondo ade ku Shilo, kongo ngobho jhake ijhwepukine na abhii nulutukunda tulilu pa muto gwake. <verse eid="1SA 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 4:13" />Ele, ngabhila na kiholo kumwojho gwake kupete Lichanduko lya Bhambo Chapanga, pakibha atamite pakigoda chake, muupele mwa ndela alendelila pange najhoha kilebhe chochoha. Nkomana ngondo jhola pajhingila kubomane nukuchimulila malobhe ghenio, bhando bhoha bha muche gwenio ngabhalelita hake. <verse eid="1SA 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 4:14" />Ele ngajhoina lilobhe lya kilelo, ngakonyita, “Bho, njobhelo jhenio jha kilebhe ghane?” Nkomana ngondo jhola ngajhahwila kajhombe kwa Ele kupala kunnobholela malobhe ghenio. <verse eid="1SA 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 4:15" />Kipinde chenio, mpiya litambiko Ele akibha na yaka makome ticha na nane na miho ghake ghakojhokine. <verse eid="1SA 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 4:16" />Nkomana ngondo jhola ngannobholila Ele, “Ngoheno nhumii kungondo, ndilite kuhumii kwenio.” Ele ngankonyita,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 4:16">“Nike kipitii kwenio mwanango?” <verse eid="1SA 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 4:17" />Nkomana ngondo jhola ngajhangwila, “Akaichilahele bhatilite Akafilichite. Na akakomana ngondo ngoo bhawile, kabhele na yana ino Hofini na Fineache bhakomitwe na Akafilichite bhalitoile Lichanduko lya Lilaghano lya Bhambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="1SA 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 4:18" />Nkomana ngondo jwenio palongila nhwalo gwa lichanduko lya lilaghano lya Bhambo Chapanga, Ele ngagwila luhangalaghajhe kuhumii pakigoda chake pupele jha litangala. Yene, ntandala gwake ngaudunywika dunyu nhwalo akaghogholwike hake helahela nankendao, ngajhomokila papa. Ele akibha ntemula jwa Akaichilahele kwa yaka makome ncheche.<verse eid="1SA 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwe kwa nhwanamundo Fineache</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 4:19" />Kamwanamundo Ele, nhwana gwa Fineache, akibha na ndumbo na akabhandikii kupapa. Pajhoina kubhehe Lichanduko lya Lilaghano lya Bhambo Chapanga lipukilwe kwa makakala na nkohano mundo na unganamundo bhajhomwike, papa ngakamwilwa na lipyanda, nukupapa nambo akibha na lipyanda likolongwa. <verse eid="1SA 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 4:20" />Mwikeghe jwenio pakibha mukujhomoka, akakunga bhibhantangatila ngabhannobholila, “Mangajhoghopa jhe, nhwalo mpapite mwana munalome.” Nambo jwenie akajhangwi jhe hilu kwajhokanikiya. <verse eid="1SA 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 4:21" />Mwana jwenio ngantinita liina lyake Ikabode, mana ghake, “Ung'alicho gwa Bhambo Chapanga ubhokite ku Ichililahele,” ku nhwalo gwa kupukilwa kwa Lichanduko lya Lilaghano lya Bhambo Chapanga na malelo gha nkohanomundo na unganamundo. <verse eid="1SA 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 4:22" />Ngalongila, “Ung'alicho gwa Bhambo Chapanga ubhokite ku Ichilahele, nhwalo Lichanduko lya Lilaghano lya Bhambo Chapanga lipukilwe kwa makakala.”<verse eid="1SA 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1SA 5" />
  <para style="s">Lichanduko lya Lilaghano pakate jha Akafilichite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 5:1" />Akafilichite pubhalipukila kwa makakala Lichanduko lya Lilaghano lya Bhambo Chapanga, ngabhaligheghita kuhumii ku muche gwa Ebenezeli ngabhalipelika ade kumuche gwabhe gwa Ashidodi. <verse eid="1SA 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 5:2" />Peniya, ngabhalijhingicha Lichanduko lya Lilaghano lya Bhambo Chapanga munyumba jha kichapanga gwabhe jwakemitwa Dagoni nukulibheka pahina jha kichapanga Dagoni. <verse eid="1SA 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 5:3" />Lichiko lilikengime putepute, bhando bhuku Ashidodi pibhajhimwika ngabhakihweina kichapanga cha Dagoni kigwile mangukama nnonge jha Lichanduko lya Lilaghano lya Bhambo Chapanga. Ngabhakijhinwila kabhele kichapanga chabhe cha Dagoni nukukibheka chehemo jhake pikikibha. <verse eid="1SA 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 5:4" />Nambo lichiko lilikengima lukela, pibhajhimwika, ngabhakihweina kichapanga cha Dagoni kigwii mangukama nnonge jha Lichanduko lya Lilaghano lya Bhambo Chapanga! Muto na magholo na mabhoko gha kichapanga chenio ghametukine, nukugholoka mu heke jha nnyango. Kiwiliwili tu ndi chikihighilile mu kichapanga chenio. <verse eid="1SA 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 5:5" />Ndi nhwalo ade deleno akapiya matambiko bha Dagoni na bhando bhoha bhuku Ashidodi, pibhajhingii mu nyumba jha Dagoni kunyinamila, bhilebhete jhe kikolamino cha jha nyumba jhenio ade deleno kwenio ku Ashidodi.<verse eid="1SA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 5:6" />Bhambo Chapanga ngabhachwapwila hake bhando bhuku Ashidodi na bhando bha pahina jhabhe, ku kwalete ulwalo gwa mapute. <verse eid="1SA 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 5:7" />Bhando bhuku Ashidodi pighaweine ilebhe yenio, ngabhalongila, “Bhambo Chapanga jwa Akaichilahele atuchwapuu hake twenga pamonga na Chapanga gwito Dagoni. Ngohe, Lichanduko lya Lilaghano lya Bhambo Chapanga lihoto jhe kutama kwito.” <verse eid="1SA 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 5:8" />Bhahe, ngabhakemita ilongoche bhoha bha Akafilichite na kwakonya, “Bho, natutenda bho na Lichanduko lende lya Chapanga jwa Akaichilahele?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 5:8">Bheniya ngabhajhangwila, “Lichanduko lyenio lya Chapanga jwa Akaichilahele milipeleka ku Gati.” Bhahe, na bheniya ngabhalipeleka ku muche gwa ku Gati.<verse eid="1SA 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 5:9" />Nambo pibhalihamichila lichanduko lyenio ku Gati, Bhambo Chapanga ngauchwapwila muche gwenio, ngabhatweliya kiholo, na ngabhachwapwila akanalome bha muche gwenio, ingombo kwa ighogholo, ku kwalete mapute. <verse eid="1SA 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 5:10" />Bhahe, ngabhalipelika Lichanduko lyenio lya Bhambo Chapanga ku muche gwa Ekiloni. Nambo Lichanduko lyenio pilihikita kwenio, bhando bha muche gwenio, ngabhalelita kanonowa kukulonge, “Bhatuletii Lichanduko lya Bhambo Chapanga jwa Akaichilahele, kupala kutukoma twenga na bhando bhito.” <verse eid="1SA 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 5:11" />Peniya, ngabhakemita kabhele ilongoche ya Akafilichite nukulonge, “Milibhujhiche Lichanduko lya Bhambo Chapanga jwa Akaichilahele kwatoila, kupala likoto kutukoma twenga pamonga na bhando bhito.” Bhalongila yene ku nhwalo pakibha na kiholo kikolongwa pa muche gwoha, nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga abhachwapwila hake. <verse eid="1SA 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 5:12" />Bhando bhamahele ngabhawila, na ata bhibhahighilike, ngabhalalitwa mapute nukulela kwabhe ngakujhokonikika kwa ichapanga yabhe, kupala kwatangatila.<verse eid="1SA 5:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1SA 6" />
  <para style="s">Lichanduko lya lilaghano libhujhichwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 6:1" />Bhahe, Lichanduko lya Bhambo Chapanga pulikibha litamite mu kilambo cha Akafilichite kwa myehe chaba, <verse eid="1SA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 6:2" />Akafilichite ngabhakemita akapiya matambiko bha Dagoni na bhibhalondola na kwakonya, “Bho, natutenda bhole na Lichanduko lende lya Bhambo Chapanga? Tulobholela, natubhujhicha bhole kola kulikibha?”<verse eid="1SA 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 6:3" />Bheniya ngabhajhangwila, “Anda mibhujhicha Lichanduko lya Chapanga jwa Ichilahele mangabhujhicha jhe changa kilebhe. Nambo mmujhicha na litambiko lya kupepulila malemwa, na mangota nanama mpepula malemwa gwino. Na mangota nambangatuka kilebhe chikintei nchwapulilwe changa kotoka.”<verse eid="1SA 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 6:4" />Bhando ngabhakonyita, “Natupeleka litambiko ghane?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 6:4">Bheniya ngabhajhangwila, “Inyagho nhwano ya chaabo ibhii ngita mapute, na inyagho nhwano ya chaabo jhiibhi ngita makule, kila chimo kilangii kilongoche jhumo jwa Akafilichite, nhwalo ulwalo ghoghogho ghunwalita ndi ghubhalalitwa ilongoche ino.”<verse eid="1SA 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 6:5" />Ntendekeya inyagho ya mapute na inyagho ya makule ghighahangabhana kila kilebhe mu kilambo chino. Na mangota munyokonikiye Chapanga jwa Akaichilahele, pange naleka kunchwapula mangota na ichapanga ino na kilambo chino. <verse eid="1SA 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 6:6" />Kilebhe ghane mibhehe na lighoho ngita bhando bhuku Michile na munahota nkolongwa Falao? Bho, Chapanga pabhachwapwila kanonowa aka Michile bhakalekekii jhe Akaichilahele bhabhoke, nabheniya ngabhabhokita? <verse eid="1SA 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 6:7" />Ngohe, nnenganikiya mutuka nhyono jhihutwa na ng'ombi na ng'ombi bhabhele bhibhapapite na bhangakongwa lingolengole. Makongelela mutuka jhihutwa na ng'ombi yenio, nambo matohe ghabhe madindila mukibhajha. <verse eid="1SA 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 6:8" />Ntolangana Lichanduko lya Bhambo Chapanga na mulibheka mumutuka yenio jhukuhutwa. Mupele jha Lichanduko lyenio, mmekangana inyagho ya chaabo yenio imimpelekela ngita litambiko lya kupepulila malemwa gwino. Peniya, ileka ng'ombi ijhende kwokwoha kuipala kulipeleka. <verse eid="1SA 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 6:9" />Nambo mwilolekeya anda mutuka jhenio ipelekwa chomola mu kilambo chuku Bete shemeshi, peniya natumanya kubhehe jwatuletii ulwalo gwenio gwa matumbo ndi Chapanga jwa Akaichilahele. Nambo anda lipelekwa jhe kwenio, bhahe, natumanya kubhehe Bhambo Chapanga jhe jwatuchwapwile, nambo ndi malwalo ngita malwalo ghange.<verse eid="1SA 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 6:10" />Ngabhateila ngita chibhalaghilwa, ngabhatoila ng'ombi ibhele ijhongecha nu kwakonga mu mutuka jhenio jhukuhutwa, na matohe ghabhe ngabhadindila mukibhajha. <verse eid="1SA 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 6:11" />Ngabhalibhekita Lichanduko lya Bhambo Chapanga lela mu mutuka jhenio pamonga na kichanduko cha inyagho hela ya chaabo ya makule na hela ya mapute. <verse eid="1SA 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 6:12" />Peniya, ng'ombi yenio ngaijhahwila chomola ku muche gwa Bete shemeshi changa lyangatika lubhoko lwa ngejha hilu lwalelo, ipetita kumeta ndela jhoha. Ilongoche ya Akafilichite ngabhakengima unyuma ng'ombi yenio ade kumpaka gwa ku Bete shemeshi.<verse eid="1SA 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 6:13" />Bhando bhuku Bete shemeshi bhakibha bhahunita ngano yabhe mu lulambo. Pibhajhinwila miho ghabhe ngabhalibhona Lichanduko lya Bhambo Chapanga, ngabhahangina hake. <verse eid="1SA 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 6:14" />Mutuka jhenio jhihutwa na ng'ombi ngaijhawila ade kunng'onda gwa Yochuwa, nkola muche jwa ku Bete shemeshi, ngalijhemita papa, pahina na lighanga likolongwa. Bhando ngabhaihangabhina mutuka yenio, na mbau yake ngabhatumila kuikomelekela ng'ombi yenio ngita litambiko lya kukomelekelwa kwa Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="1SA 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 6:15" />Akalabhe ngabhalihulwiya lichanduko lya Bhambo Chapanga, pamonga na lela lichanduko lya inyagho ya chaabo nukwibheka ilebhe yenio pa lighanga likolongwa. Lichiko lyenio bhando bhuku Bete shemeshi ngabhapiya matambiko ghu kukomelekelwa mbwe, nu matambiko ghange. <verse eid="1SA 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 6:16" />Akanahota akakolongwa nhwano bhala bha Akafilichite pibhalolita gheniya, ngabhakelewika ku Ekiloni, lichiko lele.<verse eid="1SA 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 6:17" />Akafilichite ngabhaipelika inyagho yenio nhwano ya chaabo ya mapute kwa Bhambo Chapanga, kupala ibhaha litambiko li kupepulila malemwa gwabhe, kila kinyagho chimo kunhwalo jha muche ghumo, yane muche gwa Ashidodi na muche gwa Gacha na muche gwa Ashikilone na muche gwa Gati na muche gwa Ekiloni. <verse eid="1SA 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 6:18" />Helehela ngabhapelika inyagho nhwano ya makule gha chaabo tela na echabo jha miche jhoha jhilongwichwa na akanahota akakolongwa nhwano ya Akafilichite. Miche yenio ikibha na maboma pamonga na chenda yangatindikiwa mapamanda. Lindalabho lela likolongwa munng'onda gwa Yochuwa jhuku Bete Shemeshi ndi chehemo libhapelika Lichanduko lya Bhambo Chapanga ndi ukombocho gwa kilebhe chenio ade deleno.<verse eid="1SA 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 6:19" />Nambo Bhambo Chapanga ngabhakomita akolo kilambo chabine bha muche gwa ku Bete shemeshi, ku nhwalo bhakalingulii nkate jha lichanduko lya Lilaghano. Bhando ngabhalelita kunhwalo gwa Bhambo Chapanga abhakomite bhando ngoo pakate jhabhe.<verse eid="1SA 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lichanduko lya Bhambo Chapanga kwenio ku Kiliate yealimo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 6:20" />Peniya, akolo muche bhuku Bete shemeshi ngabhakonyita, “Bho, meneke jwahoto kujhema nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jhonjo jwa nyahinyahi? Lichanduko nalijhenda kwa ghane kupala libhoka pamba?” <verse eid="1SA 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 6:21" />Peniya, ngabhatumita bhando kujhenda ku Kiliate yealimo kukulonge, “Akafilichite bhalibhujhiche Lichanduko lya Lilaghano lya Bhambo Chapanga. Nhwikengane mulitole.”<verse eid="1SA 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1SA 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 7:1" />Peniya, bhando bhuku Kiliate yealimo ngabhajhahwila nukutola Lichanduko lya Bhambo Chapanga. Ngabhalipelika ku nyumba jha Abinadabo, jwatamita pa kitombe. Ngabhammekita kwa lihengo lya Bhambo Chapanga, mwana mundo Eleazali, kulijhemelela lichanduko lya Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="1SA 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chamwele ilongocha ku Ichilahele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 7:2" />Lichanduko lya Bhambo Chapanga, ngalihighilika ku Kiliate yealimo kwa machiko twee, ngita makome mabhele gha yaka. Kipinde choha Akaichilahele bhannelila Bhambo Chapanga abhatangatile.<verse eid="1SA 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 7:3" />Chamwele ngabhalobholila bhando bhuku Ichilahele, “Anda mmujhii Bhambo Chapanga kwa mwojho gwino gwoha, mipalwa miitaghila kutale ichapanga ino na inyagho ya Ashitalote. Mikipiye kwa Bhambo Chapanga ku mwojho gwoha, nakuntumikila jwenie kanjika, jwenie nankombola kuhuma muulongoche gwa Akafilichite.” <verse eid="1SA 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 7:4" />Yene, Akaichilahele ngabhataghila okwe ichapanga ya Baale na Maashitalote na ngabhantumikila Bhambo Chapanga kajhika.<verse eid="1SA 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 7:5" />Chamwele ngabhalobhilila Akaichilahele bhoha bhakongane kwenio ku Misipa, ngabhalobholila, “Kwenio chaninnyopa Bhambo Chapanga kunhwalo gwino.” <verse eid="1SA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 7:6" />Pibhakongina kwenio ku Misipa, ngabhatekita mache nu kughajhita ngita litambiko palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, lichiko lyenio ngabhalekita kulye nukulonge, “Tutei uhakaho nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga.” Kipinde chenio Chamwele akibha ntemula jwa Akaichilahele kwenio ku Misipa.<verse eid="1SA 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 7:7" />Akafilichite pubhajhoina kubhehe Akaichilahele bhakonganike kwenio ku Misipa, akanahota akakolongwa nhwano bha Akafilichite ngabhajhahwila kwajhingilila. Akaichilahele pibhajhoina nhwalo gwenio ngabhajhogwipa Akafilichite. <verse eid="1SA 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 7:8" />Ngabhannobholila Chamwele, “Manga leka jhe kunnele Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwito, kunhwalo gwito. Jhendelela kunnelela kupala atughombole kubhoka muulongoche gwa Akafilichite.” <verse eid="1SA 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 7:9" />Peniya, Chamwele ngatoila litohe lya limbelele, ngampiikiya Bhambo Chapanga, ngita litambiko lyu kukomelekelwa. Chamwele ngannelila Bhambo Chapanga kunhwalo jha Ichilahele, na jwenie Chapanga ngajhoina kulela kwabhe. <verse eid="1SA 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 7:10" />Chamwele papiita litambiko lyenio lyu kukomelekelwa, Akafilichite ngibhabhandikila kwajhingilila Akaichilahele. Nambo lichiko lela Bhambo Chapanga ngalindimila ngita mbamba pakate jha Akafilichite nu kwatenda bhabhoghanike na bhene ngabhabhengitwa nnonge jha Akaichilahele. <verse eid="1SA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 7:11" />Akaichilahele ngabhabhokita ku Misipa, nu kwakengamila Akafilichite ade pahina na muche gwa Betekale, ngabhakomela undela pulutu.<verse eid="1SA 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 7:12" />Peniya, Chamwele ngatoila lighanga nu kulijhemeka pakate jha Misipa na Sheni. Ngalikemita lighanga lyenio Ebenezeli, yane, “Bhambo Chapanga atutangatile ade ngohe.” <verse eid="1SA 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 7:13" />Bhahe, Akafilichite ngabhalepilila, na bhakakijhingili jhe kabhele kilambo cha Ichilahele kwa kipinde choha chu ughome gwa Chamwele. <verse eid="1SA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 7:14" />Miche jhoha jha Akaichilahele jhipukilwe na Akafilichite kuhumii ku Ekiloni ade ku Gati, ngibhujhichwa kwa Akaichilahele na bheniya Akaichilahele ngabhaghombwila kilambo chabhe kuhumii kwa Akafilichite. Kabhele pakibha nu uteeke pakate jha Ichilahele na Akaamole.<verse eid="1SA 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 7:15" />Chamwele ngajhendilila kubhehe ntemula jwa Akaichilahele machiko ghoha gwa ughome gwake. <verse eid="1SA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 7:16" />Kila chaka Chamwele ngatyangila ku Beteli na ku Giligali na ku Misipa nu kwakenga Akaichilahele pakate jha miche jhenie jhoha. <verse eid="1SA 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 7:17" />Peniya, akibha akelewika ku muche gwa ku Lama, nhwalo kukibha kajhake. Kwenio hele abhakengilila Akaichilahele na nganchengila Bhambo Chapanga chehemo jhu kupiikiya litambiko kwenio.<verse eid="1SA 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1SA 8" />
  <para style="s">Akaichilahele bhijhopa munahota nkolongwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 8:1" />Chamwele pakibha aghogholwike, ngaitenda yana yake inalome kubhehe akakenga bhuku Ichilahele. <verse eid="1SA 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 8:2" />Mwana jwa litibho jwa Chamwele akemitwa Yoele, na jhonge akemitwa Abiya. Bhoha bhabhele bhakibha akakenga bhuku muche gwa ku Beya Sheba. <verse eid="1SA 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 8:3" />Nambo yana yenio bhatehila jhe ngita chatehila tate gwabhe, nambo ngabhakipalikiya kubhehe niilebhe mbwe. Ngabhapokila chwinda nu kwajhima bhange ghighapalwa kutendelwa.<verse eid="1SA 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 8:4" />Peniya, ilongoche yoha yuku Ichilahele ngabhakonganika, nukunnyendela Chamwele, kwenio ku Lama,<verse eid="1SA 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 8:5" />ngabhannobholila, “Mwe ngohe ng'ogholwike na yana ino bhalekite luhomo lwino. Yene mutuhaghulile munahota nkolongwa jwakutulongocha ngita chiibhi ilambo henge.” <verse eid="1SA 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 8:6" />Nambo kilebhe chenio cha Akaichilahele kupala bhapelwe munahota nkolongwa jwa kwalongocha kikanhalaliche jhe Chamwele. Na jwenie nganyopita Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="1SA 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 8:7" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Chamwele, “Nnyokonikiya kila kilebhe chibha nnobholela bhando, nhwalo bhankanite mwe jhe, nambo bhanganite nenga kubhehe munahota nkolongwa gwabhe. <verse eid="1SA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 8:8" />Kuhumii panabhoita ku kilambo chuku Michile, bhanekite nenga, bhajhendilii kuitumikii ichapanga henge ade ngohe. Ngohe itendwa ibhandendila nenga ndi ibhantende mwenga. <verse eid="1SA 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 8:9" />Bhahe, majhokonikiya, nambo, mapwatalila hake na malobholela hotuhotu kwa ghala ghapakwatendela munahota nkolongwa jhapakwalongocha.”<verse eid="1SA 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 8:10" />Ndi Chamwele ngabhalobholila bhando bhala bhibhajhopita bhapelwe munahota nkolongwa malobhe ghoha ghalobholilwa na Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="1SA 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 8:11" />Chamwele ngabhalobholila, “Naha ndi munahota nkolongwa gwino jwapala kunnongocha chantendela, yana ino inalome nabhatenda ijhendecha mutuka yake ya ngondo, ihutwa na falache na bhange bhahobhokii falache na bhange bhabhutuka mbelo nnonge jha mutuka yake. <verse eid="1SA 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 8:12" />Na bhange nabhabheka kubhehe ilongoche ikolongwa ya akakomana ngondo bha kikunde cha bhando maelufo, na bhange kikunde cha bhando amchine na bhange kulema mighonda jhake nukuhuna mahuno ghake, na helahela bhange kutendekeya chilaha ya ngondo na bhange kutendekeya ilebhe kunhwalo gwa mutuka yake. <verse eid="1SA 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 8:13" />Achikabhale bhino nabhatengenecha mahuta ghukunungalila petelele kunhwalo gwake na bhange nabhabhaha bhukuteleka kunhwalo gwake na bhange bhukutengenecha mabumunda kunhwalo gwake. <verse eid="1SA 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 8:14" />Natola mighonda ino jhibholile, mighonda jha michabibo, na mighonda jhino ya micheitune nukwape akatumiche bhake. <verse eid="1SA 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 8:15" />Helahela natola chehemo jha lipungo lya kome lya mahuno ghino na gha chabibo ino nukwape ilongoche yake na akatumiche bhake bhibhahenga mahengo mu nyumba jhake jhikinahota nkolongwa. <verse eid="1SA 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 8:16" />Natola akatumiche bhino akanalome na akakeghe na ng'ombi ino ihatite na maponda ghino kwatenda bhatumike kwa kunhenge mahengo ghake. <verse eid="1SA 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 8:17" />Natola chehemo jha lipungo lya kome lya mambelele na mbuhe ino. Na mabhene namma akabhanda bhake. <verse eid="1SA 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 8:18" />Kipinde chenio, nankokoleka kunhwalo gwa munahota nkolongwa jhumikihaghulile mabhene. Nambo Bhambo Chapanga nannyokanikiya jhe.”<verse eid="1SA 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 8:19" />Ata yene bhando ngabhakana kunnyokonikiya Chamwele, nabhalongila, “Naijhe! Twe tupala munahota nkolongwa jwa kutulongocha, <verse eid="1SA 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 8:20" />kupala natwenga tubhehe ngita ilambo henge. Munahota nkolongwa gwito kutulongocha nu helahela kutulongocha nu kutukomanila putujhenda ku ngondo hito.” <verse eid="1SA 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 8:21" />Chamwele pajhomolila kujhokonikiya kila kilebhe chibhalongila, ngajhenda kunnobholela Bhambo Chapanga ghala ghoha ghibhalongila. <verse eid="1SA 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 8:22" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Chamwele, “Ajhokanikiya na bhapela munahota nkolongwa.” Peniya, Chamwele ngabhalobholila Akaichilahele, kila jhumo akelebhuka kajhake.<verse eid="1SA 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1SA 9" />
  <para style="s">Sauli ikongana na Chamwele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 9:1" />Mu likabila lya Benjamine pakibha na mundo jhumo jhuna ilebhe mbwe na jwamanyikine hake jwakemitwa Kishi. Jwenio Kishi akibha mwana jwa Abiele, tatemundo akibha Zelo, jwapapitwe na Bekolati, mwana jwa Afiya, jwa likabila lya Benjamine. <verse eid="1SA 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 9:2" />Kishi akibha na mwana munalome jwakemitwa Sauli. Jwenio akibha kangombo jwa lembulembu hake, akibha jhe jwalandina nako pakate jha Akaichilahele, akibha ntandamaho kuliku Akaichilahele bhange.<verse eid="1SA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 9:3" />Lichiko limo maponda gha Kishi, tate mundo Sauli, ngaghahobhalila. Yene Kishi ngannobholela Sauli mwana mundo, “Muntole jhumo jwa akatumiche nnyende nako makapalahe maponda.” <verse eid="1SA 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 9:4" />Ngabhapaliya kukilambo cha itombe ya Efulaimo na chehemo jha Shalisha nambo bhakaghakolii jhe. Helahela ngabhahikita ku kilambo chiitombe yane Shalimo, hele bhakaghakoli jhe kwenio. Ngabhajhendilila kwapalaha kukilambo cha Akabenjamine helahela bhakaghawe jhe kwenio. <verse eid="1SA 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 9:5" />Pibhahikita kukilambo cha Sufu, Sauli ngannobholila jhola jwalongohina nako, “Hika tukelebhuke ukajha anda nai jhe tate gwango naleka kughahwachi maponda, nabhaha ngolongonde kutuhwachi twenga.”<verse eid="1SA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 9:6" />Ntumiche jhola ngajhangwila, “Denda pandina, pamuche ghongo abhii mundo jwa Bhambo Chapanga jwajhokanikilwa hake na kila chalonge kibhe chakaka. Ngohe tunnyendelele pange ahoto kutulobholela mwanja gwito tujhingilila kojhe.”<verse eid="1SA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 9:7" />Sauli ngankonyita ntumiche jwake, “Anda tunnyendelile natumpela nike? Dola chakulya mulihako lito kijhomwike na kibhii jhe kilebhe chochoha chukumpela mundo jwenio jwa Chapanga. Bho tukwete nike?”<verse eid="1SA 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 9:8" />Ntumiche jhola ngannyangwila kabhele Sauli, “Dola, ngwete chente jhimo njokombe jha madine gha feza ncheche jha mbijha. Nanimpela jwenio mundo jwa Chapanga kupala atulobholele tujhingilila ndela ghane mwanja gwito.” <verse eid="1SA 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 9:9" />Makacho bhando bhuku Ichilahele anda mundo ajhenda kukonyekeya nhwalo kwa Chapanga ilonge naha, “Tijha kwa mundo jwalondola. Nhwalo mundo jwakemwa nnondole machiko ghanga, kipinde chenio akemitwa nnondola.” <verse eid="1SA 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 9:10" />Sauli ngannyangwila ntumiche jwake, “Chakaka nnongi maha, ajha, tijhende.” Yene ngabhajhenda ku muche gwatamita mundo jhola jwa Chapanga. <verse eid="1SA 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 9:11" />Pibhahowika kitombe kujhenda kubomane, ngabhakongina na achikabhale bhibhajhenda kuteka mache kukilibha, ngabhakonyita achikabhale bheniya, “Bho, nnondola abhii pa bomane?” <verse eid="1SA 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 9:12" />Achikabhale bhala ngabhajhangwila, “Abhile.” Abhii nnonge jhino, anda nnyombihine namunkolela. Ajhingii pabomane pito deleno, nhwalo bhando nabhapiya litambiko, kwenio kukitombe. <verse eid="1SA 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 9:13" />Papa tu pumpakujhingii pabomane, namunkolela kabula anajhenda jhe chehemo jhu kujhinamila kukitombe, kupala kulyegha. Bhando nabhalya jhe ade papakuhika, nhwalo ipalwa atumbula kuipe mota yakutambikila, ndi bhala bhibhalalikwe nabhalya pamonga na bhando bhibhabhii pena. Yene, nhobhokane ngohe, namkolela chaa jhenje. <verse eid="1SA 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 9:14" />Sauli na ntumiche gwake ngabhajhenda pa bomane, pibhajhingila pa bomane ngabhamweina Chamwele, akahumila ku bomane ahika kubhabhile, akijhendila pi kitombe pu kujhinamila.<verse eid="1SA 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 9:15" />Bhahe, lichiko limo, kabula jhu kuhika Sauli pabomane, Bhambo Chapanga akannobholile Chamwele nhwalo gwa Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 9:16" />“Kilabho, kipinde ngita chenje, naninetela mundo kuhumii mu kilambo cha likabila lya Benjamine, namwenga namumpakaya mahuta kubhehe kilongoche jwa bhando bhango bhuku Ichilahele. Jwenio nabhaghombola bhando bhango kuhumii kwa Akafilichite, nhwalo nighawene mang'ahe gha bhando bhango, na kulela kwabhe nikujhohine.” <verse eid="1SA 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 9:17" />Chamwele pakongina tu na Sauli, Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila, “Jhonjo ndi jhola mundo jhuninnobholila jwapakwalongocha bhando bhango Akaichilahele.” <verse eid="1SA 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 9:18" />Sauli nganheghelila Chamwele palitangala lya muche nu kunnobholela, “Chonde unangiye nyumba jha jwalola mihalo jha bhando nukwalobholela.”<verse eid="1SA 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 9:19" />Chamwele nganyangwila, “Ne ndi jwanilola. Nnongolele kujhenda chehemo jhukujhinamila, nhwalo deleno nanyakila pamonga na nenga na kilabho lukela machwale ghino ghoha naninnyangula. <verse eid="1SA 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 9:20" />Nkoto kubhehe na kiholo kwa maponda ghino ghighahobhalile machiko matato ghighapetite, ghabhonikine njwe. Nambo ghane jhola jhubhampai hake Akaichilahele, bho, mwe ndeka na nyumba jha tate gwino?”<verse eid="1SA 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 9:21" />Sauli ngajhangwila, “Nenga jwa likabila lya Benjamine, likabila lichokombe kupeta makabila ghoha gha ku Ichilahele. Na mu likabila lyoha lya Akabenjamine, akalongo bhango ndi bhachokombe hake. Kwanike unnobholele kilebhe ngita chenio?”<verse eid="1SA 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 9:22" />Peniya, Chamwele ngampelika Sauli na ntumiche jwake pa udamo, ngabhabheka chehemo jha ichima, kwenio akaghene bhibhalalikwe bhakibha bhatamita, pakibha na akaghene bhibhahikii makome matato. <verse eid="1SA 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 9:23" />Chamwele ngannobholila mundo jwateleka, “Deta kipande cha unoho ghola ghunimpila, jhela jhinnobholila miibheka pakanjika.” <verse eid="1SA 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 9:24" />Jwateleka jhola ngajhenda kutola libhondo lyoha, nu kubheka nnonge jha Sauli. Ndi Chamwele ngannobholila Sauli, “Dola chenje ndi chikibhekitwe ku nhwalo gwino. Memena nyama jhenje ibhekitwe kunhwalo gwino, kupala mmemena pamonga na akaghene.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 9:24">Yene Sauli ngalila pamonga na Chamwele lichiko lyenio.<verse eid="1SA 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 9:25" />Pibhahelila kubhoke chehemo jhukujhinamila pikitombe nukubhujha kubomane, Chamwele ngannenganikiya Sauli pukugholoka pa dale,<verse eid="1SA 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 9:26" />na jwenie ngagholwika kwenio.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="1SA 9:26">Chamwele impaka mahuta Sauli Pubhajhimwika lukela putepute, Chamwele ngankemita Sauli kubhoke ku dale, “Jhimuka mukilenganikiye, kupala nichindikiche nkelebhuke ukajha.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 9:26">Sauli ngajhimwika, jwenio na Chamwele ngabhabhokita nukujhenda kundela. <verse eid="1SA 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 9:27" />Pubhahikita pujhomoke muche, Chamwele ngannobholila Sauli, “Munobholele kangombo jwenio alongelela nnonge jhito.” Kangombo pabhokita Chamwele ngajhendilila kulonge, “Dendela kandina ne naninchimulila ghala ghalongila Chapanga.”<verse eid="1SA 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1SA 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 10:1" />Ndi Chamwele ngatoila likopo lya mahuta, ngamiminila Sauli pamuto, ngankumbatila nukunnobholela, “Bhambo Chapanga ampaki mahuta kupala mme makilongoche kwa bhando bhake Akaichilahele.” <verse eid="1SA 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 10:2" />Deleno pitupa kutabhukana, nankongana na bhando bhabhele pahina na mambe jha Lahele, kwenio ku Selisa kukilambo cha Benjamine, bheniya nabhannobholela maponda ghala ghimpaliya, ghabhonikine. Tate gwino alekite kuhwachi panane jha maponda, nambo kiholo chake panane jhino, kila kipinde akikonya, “Bho, naibhabho kwa mwanango?” <verse eid="1SA 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 10:3" />Kubhoke peniya, nunnyenda ade ku nkongo nkolongwa gwa mwalone gwa Tabole, chehemo jhenio nankongana na akanalome bhatato bhibhajhenda kumpiikiya Bhambo Chapanga litambiko, kwenio ku Beteli. Jhumo akamwii matohe matato gha mbuhe na jhonge agheghite mabumunda matato na jhu utato agheghite lihako lya divaye. <verse eid="1SA 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 10:4" />“Bheniya nabhannyambucha nukumpe mabumunda mabhele, na mwenga nampokela. <verse eid="1SA 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 10:5" />Pumpa kubhoka peniya, nannyenda ade ku muche gwa ku Gibeya elohimo, kitombe cha Chapanga, chehemo jhibhii na kighono cha Akafilichite, pumpa kubhandikii litangala lya muche, nankongana na nchambe gwa akalondola. Bheniya bhihelela kuhumii kukitombe chehemo jhu kujhinamila, kongo bhikihona inube na ng'oma na itolilo na lipenenga, nabhabha bhitenda kulotela. <verse eid="1SA 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 10:6" />Uhuke gwa Bhambo Chapanga naunhikila kwa makakala, na mwenga nannondola pamonga na bheniya nu kughalambulwa kubhehe mundo jhonge. <verse eid="1SA 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 10:7" />Kipinde pighapakubhonekana kwino, chochoha chumihoto kuhenga kihenga, nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga abhii pamonga na mwenga. <verse eid="1SA 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 10:8" />Naunongolela kujhenda kubomane ku Giligali, chehemo panipa kunkolela nukupiya matambiko ghu kukomelekelwa na matambiko ghu uteeke. Naunendelela peniya kwa kipinde cha machiko chaba ade pumbakuhika nukunnobholela limipalwa kutenda.”<verse eid="1SA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 10:9" />Sauli paghalambwika kupala anneke Chamwele, Bhambo Chapanga ngaghalambwiya mwojho gwa Sauli. Na ghala ghoha ghachimulilwe na Chamwele ngaghapitila lichiko lyenio. <verse eid="1SA 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 10:10" />Sauli na ntumiche gwake pubhahikita ku muche gwaku Gibeya, ngapokililwa na nchambe gwa akalondole. Uhuke gwa Chapanga ngunhikila kwa makakala, na jwenie ngalondwila pamonga na bheniya. <verse eid="1SA 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 10:11" />Bhando bhibhammanyita Sauli, pibhammonita palondwila, ngabhakonyina bhene chika, “Bho, kilebhe ghane kinkolii mwana jwa Kishi? Bho, Sauli najwenio ndi pakate jha akalondole?” <verse eid="1SA 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 10:12" />Mundo jhumo, nkolo muche gwa chehemo jhenio, ngakonyita, “Bho, tate gwabhe ndi ghane?” Yene ngalupitila luhomo lulonge, “Bho, ata Sauli ndi nnondole?” <verse eid="1SA 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 10:13" />Sauli pajhomolila kulondola, ngajhenda chehemo pi kitombe chukujhinamila.<verse eid="1SA 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 10:14" />Tate mundo unung'una ngankonyita Sauli na ntumiche gwake, “Bho, makibha kojhe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 10:14">Sauli ngajhangwila, “Twakibha tupaliya maponda. Nambo tukaghawe jhe, yene ngatujhenda kwa Chamwele.” <verse eid="1SA 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 10:15" />Tate mundo unung'una ngannobholila Sauli, “Chonde, unobholele chela channobholile Chamwele.”<verse eid="1SA 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 10:16" />Sauli ngajhangwila, “Ngatulobholila hotuhotu kubhehe maponda ghabhonikine.” Nambo Sauli akannobholi jhe tatemundo unung'una kubhehe Chamwele annobholile nabhaha munahota nkolongwa.<verse eid="1SA 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sauli itangachwa kubhehe munahota nkolongwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 10:17" />Chamwele ngabhakemita pamonga bhando, bhuku Ichilahele nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, kwenio ku Misipa. <verse eid="1SA 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 10:18" />Pubhahikita ngabhalobholila, “Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jhuku Ichilahele, ilonge naha, ‘Nakabhoite Akaichilahele kukilambo chuku Michile, nganaghombwila kubhoke kwa Akamichile na unahota ghonge ugwang'ahicha.’ <verse eid="1SA 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 10:19" />Nambo deleno unganite nenga Bhambo Chapanga gwino, jhuninkombola kubhoke mu malagho na mu mang'ahe ghino, na mangota nnongi, Naijhe! Tuhaghulila munahota nkolongwa jwito atulongoche. Ngohe nhwikangana nnonge jhango kwa makabila ghino nakwa ngolo ino.”<verse eid="1SA 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 10:20" />Peniya, Chamwele ngakonganicha pamonga makabila ghoha ghuku Ichilahele, likabila lya Benjamine ndi ngalihaghulilwa kwa kihumbuumbu nnobhole. <verse eid="1SA 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 10:21" />Ngaliheghekiya nnonge likabila lya Benjamine, tela na ngolo yabhe, na lukolo lwa Matile nguhaghulilwa kwa kihumbuumbu nnobhole. Kujhomolela Sauli mwana jwa Kishi ngahaghulilwa kwa kihumbuumbu nnobhole. Nambo pibhampaliya, bhakamwe jhe. <verse eid="1SA 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 10:22" />Bhahe, ngabhajhendilila kunkonya Bhambo Chapanga, “Bho, mundo jwenio ahikite pamba?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 10:22">Bhambo Chapanga ngalongila, ahikite, Ajhobhite mu mihigho. <verse eid="1SA 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 10:23" />Ngabhabhutwika kajhombe nukunneta kubhoke kwenio, na pajhemita panakate jha bhando, akibha ntandamaho kupeta bhando bhoha. Bhando bhajhomokila mu mabhegha ghabhe. <verse eid="1SA 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 10:24" />Chamwele ngabhalobholila bhando bhoha, “Jhonjo ndi jwahaghulilwe na Bhambo Chapanga pakate jha bhando bhoha, abhii jhe jhojhoha jwabhii ngita jhonjo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 10:24">Ndi Bhando bhoha ngabhachobhila, kulonge, “Munahota nkolongwa atamikiya machiko ghoha ghangapeta.” <verse eid="1SA 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 10:25" />Peniya, Chamwele ngabhalobholila bhando mahengo na ukindendeke gwa munahota nkolongwa. Ngaghajhandika mu kitabo nukubheka palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. Chamwele ngabhatahwika bhando bhoha, kila mundo ajhenda kajhake. <verse eid="1SA 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 10:26" />Helahela Sauli ngajhenda kajhake, ku Gibeya, ngabhanchindikicha na bhando bhange bhangajhoghopa na bhina makakala, bheniya Bhambo Chapanga ngabhapila kilolo chukutenda yenio. <verse eid="1SA 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 10:27" />Nambo bhando bhange mandindilima ngabhalongila, “Bho, mundo jhonjo nahotola kutughombola?” Ngabhampuchita na bhakampii jhe hupo jhojhoha. Nambo Sauli akayomite jhe.<verse eid="1SA 10:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1SA 11" />
  <para style="s">Sauli abhahoto Akaamone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 11:1" />Peniya, munahota nkolongwa Nahashe jwa Akaamone, pamonga na akakomana ngondo bhake, ngajhenda kujhobhela muche gwa Yabeshi gileadi. Akolo muche bhuku Yabeshi gileadi ngabhannobholila Nahashi, “Tutende majheketelano na twenga, na twenga natuntumikila.” <verse eid="1SA 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 11:2" />Nambo Nahashi, ngabhalobholila, “Nandenda majheketelano na mangota kwa nhwilo ghumo, kila mundo naninkolopola liho limo lyu ulelo, yene nanatenda Akachilahele bhoha nanapechelecha.”<verse eid="1SA 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 11:3" />Ilongoche yuku Yabeshi ngabhannobholila, “Tunnyopa machiko chaba, kupala twatume bhando mu kilambo choha chuku Ichilahele. Anda apitii jhe mundo jhojhoha jhu kutughombola, tabhete natupomowa mu kindendeke kwino.”<verse eid="1SA 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 11:4" />Bhando bhala pubhahikita ku Gibeya, ku muche gwatama Sauli, ngabhachimulila bhando malobhe ghenio na bhando bhoha ngabhalelita kanonowa. <verse eid="1SA 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 11:5" />Kipinde chenio Sauli ahumita kunng'onda, kongo ahakita mankambako ghake, jwenie ngakonyita, “Bho, chakolii ni bhando bhamba? Kwanike bhilela?” Ngibhannobholila malobhe ghibhalongila bhando bhaku Yabeshi. <verse eid="1SA 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 11:6" />Sauli pajhohina kilebhe chenio, uhuke gwa Chapanga ngunhikila kwa makakala, na ngabhila nalilaka hake. <verse eid="1SA 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 11:7" />Sauli ngatoila makambako mabhele gha ng'ombi ngaghahanjina ipandeipande, ngatuma bhando bhaipeteche yoha mu kilambo choha chuku Ichilahele kukulonge, “Mundo jhojhoha jwapakuleka kunkengama Sauli na Chamwele ku ngondo, makambako ghake naghahekitwa helenaha.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 11:7">Kiholo cha Bhambo Chapanga, ijhakwajhingilila Akaichilahele, kunhwalo Bhambo Chapanga ngahotwi kutenda yene. Yene, bhando bhoha ngabhabhoka kwa pamonga. <verse eid="1SA 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 11:8" />Sauli pibhakonganicha Akaichilahele kwenio ku Bezeki, ngabhabhila bhando lake itato kubhoke ku Ichilahele na kuhumii ku Yuda bhakibha bhando elufo makome matato. <verse eid="1SA 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 11:9" />Sauli ngabhalobholila bhando bhala bhibhahikita kubhoke ku Yebeche, “Malobholela bhando bhuku Yabeshi gileadi, ‘Kilabho, lyobha nukubhangu jhe, nankombolelwa.’” Bhando bhala ngibhajhenda kwalobholela bhando bhuku Yabeche malobhe ghenio, nabheniya ngibhahangina hake. <verse eid="1SA 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 11:10" />Yene, bhando bha muche gwa Yabeshi ngabhannobholila Nahashi, “Kilabho natubhaha pahe jha kindendeke gwino, na mwenga namututendela chochoha chimipala.” <verse eid="1SA 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 11:11" />Lichiko lilikengima kilo, Sauli ngaghabhina bhando muibhogha itato. Kipinde cha chamo jha putepute, ngabhajhingila mu kighono cha Akaamone nukwachinja ade muhe. Bhala bhibhahighilika ngabhapechingina, bhakahotwii jhe ata kukongana bhando bhabhele pamonga.<verse eid="1SA 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 11:12" />Ndi Akaichilahele ngabhannobholila Chamwele, “Bhabhiko bhala bhibhalongila Sauli ihoto jhe kubhehe munahota nkolongwa gwito? Tuletela pamba bheniya na twenga natwakoma.”<verse eid="1SA 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 11:13" />Nambo Sauli ngabhalobholila, “Abhii jhe mundo jwapa kukomwa deleno, kunhwalo mu lichiko lende lya deleno, Bhambo Chapanga aghombwii aka Ichilahele.” <verse eid="1SA 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 11:14" />Ndi Chamwele ngabhalobholila bhando, “Hika, tijhangana ku Giligali, na kwenio natuntangacha Sauli kubhehe munahota nkolongwa jhuku Ichilahele.” <verse eid="1SA 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 11:15" />Yene, bhando bhoha ngabhajhenda ku Giligali, pubhahikita kwenio, ngabhantangicha Sauli kubhehe munahota nkolongwa, chehemo jhu kunnyinamii Bhambo Chapanga. Peniya, ngabhampiikiya Bhambo Chapanga matambiko ghu uteeke. Sauli na bhando bhoha bhuku Ichilahele, ngabhahangina hake.<verse eid="1SA 11:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1SA 12" />
  <para style="s">Chamwele abhatabhuka Akaichilahele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 12:1" />Chamwele ngabhalobholila Akaichilahele bhoha, “Nyokanikii kila kilebhe chumunobholila na nenga ninhimike munahota nkolongwa pakate jhino annongoche. <verse eid="1SA 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 12:2" />Ngohe, nkwete munahota nkolongwa jwa kunnongocha. Nambo nenga ng'ogholwike na mii na uliya, na yana yango ibhii pamba pamonga na mangota. Mii kilongoche gwino kuhumii muungombo ade deleno. <verse eid="1SA 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 12:3" />Nyemite pamba anda ndei kilebhe chochocha kibhoho bhahe, nnongela nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, na nnonge jha munahota nkolongwa gwake. Bho, ngwatwii ng'ombi likambako amu liponda lya mundo jhojhoha? Bho, nimponjite kilebhe mundo jhojhoha? Bho, ning'ahite mundo jhojhoha? Bho, mbokii chwinda kwa mundo jhojhoha, kupala nhadabula changa palwa? Anda ndehi yene, na nenga nanimmujhichila.”<verse eid="1SA 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 12:4" />Bhando ngabhannyangwila, “Kibhii jhe chimitukolwii amu kutung'ahicha, hilu kutola chochoha kwa mundo jhojhoha.”<verse eid="1SA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 12:5" />Chamwele ngajhangwila, “Bhambo Chapanga ndi jwalola nu kujhoha kuhumii kwino na munahota nkolongwa gwake, kubhehe umwene kubhehe ngwetii jhe malemwa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 12:5">Bheniya ngabhalongila, “Bhambo Chapanga ndi jwalola nu kujhoha.” <verse eid="1SA 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 12:6" />Chamwele ngajhendilila kulonge, Bhambo Chapanga ndi jwanhagwila Mucha na Alone, nukwabhoha akahokobhino ku kilambo chuku Michile. <verse eid="1SA 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 12:7" />Ngohe nnyemangana papa, kupala nenga na mangota tuhadabulwa nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, na nenga naninkombocha matendwa ghake gha ikangacho ghateila kupala ankombola mangota na akahokobhino. <verse eid="1SA 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 12:8" />Kipinde Yakobo, na akalongo mundo pubhajhahwila ku Michile, na Akamichile pibhang'ahita akahoko bhino, na akahoko bhino ngabhannelila Bhambo Chapanga abhatangatile, na jwenie ngabhatumita Mucha na Alone, kwabhoha Akahoko bhino ku kilambo chuku Michile, nu kwatenda ntamangane pi kilambo chenje. <verse eid="1SA 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 12:9" />Nambo bhando ngabhannibhilila Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwabhe, yene Bhambo Chapanga ngabhalekita akamakoko bhabhe bhabhabule, Sisela nkolo jwa akakomana ngondo jwaka Hazole na helahela muulongoche gwa Akafilichite, nu kwa munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Moabo, jwakomina na akahokobhino nu kwahotola. <verse eid="1SA 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 12:10" />Akahokobhino ngabhannelila Bhambo Chapanga kukulonge, “Tutei uhakaho, tunnekite Bhambo Chapanga nu kutumikii ichapanga Mabaale na Maashitolote. Mutughombole kuhumii mu mabhoko gha akamakoko bhito, na twenga natunyinamila.” <verse eid="1SA 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 12:11" />Ndi Bhambo Chapanga pantumita Yelubaale, liina lenge akemitwa Gideone, na nnonge ngantumita Bedane na Yefuta na pukujhomolela ngandumita nenga Chamwele. Kila jhumo pakate jhito ngankombwila kubhoke kwa akamakoko ghino kila upande, na mangota ngantama ku uteeke. <verse eid="1SA 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 12:12" />Nambo pumumweina Nahashi munahota nkolongwa jwa Akaamone papalita kuhika kwajhingilila, ngamunkanita Bhambo Chapanga jwabhii munahota nkolongwa gwino, ngaunobholila, “Tumpala munahota nkolongwa ndi jwapakutulongocha.”<verse eid="1SA 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 12:13" />Ngohe, jhonjo pamba ndi munahota nkolongwa jwa mikihaghulile, jhola jhumunnyopita Bhambo Chapanga, na jwenie ampelingine. <verse eid="1SA 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 12:14" />Anda munnyinamii Bhambo Chapanga nu kunnyokonikiya Chapanga, changaijhewa mihilo jhake, mangota pamonga na munahota nkolongwa gwino jwannongocha anda munkengame Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, bhahe, kila kilebhe nakinnyendela telatela. <verse eid="1SA 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 12:15" />Nambo anda nannyokanikii jhe Bhambo Chapanga nu kuikana mihilo jhake, jwenie nakomana na mangota ngita chakomina na akahoko bhino. <verse eid="1SA 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 12:16" />Ngohe, ntama nuu nukulolekeya kilebhe kikolongwa chapakutenda Bhambo Chapanga nnonge jhino. <verse eid="1SA 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 12:17" />Bho, chenje kilangache jhe? Nambo nenga naninnyopa Bhambo Chapanga, aleta nnindimilo gwa mbamba na hula, na mangota nammanya nu kukulola kubhehe uhakaho ghunteii nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, kwa kukijhope munahota nkolongwa ntei lilemwa likolongwa.<verse eid="1SA 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 12:18" />Peniya, Chamwele ngannyopa Bhambo Chapanga, na lichiko lele Bhambo Chapanga ngaletita hula na milindimilo jha mbamba. Yene, bhando bhoha bhuku Ichilahele ngabhannyogwipa hake Bhambo Chapanga pamonga na Chamwele. <verse eid="1SA 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 12:19" />Bhando bhoha ngabhannobholila Chamwele, “Chonde, munnyope Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, kunhwalo gwa akatumiche bhino, kupala tukoto kuwe, kunhwalo tujhonjikike uhakaho gwito kukupala munahota nkolongwa.”<verse eid="1SA 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 12:20" />Chamwele ngajhangwila, “Mangajhoghopa jhe, pamonga nukutenda uhakaho ghongo, manganneka jhe Bhambo Chapanga, nambo muntumikila kwa mwojho gwino gwoha. <verse eid="1SA 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 12:21" />Mangaijhinamii jhe ichapanga henge, jhangahoto kuntangatila na hilu kunkombola, nhwalo jhenio ndi jhuwange. <verse eid="1SA 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 12:22" />Bhambo Chapanga alongi nannekangana jhe nhwalo mangota ndi bhando bhake jwenie bhabhahagwile, mme mabhando bhake jwenie. <verse eid="1SA 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 12:23" />Kwa nenga nileka jhe kunnyopela kwa Bhambo Chapanga, nileka jhe kwajhopela, anda nekite kutenda yene, tela nukutenda uhakaho kwa Bhambo Chapanga. Nanyendelela kummola ndela jhambone na chiipalwa kuikengama. <verse eid="1SA 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 12:24" />Nambo mangota munnyokanikiya Bhambo Chapanga nu kuntumikii kukuhobholeka na mwojho gwino gwoha. Nkomboka ilebhe hela ikolongwa yantendii Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="1SA 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 12:25" />Nambo anda nnyendilii kutenda uhakaho, nankomelekelwa mangota pamonga na munahota nkolongwa gwino.”<verse eid="1SA 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1SA 13" />
  <para style="s">Akaichilahele bhikomana ngondo na Akafilichite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 13:1" />Sauli akibha na yaka makome matato pakibha munahota nkolongwa, ngalongwicha Ichilahele kwa yaka makome ncheche na mibhele. <verse eid="1SA 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 13:2" />Sauli ngabhahagwila akakomana ngondo Elufo itato bhuku Ichilahele. Pakate jha bheniya, akakomana ngondo Elufo ibhele akibha nabho kwenio ku Mikimashi, kukilambo cha itombe ya ku Beteli. Na akakomana ngondo Elufo jhimo bhakibha na Yonasani kwenio ku Gibeya jha Benjamine. Na akakomana ngondo bhange bhibhahighalike ngabhabhujhichwa kajhabhe.<verse eid="1SA 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 13:3" />Yonasani ngakijhingilila kighono cha Akafilichite kwenio ku Geba, na Akafilichite ngabhajhoina malobhe ghenio. Munahota nkolongwa Sauli ngajhembita lipenenga kukilambo choha chuku Ichilahele ngatangicha, kukulonge, “Akaebulaniya bhajhohe.” <verse eid="1SA 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 13:4" />Bhahe, Akaichilahele bhoha ngabhajhoina kubhehe Sauli akihotwii kighono cha Akafilichite, na Akafilichite bhachimwa hake Akaichilahele, bhahe, akakomana ngondo bhoha bha Akaichilahele ngabhakemwa kulombana na Sauli, kwenio ku Giligali.<verse eid="1SA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 13:5" />Akafilichite ngabhakonganika kupala kukomana na Akaichilahele, bhakibha na mutuka Elufo itato ihutwa na falache na akakomana ngondo bhibhahobhokii falache, bhakibha Elufo chita, na akakomana ngondo bhibhatyanga lwa pahe, bhakibha mbwe ngita ncheke ghuku mbwane, ngabhajhenda kubheka kighono chabhe, kwenio ku Mikimashi, upande ghulihumii lyobha mwa Bete avene. <verse eid="1SA 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 13:6" />Bhando bhuku Ichilahele pimanyita kubhehe bhabhi mumang'ahe, ngabhatumbwila kujhobha. Akakomana ngondo bhange ngabhajhobhita mu mikwembe na bhange mu mabhomba na bhange mu mandalabho na bhange mu mahandake na bhange muilibha yanga mache. <verse eid="1SA 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 13:7" />Na bhange ngabhajhombwika lukemba Yoludane ade ku kilambo chuku Gade na Gileade.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 13:7">Sauli akibha kwenio ku Gileade na bhando bhoha ngabhankengima kongo bhakilendema kwa kiholo.<verse eid="1SA 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 13:8" />Sauli ngannendelila Chamwele kwenio kwa machiko chaba, ngita Chamwele chalongila. Nambo Chamwele akajhenda jhe kwenio ku Giligali na bhando ngabhatumbwila kupechengana. <verse eid="1SA 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 13:9" />Bhahe, Sauli ngabhalobholila bhando, “Nnetangana matambiko ghino ghu kukomelekelwa na ghu uteeke.” Na jwenie ngabhoita litambiko lyu kukomelekelwa. <verse eid="1SA 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 13:10" />Sauli pajhomolila tu kupiya litambiko lyu kukomelekelwa, Chamwele ngapitila. Sauli ngajhenda kumpokela Chamwele nu kunnyambucha. <verse eid="1SA 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 13:11" />Chamwele ngankonyita, “Bho, ntei nike?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 13:11">Sauli ngajhangwila, pamweina akakomana ngondo bhango bhipechengana, na mwenga nhwikite jhe kwa lichiko linnongila helahela panolita Akafilichite bhakilenganikiya kwa ngondo kwenio ku Mikimashi <verse eid="1SA 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 13:12" />Bhahe, nganhwacha, Akafilichite nabhahika kunyingilila nenga ku Giligali, kabhele, nikabhoite jhe litambiko kupala ndangatilwe na Bhambo Chapanga. Yene, ndi ngaimbata namwete kupiya litambiko lyu kukomelekelwa.<verse eid="1SA 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 13:13" />Chamwele ngannyangwila, “Ntei umbebhebhe. Makajhokonikii jhe channaghalikiya Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino. Ngamunnyokonikiya Bhambo Chapanga ngantei mwenga na yana ino, unahota gwino utamikiya machiko ghoha ghangapeta kwa Akaichilahele. <verse eid="1SA 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 13:14" />Nambo ngohe unahota gwino nautamikiya jhe nhwalo nhwilo gwannaghalikiya Bhambo Chapanga mujhokanikiya jhe. Bhambo Chapanga, akihaghulii mundo jhonge jwapakunnyokanikiya kwa mwojho gwake gwoha, na jwenio ndi jwanhagwile kubhehe kilongoche jwa bhando bhake.”<verse eid="1SA 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 13:15" />Chamwele ngabhokita ku Giligali ngahobhokila kwenio ku Gibeya, kukilambo cha likabila lya Benjamine. Peniya, Sauli ngabhalinga bhando bhalongoina nako bhoha bhakibha miya chita. <verse eid="1SA 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 13:16" />Sauli na mwanamundo Yonasani pamonga na akakomana ngondo bhibhalongohina nabho, ngabhatamita, kwenio ku Gibeya, kukilambo chuku Benjamine, na Akafilichite ngabhabheka kighono chabhe, kwenio ku Mikimashi. <verse eid="1SA 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 13:17" />Akafilichite ngabhabhokita kukighono chabhe nukujhenda kwajhingilii, kongo bhakibha mu malongo matato. Lilongo limo ngalijhenda kwenio ku Ofula, kukilambo cha Shuali, <verse eid="1SA 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 13:18" />na lenge ngalijhenda ku Bete holone, na lilongo lya utato ngalighalambukila ku lulambo lwa Seboimu, mwiye na mwiye na njenga.<verse eid="1SA 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 13:19" />Kipinde chenio pakibha jhe na mundo jwa kuyana yoma mu kilambo choha chuku Ichilahele, kunhwalo Akafilichite ngabhapata kwahibhilikiya Akaebulaniya bhakoto kukihyani mapanga amu mikowa. <verse eid="1SA 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 13:20" />Bhahe, kila Mwichilahele ngapalitwa kwajhendela Akafilichite kukeya maghela gha pilau yabhe na njindinga yabhe na mabhagho ghabhe na ikwakwa yabhe yukuhunila. <verse eid="1SA 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 13:21" />Bhakibha bhalepita ipande ibhele ya itato ya mbijha yabhe kunole maghela gha pilau na njindinga. Na malepo ghukukekeya libhagho amu kupata kuyana choma ikibha jhimo jha tato jha chekeli. <verse eid="1SA 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 13:22" />Ku yene lichiko lyenio lya ngondo akibha jhe nkomana ngondo jhojhoha jwakibha na Sauli na Yonasani jwakibha nu upanga amu nkowa nambo tu Sauli na Yonasani mwana mundo.<verse eid="1SA 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 13:23" />Akafilichite ngabhapelika lilongo lya akakomana kujhenda kulonda chehemo jhukujhombokela kwenio ku Mikimashi.<verse eid="1SA 13:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1SA 14" />
  <para style="s">Yonasani ikoma Akafilichite twe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 14:1" />Lichiko limo, Yonasani mwana jwa munahota nkolongwa Sauli ngannobholila ntumiche jwake jwangheng'eghela chilaha, “Hika, tijha kwiye ku kighono cha Akafilichite.” Nambo Yonasani akannobholii jhe tate mundo. <verse eid="1SA 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 14:2" />Sauli akibha akabhekite kighono chake kwenio ku Migilone, pahe jha nkongo gwa nkongamanga, panja jha muche gwa Gibeya, akibha pamonga na akakomana ngondo miya chita. <verse eid="1SA 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 14:3" />Panakate jhabhe akibha Abiya, mwana jwa Ahitobu nnongo mundo Ikabodi mwana jwa Finehasi, nchoko mundo Ele, mpiya litambiko jwa Bhambo Chapanga, kwenio ku Shilo, jwahwalita kichibao chu upiya litambiko. Bhando bhakamanyiti jhe kubhehe Yonasani abhokite.<verse eid="1SA 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 14:4" />Mukijhomboko chenio cha Mikimashi, Yonasani chapata apete kuhika kukighono cha Akafilichite, pakibha na mandalabho mabhele ghighanyenyike, upande ghongo na upande ghonge. Lindalabho limo likemitwa Bosesi na lenge likemitwa Sene. <verse eid="1SA 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 14:5" />Lindalabho limo lyakibha kachikachine lilolikiya ku muche gwa Mikimashi na ghonge gwakibha kuchine lilolikiya muche gwa ku Geba.<verse eid="1SA 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 14:6" />Yonasani ngannobholila kangombo jhola jwang'eghela chilaha, “Tijha, tijhomboka upande ghuubhele gwa mukighono cha bhando bhala bhangammanya Bhambo Chapanga. Pange jhe Bhambo Chapanga natutangatila kuhotola ngondo, nhwalo kibhii jhe chikihoto kunhibhikiya Bhambo Chapanga kukombola ibha kwa bhamahele amu bhando bhandina.”<verse eid="1SA 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 14:7" />Kangombo jwenio ngannyangwila Yonasani, “Tenda chochoha chimipala kutenda, nenga mii pamonga na mwenga kwa chochoha chimpa kutenda.” <verse eid="1SA 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 14:8" />Yonasani ngalongila, “Bhahe, hika natujhomboka kwajhende bhala bhando kupala bhatubhone. <verse eid="1SA 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 14:9" />Anda bhatulobholii mutulendele, ade bhahike pamba patubhi natujhema papa, na hilu natwakengama jhe. <verse eid="1SA 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 14:10" />Nambo anda bhalongii twakengame bhahe, natwakengamila, kilebhe chenio nakibhaha nginyililo kubhehe Bhambo Chapanga atutei twahotole.”<verse eid="1SA 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 14:11" />Bhahe, ngabhapitila nnonge jha liboma lya Akafilichite. Akafilichite pubhahwehina ngabhalongila, “Dola, Akaebulaniya bhipita mu mabhomba mubhakajhobhite.” <verse eid="1SA 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 14:12" />Akafilichite bhibhakibha mu liboma ngabhankemita Yonasani na ntumiche jwake, “Hikangana kongo kwito, na twenga natunhina unyagho.” Yonasani ngannobholila kangombo jhola jwa ng'eghila chilaha, “Ngengamila, Bhambo Chapanga atutei Akaichilahele twahotole.”<verse eid="1SA 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 14:13" />Bhahe, Yonasani ngakwelita kwa mabhoko na magholo ghake, kongo akengimwa na kangombo jhola jwa ng'eghila chilaha. Yonasani ngabhajhingilila Akafilichite kukwagwiya pahe kongo kangombo jhola ngakengima unyuma kwakoma. <verse eid="1SA 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 14:14" />Mulijhingililo lyukutumbula, Yonasani na kangombo jwake nng'egha chilaha jhola, ngabhakomita bhando ngita makome mabhele, mu chehemo lilihikii nucho heka. <verse eid="1SA 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 14:15" />Mu kilambo choha cha Akafilichite ngabhabhila nikiholo, akakomana ngondo mu ighono na bhubhabhii mu mighonda na mu maboma na ata bhala bhibhajhingilii chenda amu miche kwa makakala, bhene hele ngabhalendima. Bhando bha kilambo chenio ngabhajhogwipa hake, kwa kiholo chikitumitwe na Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="1SA 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulepelela kwa Akafilichite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 14:16" />Akakomana ngondo bha Sauli bhibhakibha kwenio ku Gibeya jha Benjamine ngabhabhona akakomana ngondo bha Akafilichite bhamahele bhabhoghanike bhatilita kongo na kola. <verse eid="1SA 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 14:17" />Sauli ngabhalobholila bhando bhalongohina nabho, “Ajha mukibhalange kupala tumanye achighane bhanyogholwike pakate jhito.” Mukibhalange, ngabhamanya kubhehe Yonasani na ng'egha chilaha jwake bhabhii jhe. <verse eid="1SA 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 14:18" />Sauli ngannobholila mpiya litambiko Ahiya, “Deta pamba Lichanduko lya Bhambo Chapanga.” Kipinde chenio Lichanduko lya Lilaghano lya Bhambo Chapanga, likibha kwa Akaichilahele. <verse eid="1SA 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 14:19" />Kipinde Sauli pajhendilila kulonge na mpiya litambiko, lihangambwela mu kighono cha Akafilichite ngaichocha nu kuchochekeya hake, yene Sauli ngannobholila mpiya litambiko Ahiya, “Deka, nkoto kutenda kilebhe chochoha.” <verse eid="1SA 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 14:20" />Peniya, Sauli na bhando bhake ngabhakilenganikiya kukomana ngondo na Akafilichite. Nambo ngabhakolila Akafilichite bhabhoghanike nu kukomana kwa upanga bhene kwa bhene. <verse eid="1SA 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 14:21" />Akaebulaniya bhala bhibhakibha upande gwa Akafilichite na bhibhajhenda nabho kwenio kukighono, ngabhaghalambwika nu kukilomba na Akaichilahele bhibhakibha pamonga na Sauli na Yonasani. <verse eid="1SA 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 14:22" />Akaichilahele bhoha bhibhakibha bhakihiite mu kilambo cha itombe ya Efulaimo, pubhajhoina kubhehe Akafilichite bhatilite, na bheniya hele ngabhakengamila nu kwabula. <verse eid="1SA 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 14:23" />Yene, ndi Bhambo Chapanga chibhatangatila Akaichilahele bhahotole lichiko lyenie. Na ngondo ngijhendilila ade ku Bete aveni.<verse eid="1SA 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chikipitila pukujhomoke kwa ngondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 14:24" />Lichiko lela Akaichilahele ngabhang'ahika hake, nhwalo Sauli akalapanikii bhando kukulonge, “Jhuna likoto mundo jhojhoha jwapakulye lyobha nukutipika jhe, na kabula ninalepechela jhe akamakoko bhango” Yene, lichiko lyenio abhii jhe mundo jhojhoha jwakapaite chochoha. <verse eid="1SA 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 14:25" />Akakomana ngondo bhoha pubhajhingila mulitogholo, ngabhukolila bhuche ujhenii kila chehemo. <verse eid="1SA 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 14:26" />Pamonga na bhuche gwenio kundonyeka kila chehemo, abhii jhe nkomana ngondo jhojhoha jwakapaite bhuche gwenio kukujhoghopa kilapo chibhalapichwa. <verse eid="1SA 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 14:27" />Nambo Yonasani akajhoini jhe kipinde tate mundo pabhalapicha bhando. Bhahe, ngahatambwila luyato lwake nukuchwiya mulihegha lya bhuche, ngachopita bhuche gwenio. Peniya, ngakijhoa kubhehe na makakala. <verse eid="1SA 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 14:28" />Nkomana ngondo jhumo ngannobholila, “Tate gwino akabhalapanikii bhando changa jhoghopa kukulonge, ‘Abhaha na likoto mundo jhojhoha jwapakulye deleno.’ ” Ndi nhwalo bhando bhabhii chwapu na njala.<verse eid="1SA 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 14:29" />Yonasani ngajhangwila, “Tate gwango abhang'ahicha bhando. Ne ngwete makakala, nhwalo ghu kuchopa bhuche ghongo gwandina. <verse eid="1SA 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 14:30" />Ngaibhii mbone akakomana ngondo bhito ngabhalii kandina kuhumii muilebhe yibhaipukile kwa makakala kuhumii kwa akamakoko bhabhe, ngabhabhii na makakala na Akafilichite twe ngabhakomitwe.”<verse eid="1SA 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 14:31" />Lichiko lyenio, Akaichilahele ngabhabulita Akafilichite kubhoke ku Mikimashi ade ku Aiyalone. Kipinde chenio Akaichilahele bhabhii bheya kwa njala. <verse eid="1SA 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 14:32" />Bhahe, ngabhaibhutukila ilebhe yibhapukile kwa makakala kwa Akafilichite, ngabhatoila matohe gha mambelele na makambako gha ng'ombi na matohe gha ng'ombi, ngabhachinjita, ngabhalila nyama pamonga na myahe. <verse eid="1SA 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 14:33" />Nkomana ngondo jhumo ngannobholila Sauli, “Dola, bhando bhitenda uhakaho palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga kukumemena nyama jhina myahe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:33">Sauli ngabhalobholila bhando, “Mangota ntwekwii uhobholelo. Milibhilimbiya lighanga likolongwa lihika pamba pa mi nenga kajhombe.”<verse eid="1SA 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 14:34" />Peniya, Sauli ngabhalobholila bhando, “Nnyendengane makalobholele bhando bhoha bhaleta ng'ombi na mambelele ghabhe pamba, machinjila pamba na mumemena. Mangatenda jhe uhakaho palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, kukulye nyama jhina myahe.” Yene uhwiko ghola bhando bhoha ngapelika ngombi yabhe nu kwichinjii peniya. <verse eid="1SA 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 14:35" />Ndi Sauli nganchengila Bhambo Chapanga chehemo jhukupiikiya litambiko. Jhenio ndi ikibha chehemo jhukutumbula jhukupiikiya matambiko, Sauli jhakanchengi Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="1SA 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 14:36" />Peniya, Sauli ngabhalobholila akakomana ngondo, “Tijhangana takengame Akafilichite kilo, tukajhingilila, nukwapoka ilebhe yabhe ade pukuchegha natunneki jhe mundo jhojhoha abhehe ghome.” Akakomana ngondo ngabhannobholila</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:36">“Ntenda chela chimikibhona chamaha kwino.” Nambo mpiya litambiko Ahiya ngalongila, “Tunkonye hote Bhambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="1SA 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 14:37" />Bhahe, Sauli ngankonyita Bhambo Chapanga, “Bho, nhelele kululambo nakajhingilile Akafilichite? Bho, namututangatila kwahotola bheniya?” Nambo Bhambo Chapanga akajhangwi jhe lichiko lyenio. <verse eid="1SA 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 14:38" />Sauli ngalongila, “Nhwikengane pamba mangota ilongoche ya akakomana ngondo, tumanye uhakaho ghane ghututei deleno. <verse eid="1SA 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 14:39" />Nilapii kwa Bhambo Chapanga jwabhii ghome na jwaikombola Ichilahele, ata abhehe mwanango Yonasani ipalwa akomwa.” Nambo abhii jhe mundo jwajhangwi. <verse eid="1SA 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 14:40" />Sauli ngabhalobholila Akaichilahele bhoha, “Mangota nnyemangana koloko, nenga na mwanango Yonasani tujhema kongo.” Na bheniya ngabhalongila,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:40">“Ntenda chela chimikibhona chamaha kwino.” <verse eid="1SA 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 14:41" />Sauli ngannyopita Bhambo Chapanga kukulonge, “Mwe Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jhuku Ichilahele, kwanike unyangwi jhe ne nantumiche gwino? Mwe ma Bhambo Chapanga jhuku Ichilahele anda lilemwa ndehi nenga amu kwa mwanango Yonasani, bhahe, ntemulana kwa lighanga lya Ulimu. Nambo anda lilemwa lyenio libhii kwa bhando bhino bhuku Ichilahele, ntemulana kwa lighanga lya Sumimu.” Yonasani na Sauli ngalyagwelila lilemo nambo bhando ngabhabhila njelembo. <verse eid="1SA 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 14:42" />Sauli ngalongila, “Ntende kihumbuhumbu nnobhole pakate jhango na mwanango Yonasani.” Kihumbuhumbu nnobhole ngakimgwelila Yonasani. <verse eid="1SA 14:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 14:43" />Ndi Sauli ngannobholila Yonasani, “Unobholele kilebhe chinteile.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:43">Yonasani ngajhangwila, nakapaite bhuche gwandina tugha kwa nkongoche gwango, mii pamba imbalwa ngomwa.<verse eid="1SA 14:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 14:44" />Sauli ngalongila, “Bhambo Chapanga angoma nenga anda Yonasani nakomwa jhe.”<verse eid="1SA 14:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1SA 14:45" />Nambo akakomana ngondo ngabhannobholila Sauli, “Kwanike Yonasani akomwe, anda abhatangatii Akaichilahele kwabula akamakoko bhito? Kilebhe chenio changapitii jhe. Tulapii kwa Bhambo Chapanga jwabhii ghome ata lijhunjo lya umuto gwake naligwelila jhe pahe. Nhwalo kilebhe chatei deleno, atei kukutangatilwa na Bhambo Chapanga” Yene akakomana ngondo ngabhankombwila Yonasani akoto kukomwa.<verse eid="1SA 14:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1SA 14:46" />Peniya, Sauli ngalekita kwakengamila Akafilichite, na bheniya Akafilichite ngabhakelehwika mu kilambo chabhe.<verse eid="1SA 14:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulongoche gwa Sauli na nyumba jhake.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="1SA 14:47" />Sauli pakibha munahota nkolongwa jhuku Ichilahele, ngabulina na akamakoko bhake bha kila upande. Ngabulina na Akamoabo na Akamone na Akaedomu na akanahota akakolongwa bhuku Soba na Akafilichite. Kila pakomina ngondo, ngabhahotwila. <verse eid="1SA 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1SA 14:48" />Ngakomina changajhoghopa, na kwahotola Akameleke. Ngabhakombwila Akaichilahele kubhoke kwa bhando bhoha bhibhakomina nako.<verse eid="1SA 14:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1SA 14:49" />Yana inalome ya Sauli bhakibha Yonasani na Ishivi na Malike shuwa. Helehela akibha na yana ikeghe ibhele, nchikana jhukutumbula akemitwa Melabu na unung'una akemitwa Mikale. <verse eid="1SA 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1SA 14:50" />Nhwana mundo akemitwa Ahinoamo, mwana jwa Ahimaache. Nkomana ngondo jwa Sauli akemitwa Abineli, mwana jwa Neli, tatemundo unung'una jwa Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1SA 14:51" />Tatemundo Sauli akemitwa Kishi, na tatemundo Abineli akemitwa Neli, mwana jwa Abiele.<verse eid="1SA 14:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1SA 14:52" />Machiko ghoha gha ughome gwake Sauli, pakibha na ngondo ngolongwa pakate jha Akafilichite na Akaichilahele, na kila kipinde Sauli pamweina mundo jhojhoha jhuna makakala amu jwangajhoghopa, ngantoila nukuntenda kubhehe nkomana ngondo jwake.<verse eid="1SA 14:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1SA 15" />
  <para style="s">Akaichilahele bhikomana na Akameleke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 15:1" />Chamwele ngannobholila Sauli, “Bhambo Chapanga, ndi jwandumita ninyitila mahuta kupala mma munahota nkolongwa jwa bhando bhake bhuku Ichilahele. Ngohe, nnyokanikiya malobhe kuhumii kwa Bhambo Chapanga.” <verse eid="1SA 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 15:2" />Bhambo Chapanga jhuna makakala ghoha ilonge naha, “Nanahadabula Akameleke, ku nhwalo bhakabulite Akaichilahele pibhabhokita ku Michile. <verse eid="1SA 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 15:3" />Ngohe, nnyenda makajhingilile Akameleke nu kukomelekeya njwe pamonga na kila kilebhe chibhabhinacho. Mangakole jhe kiya, makoma akanalome na akakeghe na yana na ing'enya na ng'ombi na mambelele na kinyama chikikemwa ngamiya na maponda.”<verse eid="1SA 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 15:4" />Peniya, Sauli ngabhakemita akakomana ngondo bhake, ngabhakaghwila, kwenio ku Telaimo. Akakomana ngondo kuhumii ku Ichilahele bhakibha lake ibhele bhibhatyanga kwa magholo na kuhumii ku Yuda bhakibha elufo kome. <verse eid="1SA 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 15:5" />Sauli na bhando bhake ngabhajhenda ku muche gwa Amaleke, ngabhajhobhela mu lulambo lwa lukemba. <verse eid="1SA 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 15:6" />Peniya, Sauli ngabhalobholila Akakene, “Mmokangana panakate jha Akamaleke anda jhe naninkoma pamonga nabho. Ku nhwalo mangota makatendii ghambone Akaichilahele pibhabhokita ku Michile.” Bhahe, Akaakene ngabhabhokita nu kwaleka Akaamaleke.<verse eid="1SA 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 15:7" />Sauli ngabhajhingilila nu kwahotola Akaameleke kutumbuli ku Havila ade ku Shuli, upande ghulipitii lyobha gwa Michile. <verse eid="1SA 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 15:8" />Ngampukila munahota nkolongwa Agage jwa Akaameleke akibha ghome. Na ngabhakomelikiya bhando bhoha ku upanga. <verse eid="1SA 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 15:9" />Nambo Sauli na akakomana ngondo bhake ngabhannekita ghome munahota nkolongwa Agage na helahela bhakomite jhe mambelele ikendite na ng'ombi ikendite, na kila kilebhe chikibhii chambone bhakahangabhine jhe. Nambo ngakoma inyama na ilebhe yoha yangahalala na ihakanaho.<verse eid="1SA 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sauli akanilwa kubhehe munahota nkolongwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 15:10" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Chamwele, <verse eid="1SA 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 15:11" />“Nihengeleka mwojho kukuntenda Sauli kubhehe munahota nkolongwa. Sauli alekite kungengama nenga na akengime jhe mihilo jhango.” Chamwele ngahyomita, ngannelila Bhambo Chapanga kilo ndaa. <verse eid="1SA 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 15:12" />Chamwele ngajhimwika lukela putepute kupala ajhabhule kukongana na Sauli, nambo ngalobholilwa, “Sauli ajhahwi ku Kalimeli na kwenio akitendekiye kinala chake kupala ichima na ngohe ajhawii ku Giligali. <verse eid="1SA 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 15:13" />Chamwele panhikilila Sauli, na Sauli ngannobhilila Chamwele,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 15:13">“Bhambo Chapanga na ampe mota! Nenganikiye ghala ghoha ghanaghalikiya Bhambo Chapanga.” <verse eid="1SA 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 15:14" />Chamwele ngankonyita Sauli,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 15:14">“Anda yene ndi chakaka, bho, ilelo ya mambelele na ng'ombi ihumii kojhe?” <verse eid="1SA 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 15:15" />Sauli ngajhangwila, akakomana ngondo bhakomite jhe mambelele na ng'ombi yambone ibhatoila kuhumii kwa Akaamele, kupala kumpiikiya litambiko lyu kukomelekeya Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, nambo yoha ihighalike tuikomilikii njwe.<verse eid="1SA 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 15:16" />Chamwele ngannobholila Sauli, “Denda ninnobholela chalongi Bhambo Chapanga uhiko gwa deleno.” Sauli ngalongila, “Nobholela.”<verse eid="1SA 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 15:17" />Chamwele ngannobholila, “Makacho makakibhonite kubhehe machokombe pamiho gha bhando, bho mwe chi kilongoche jwa makabila gha Akaichilahele? Na jwenio Bhambo Chapanga ngamiminila mahuta, kupala mma munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Ichilahele. <verse eid="1SA 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 15:18" />Peniya, ngantumita nnyenda makakomelekeye pulutu Akaameleke bhoha nhwalo bhina uhakaho, mukabulane nabho ade kwakomelekeya njwenjwe. <verse eid="1SA 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 15:19" />Kwanike mukannyokanikii jhe Bhambo Chapanga? Kunhwalo ghane mukabhutuki kuipukila kwa makakala ilebhe yambone nu kutenda uhakaho nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga?”<verse eid="1SA 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 15:20" />Sauli nganyangwila Chamwele, “Nakanyokanikii Bhambo Chapanga. Nanyahwii kola kwandumita, nganakomilikiya njwenjwe Akamaleke bhoha nu kumpukii nukunneta Agage, munahota nkolongwa gwabhe. <verse eid="1SA 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 15:21" />Nambo akakomana ngondo bhakakomitii jhe, ng'ombi na mambelele ibhapukila kwa makakala kwenio ku Giligali, nambo bhaletite pamba kupala bhakupiikiye litambiko lya kukomelekeya Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwabhe.” <verse eid="1SA 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 15:22" />Ndi Chamwele ngajhangwila, “Bho, Bhambo Chapanga apala hake niki? Bho, matambiko ghu kukomelekelwa na matambiko ghange kuliku kunnyokanikiya jwenie? Kwa jwenie kunnyokonikiya ndi kwamaha hake kuliku matambiko, na kutenda chaipala ni kwamaha kuliku kumpiikiya litambiko lya mahuta gha limbelele linkambako. <verse eid="1SA 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 15:23" />Ku nhwalo kunkana Bhambo Chapanga ndi ngita uhakaho gwa uhabhe, na lighoho ndi ngita uhakaho ghu kujhinamila inyagho. Ku nhwalo mikanite mihilo jha Bhambo Chapanga, na jwenie ankanite kubhehe munahota nkolongwa.” <verse eid="1SA 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 15:24" />Ndi Sauli ngannobholila Chamwele, “Ndei uhakaho. Ndwekwii mihilo jha Bhambo Chapanga na malaghalikilo ghino. Nakajhogwipe bhando nu kwajhokanikiya bheniya. <verse eid="1SA 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 15:25" />Nambo ngohe ninnyopa, unekekeye uhakaho gwango. Na mwenga nkelebhuka pamonga na nenga, kupala ninnyinamila Bhambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="1SA 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 15:26" />Nambo Chamwele ngannyangwila, “Nikelebhuka ng'o na mwenga. Nhwalo mwenga mikanite mihilo jha Bhambo Chapanga, na jwenie ankanite kubhehe munahota nkolongwa bhuku Ichilahele.”<verse eid="1SA 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 15:27" />Chamwele paghalambwika kupala abhoke, Sauli ngakamwila lubiniko lwa ngobho jhake, na lyenio ngalijhwepwika. <verse eid="1SA 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 15:28" />Peniya, Chamwele ngannobholila Sauli, “Kutumbuli ngohe Bhambo Chapanga aujhwepwi unahota nkolongwa gwa Akaichilahele kuhumii kwino, nu kumpela mundo jhonge jwabhii pahina jhino, jwabhii jwambone kuliku mwenga. <verse eid="1SA 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 15:29" />Chapanga jwabhii na ung'alicho jwa ku Ichilahele akolowa jhe, hilu kughalambula mawacho ghake. Nhwalo jwenio namundo jhe ata aghalambule mawacho ghake.”<verse eid="1SA 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 15:30" />Sauli ngajhanguu, “Ndei uhakaho.” Nambo chonde mangambe jhe hone nnonge jha ighogholo na bhando bhango, na nnonge jha Akaichilahele. Unekekeye ngelebhuke pamonga na mwenga, kupala nikanyinamile Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino. <verse eid="1SA 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 15:31" />Bhahe, Chamwele ngakelehwika pamonga na Sauli, na jwenie Sauli ngannyinamila Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="1SA 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 15:32" />Peniya, Chamwele ngalongila, “Munetele Agage munahota nkolongwa jwa Akaameleke.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 15:32">Agage nganyendila Chamwele kukuhangana, kukuhwacha, “Lipyanda li kuwe lipetite!” <verse eid="1SA 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 15:33" />Chamwele ngalongila, “Anda upanga gwino chubhateila akakeghe bhahwelelwe na yana yabhe na ndi majhe gwino chapala kubhehe changamwana panakate jha akakeghe.” Bhahe, Chamwele nganhekita Agage ipande nnonge jha chehemo jhukupiikiya litambiko lya Bhambo Chapanga, kwenio ku Giligali.<verse eid="1SA 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 15:34" />Peniya, Chamwele ngajhenda ku Lama na munahota nkolongwa Sauli ngajhenda kajhake, kwenio ku Gebeya. <verse eid="1SA 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 15:35" />Kuhumii lichiko lyenio ade Chamwele pajhomwika akajhenda jhe kunninga munahota nkolongwa Sauli pamonga nu kubhe ngolongonde kunhwalo gwa Sauli. Ata yene Bhambo Chapanga ngabhila ngolongonde kunike kuntenda Sauli kubhehe munahota nkolongwa jhuku Ichilahele.<verse eid="1SA 15:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1SA 16" />
  <para style="s">Daude ipakwa mahuta abha munahota nkolongwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 16:1" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Chamwele, namungolongondila Sauli ade ligha? Na mwenga mimanya kubhehe nikanite kubhehe munahota nkolongwa jhuku Ichilahele. Ngohe mitweleya mahuta, mulinyelo, nnyenda ku muche gwa ku Betelehemo ku nyumba jha Yese nhwalo nikihaghulile munahota nkolongwa pakate jha yana yake.<verse eid="1SA 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 16:2" />Chamwele ngalongila, “Nanhotola bho kujhenda?” Nhwalo “Anda Sauli ajhoine mihalo jhenio ahoto kungoma!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:2">Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila, “Tola matohe gha ng'ombi jwa nkolo, nnyenda nako na nnongela, Hikite kumpiikiya Bhambo Chapanga litambiko.”<verse eid="1SA 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 16:3" />Mu litambiko lyenio munnalika Yese nanenga naninnobholela chukuhenga. Namumiminila mahuta kunhwalo gwango jhola jwanipakunangiya.<verse eid="1SA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 16:4" />Chamwele ngatenda ngita chalaghilwe na Bhambo Chapanga, ngajhenda ku Betelehemo. Ilongoche ya muche gwenio, ngabhahikita kumpokela kongo bhalendima. Ngabhankonyita, “Bho, nhwikite ku uteeke?”<verse eid="1SA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 16:5" />Chamwele ngabhajhangwila, “Hikite ku uteeke. Hikite kumpiikiya Bhambo Chapanga litambiko. Ngohe mukijhelebhula mabhene na nhwikangana ku litambiko pamonga na nenga.” Peniya, ngabhammeka nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga Yese na yana yake nu kwalalika palitambiko.<verse eid="1SA 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 16:6" />Pubhahikita, Chamwele ngamwonita Eliabu, kumwojho gwake ngalongila, “Chakaka, mpakwa mahuta jwa Bhambo Chapanga ndi jhonjo, jwabhii nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga!” <verse eid="1SA 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 16:7" />Nambo Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Chamwele, mangannololekeya jhe kumiho jhake hilu kipemo cha utandamaho gwake, ku nhwalo nenga nikanite. Nenga nilingulikiya jhe ngita bhando chibhalingukiya, nhwalo bhando bhilingukiya kwa panja, nambo nenga nilingukiya kumwojho.<verse eid="1SA 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 16:8" />Peniya, Yese ngankemita Abinadabo nu kunneta nnonge jha Chamwele. Nambo Chamwele ngalongila, “Ata jhonjo ahaghulilwe jhe na Bhambo Chapanga.” <verse eid="1SA 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 16:9" />Yese nganneta Shama. Chamwele ngalongela, “Ata jhonjo hele ahaghulilwe jhe na Bhambo Chapanga.” <verse eid="1SA 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 16:10" />Yese ngabhaletita yana yake chaba nnonge jha Chamwele, nambo Chamwele ngannobholila, Bhambo Chapanga anhagwii jhe jhojhoha pakate jha bhamba. <verse eid="1SA 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 16:11" />Peniya, Chamwele ngankonyita, “Bho, bhamba ndi yana ino ya kanjika?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:11">Yese ngajhangwila, “Nai jhe, amela abhii nchokombe kupeta bhoha, na jwenie alucha mambelele.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:11">Chamwele ngalongila, “Ntuma mundo akakemwe, tutama jhe pahe ade papakuhika.” <verse eid="1SA 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 16:12" />Bhahe, Yese ngantumita mundo, jwenie ngabhujhichwa. Kangombo jwenio akibha nkele na miho ghighahutii na jwahutila kukunnolekeya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:12">Peniya, Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Chamwele, “Jhenda mumiminile mahuta, nhwalo jhonjo ndi jwaninhagwile.” <verse eid="1SA 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 16:13" />Bhahe, Chamwele ngatoila linyelo lilibhii na mahuta gha micheitune nukumiminila Daude nnonge jha akalongo mundo, kutumbulii lichiko lyenio nu kujhendelela uhuke gwa Bhambo Chapanga ngunhikilila Daude kwa makakala nukutama ngate jhake. Peniya, Chamwele ngakelehwika ku Lama.<verse eid="1SA 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daude pa udamo gwa Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 16:14" />Bhahe, uhuke gwa Bhambo Chapanga ngunnekita Sauli na uhuke mmoho jwalekekilwe na Bhambo Chapanga ngung'ahicha. <verse eid="1SA 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 16:15" />Peniya, akatumiche bha Sauli ngabhannobholila, “Dola uhuke mmoho jwalekekilwe na Bhambo Chapanga ung'ahicha. <verse eid="1SA 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 16:16" />Bhahe, munahota gwito, alaghalikiya akatumiche bhino bhibhantumikila bhampalahe mundo jwahoto kuhona lilimba, najwenio uhuke mmoho kubhoke kwa Chapanga papakuhika, mundo jwenio nahona kinube na mwenga nauhangana.”<verse eid="1SA 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 16:17" />Bhahe, Sauli ngabhalobholila akatumiche bhake, “Mpalaye mundo jwahoto kuhona maha lilimba muneta kwango.” <verse eid="1SA 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 16:18" />Ntumiche jhumo panakate jha akatumiche bhange ngalongila, “Dola, nimwene mwana jhumo jwa Yese, jwaitama ku Betelehemo, jwabhii maha kuhona lilimba, kabhele ndi mundo jwanga jhoghopa na jwaimanya maha kukomana ngondo na jwalonge kukunyenyekeya, Bhambo Chapanga abhii pamonga na jwenie.”<verse eid="1SA 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 16:19" />Bhahe, Sauli ngatumita bhando kwa Yese, nukulonge, “Unnete mwana gwino Daude jwailucha mambelele.” <verse eid="1SA 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 16:20" />Yese ngantumita Daude mwana mundo kwa Sauli, pamonga na liponda liligheghite mabumunda na lihako lya limbendela chikibhii na divaye na litohe lya mbuhe na kumpelekee ngita hupo. <verse eid="1SA 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 16:21" />Daude pahikita kwa Sauli ngajhingila mulihengo lyake. Sauli ngampala hake Daude, na jwenie ngabhila nng'egha chilaha yake ya ngondo. <verse eid="1SA 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 16:22" />Peniya, Sauli ngatumita lilobhe kwa Yese kukulonge, “Munekekeye Daude atame pamba andumikile, nhwalo ndei kumpala.” <verse eid="1SA 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 16:23" />Kila lichiko uhuke mmoho jhola jwalekekilwe na Bhambo Chapanga pilinhikilila Sauli nukung'ahicha, Daude ngakamwila lilimba nu kuhona, na Sauli ngahanganichwa na uhuke jwenio ngabhokita.<verse eid="1SA 16:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1SA 17" />
  <para style="s">Goliate ikomana na Akaichilahele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 17:1" />Kipinde chenio, Akafilichite ngabhakonganicha pamonga akakomana ngondo kunhwalo jha ngondo, kwenio ku Soku ku muche ghubhii kukilambo chuku Yuda. Ngabhabhekita kighono chabhe kwenio ku Efese damimo jhibhii pakate jha Soku na Azeka. <verse eid="1SA 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 17:2" />Sauli pamonga na akakomana ngondo bhuku Ichilahele ngabhakonganika, nu kubheka kighono mu lulambo, kwenio ku Ela nukupanga akakomana ngondo kupala kubulana na Akafilichite. <verse eid="1SA 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 17:3" />Akafilichite ngabhajhema kukitombe upande ghumo na Akaichilahele ngabhajhemita upande ghonge gwa kitombe, na panakate jhabhe pakibha na lulambo.<verse eid="1SA 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 17:4" />Mu kighono cha Akafilichite ngapitila jwangajhoghopa jhumo jwakemitwa Goliate, nkolo muche ghuku Gati. Jwakibha na utandamaho mita itato. <verse eid="1SA 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 17:5" />Kumuto gwake akahwalite kopiya ya shaba, na kichubao cha shaba panganga china utopaho gwa kilo makome nhwano na chita. <verse eid="1SA 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 17:6" />Mu magholo ghake akawalite ipande ya shaba na akibha akakamwii nkowa gwa shaba mu lubhoko lwake. <verse eid="1SA 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 17:7" />Mmoko gwa nkowa gwake ukibha ngita mpumbache, na muto gwa nkowa gwenio ukibha na utopaho gwa kilo chaba. Ngao jhake igheghitwa na mundo jhonge jwalongalile nnonge jhake. <verse eid="1SA 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 17:8" />Goliate ngajhemita nu ngabhachobhelila akakomana ngondo bha Akaichilahele kukulonge, “Mihenga nike peniya? Bho, nhwikitengine kubulana ngondo? Ne Mfilichite, mangota mwe ndi akabhanda bha Sauli. Ngohe munhaghule jhumo pakate jhino ahike kubulana nanenga. <verse eid="1SA 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 17:9" />Anda ahotwii kumula nukungoma, twenga natubhaha akabhanda bhino. Nambo anda ninhotwile nu kunkoma, mangota mwe namma akabhanda bhito nu kututumikila.” <verse eid="1SA 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 17:10" />Peniya, Mfilichite jwenio ngajhendilila kulonge “Lichiko lende lya deleno naligha akakomana ngondo bhuku Ichilahele mbelangana mundo jwa kubulana nako.” <verse eid="1SA 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 17:11" />Sauli na akakomana ngondo bhoha bhuku Ichilahele pubhajhoina malobhe gheniya gha Mfilichite jwenio, ngabhahengeleka mwojho nu kujhoghopa hake.<verse eid="1SA 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daude mu kighono cha Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 17:12" />Daude akibha mwana jwa Yese, jwakibha Muefulate kubhoke ku Betelehemo mu kilambo chuku Yuda. Yese akibha na yana nane inalome. Kipinde Sauli pakibha munahota nkolongwa, Yese akibha kighogholo jwa yaka twe. <verse eid="1SA 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 17:13" />Yana itato ya Yese ikolo, mwana jwa litibho akemitwa Eliabu, mwana jhuubhele Abinadabo na mwana jhuutato Shama, bheniya bhakibha pamonga na Sauli ku ngondo. <verse eid="1SA 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 17:14" />Daude akibha unung'una gwa yana yoha ya Yese, na bheniya bhibhabhila akolo ngabhalongohina na Sauli kungondo. <verse eid="1SA 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 17:15" />Bhahe, Daude ijhenda kila kipinde kwa Sauli nu kubhujha kwa tate mundo, kupala aghalucha mambelele kwenio ku Betelehemo.<verse eid="1SA 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 17:16" />Kwa kipinde cha machiko makome ncheche, lukela na kimiye Mfilichite Goliate abhatupila pakongoloo akakomana ngondo bha Akaichilahele.<verse eid="1SA 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 17:17" />Lichiko limo, Yese ngannobholila Daude mwana mundo, “Bhapelekela akalongobhino ndolotolo kilo kome na mabumunda kome. Bhapelekela kajhombe kwenio kukighono chabhe. <verse eid="1SA 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 17:18" />Mpelekela kilongoche jwa kibhogha cha akakomana ngondo elufo, kilo kome jha mahuta ghighagandite ghighabhokite mumabhele gha ng'ombi. Na makalinga akalongo bhino anda bhijhendelela mbone peniya unetela malobhe ghabhe.” <verse eid="1SA 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 17:19" />Bhahe, Sauli na akakomana ngondo bhoha bhuku Ichilahele, bhakibha ku lulambo lwa Ela, bhikomana na Akafilichite.<verse eid="1SA 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 17:20" />Daude ngalabhita lukela putepute, mambelele ngaghalekita na nnuchajhe. Ngatoila chukulye ngita chalaghilwa na tate mundo Yese. Pahikita kukighono cha Akaichilahele, ngabhakolila akakomana ngondo bhikilenganikiya mu chehemo jhabhe jha ngondo na kone mikemelela njobhelo ya ngondo. <verse eid="1SA 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 17:21" />Akakomana ngondo bha Akaichilahele na Akafilichite bhakibha bhikipanga michitale jhabhe bhikiloleyana. <verse eid="1SA 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 17:22" />Daude ngailekita ilebhe yake hela kwa ntunja mihigho, ngabhutukila munchitale gwa akakomana ngondo nu kwajhambucha akalongomundo. <verse eid="1SA 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 17:23" />Pakibha mukulonge nabho, Goliate nkomana ngondo jwangajhoghopa jwa Akafilichite kuhumii ku Gati ngapitila nnonge jha nchitale gwake gwa ngondo nu kuchobhela ngita chayobholile, na jwenie Daude ngannyokanikiya maha. <verse eid="1SA 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 17:24" />Akaichilahele pibhamweina mundo jhola, bhoha ngabhantilita ku bhoghohe hake. <verse eid="1SA 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 17:25" />Akakomana ngondo bha Akaichilahele ngabhalongila, “Bho, mumweine mundo jhonjo chajhendelela kupitila na kwaligha maligho Akaichilahele? Munahota nkolongwa Sauli alongi, nampela ilebhe mbwe mundo jhojhoha jwapa kunkoma mundo jhonjo. Kuchocha gheniya, nantolanikiya kamwale jwake. Helahela akalongo bha tate gwake nabhalepa jhe kode.”<verse eid="1SA 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 17:26" />Daude ngabhakonyita bhala bhibhakibha pahina jhake, “Bho, mundo jwapa kunkoma Mfilichite jhonjo nu kuighombola Ichilahele kubhoka mu hone jhenje natendelwa kilebhe ghane? Mfilichite jhonjo ndi ghane, mundo jwangajhingi jando jwabhaligha maligho akakomana ngondo bha Chapanga jwabhii ghome?” <verse eid="1SA 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 17:27" />Ngabhannobholila ghala ghoha ghapala kutendelwa mundo jhojhoha jwapa kunkoma Goliate.<verse eid="1SA 17:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 17:28" />Nambo Eliabu nhwachamundo Daude jhukutumbula, pajhoina Daude alonge na bhando nganchimwita, ngalonge, “Kwa nike nhwikite? Bho, mambelele ghala ghandina munneke ghane kola kulundwanga? Nimmanye chummii nilighoho nu jhunkalamwike hake. Nhwikite tu kulolelekeya ngondo.”<verse eid="1SA 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 17:29" />Daude ngajhanguu, “Bho, ndei bhole? Bho, nihoto jhe hilu kukonya lichwale?” <verse eid="1SA 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 17:30" />Daude ngang'alambukila jhonge mundo ngankonyita lichwale lele, na kila pakonyita ngajhangulila lelalela.<verse eid="1SA 17:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 17:31" />Bhando bhikiteno bhibhajhoina chalongii Daude, ngabhajhenda kunnobholela Sauli. Na jwenie Sauli ngalaghila akemwe Daude. <verse eid="1SA 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 17:32" />Daude ngannobholila Sauli, mundo jhojhoha akoto kujhoghopa umwojho gwake kunhwalo gwa Mfilichite jhonjo. Nenga natumiche gwino nanyenda kubulana nako.<verse eid="1SA 17:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 17:33" />Sauli ngannobholila Daude, “Mwe mihoto jhe kubulana na jhonjo Mfilichite. Mwe mwamela makangombo tu, nambo mundo jwenio abhii mu ngondo kuhumii mu ungombo gwake.”<verse eid="1SA 17:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 17:34" />Daude ngalongila, “Ne natumiche gwino nhyobhalile kulucha mambelele gha tate gwango.” Liimba amu lidubu pilihika kunkamuu litohe lya limbelele, <verse eid="1SA 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 17:35" />ne ninkengamila nukukwapana nako, na kumpoka litohe lya limbelele munnomo gwake. Anda liimba amu lidubu likwapina nenga nilikamu ndeo yake nukuligwelekeya pahe nu kulinkoma. <verse eid="1SA 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 17:36" />Ne nantumiche gwino ngomite maimba na madubu twe. Ngohe na jhola Mfilichite jwangammanya Bhambo Chapanga, jwabhalighite akakomana ngondo bha Chapanga jwabhii ghome, jwenio nabhaha ngita bheniya. <verse eid="1SA 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 17:37" />Bhambo Chapanga jwang'ombwile kubhoke muyobho ya liimba na lidubu, ndi chang'ombola kubhoke kwa mundo jhonjo. Sauli ngannobholela, “Nnyenda, na Bhambo Chapanga nabhaha pamonga na mwenga.”<verse eid="1SA 17:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 17:38" />Sauli ngatoila ngobho ya ngondo ngawalicha Daude, ngawalicha na kopiya jha chaba pamuto na kichubao cha choma panganga jhake. <verse eid="1SA 17:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 17:39" />Daude ngakikonga upanga gwa Sauli, peniya, ngajhighita kutyanga, nambo ngahotwila jhe nhwalo ngobho yenio aiyobholila jhe. Ngannobholila Sauli, “Nihoto jhe kujhenda kubulana anda nhwalite ngobho jhenje” nhwalo niiyobhalii ng'o, yene ngaulita. <verse eid="1SA 17:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 17:40" />Daude ngatoila luyato mulubhoko lwake, ngakihaghulila mbilingo nhwano yambone kuhumii mu kipela, ngaghalekila mulihako lyake ghu kuluchila. Kongo abhii na ngumbelo jhake tela mulubhoko lyake, ngankengamila Goliate.<verse eid="1SA 17:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daude inkoma Goliate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 17:41" />Kipinde cheche, Goliate ngatumbwila kunheghelela Daude, na jhola jwanng'eghii ngao jhake akibha nnonge jhake. <verse eid="1SA 17:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 17:42" />Goliate pamweina Daude ngampuchita, kunhwalo Daude akibha kangombo tu nkele na jhuna kuhalala hake. <verse eid="1SA 17:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 17:43" />Goliate ngankonyita Daude, “Luyato lwenio lwa nike? Mihambuka ne na ghimbwa ade minhikilila nu luyato?” Mfilichite jwenio ngampila likoto Daude kwa ichapanga yake. <verse eid="1SA 17:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 17:44" />Mfilichite jwenio ngannobholila Daude, “Hika pamba yegha jhino nanipela ijhune yukunane na inyama yu kumanyahe.”<verse eid="1SA 17:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1SA 17:45" />Daude ngannobholila Goliate, “Mwe minhikalila nu upanga na nkowa na kihembe chikitema kone na kone, nambo nenga ninhikalila ku uhotolo gwa Bhambo Chapanga jwa akakomana, Chapanga jwa akakomana jwa ngondo jwa Akaichilahele, jwenio ndi jhummunigha. <verse eid="1SA 17:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1SA 17:46" />Lichiko lya deleno, Bhambo Chapanga nandangatila ninhotole. Nanimbula nukuheka muto gwino, naniipela matumbuhe na inyama yukumanyahe, mituhe jha akakomana ngondo bha Akafilichite. Peniya, nnema gwoha naumanya kubhehe Chapanga abhii mu kilambo chuku Ichilahele. <verse eid="1SA 17:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1SA 17:47" />Bhando bhoha bhibhakonganike deleno pamba, nabhamanya kubhehe Bhambo Chapanga, ahoto kwakombola bhando changa nkowa hilu kihembe chikitema kone na kone. Kunhwalo ngondo ndi jha Bhambo Chapanga, jwenio natutangatila tunhotole.”<verse eid="1SA 17:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1SA 17:48" />Goliate nganyendalila Daude. Daude ngabhutwika lubhelo kujhenda kunchitale gwa Akafilichite, kukongana na Goliate. <verse eid="1SA 17:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1SA 17:49" />Daude ngajhingiya lubhoko lwake mu lihako lyake, ngabhohita lighanga limo, ngalihuchita kwa ngumbelo jhake, ngankong'winda nde Goliate pakibhonge chake, lighanga lyenio ngalikajwila libhonge lyake nukujhingii umutwe gwake. Goliate ngagwila pahe mangukama. <verse eid="1SA 17:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1SA 17:50" />Yene, ndi Daude chanhotwila Goliate kwa lingumbelo lyake na lighanga. Ngambulita nu kunkoma Mfilichite jwenio changatumii upanga. <verse eid="1SA 17:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1SA 17:51" />Bhahe, Daude ngabhutwika lubhelo nukujhema pa mmele gwa Goliate, ngaholomwila upanga kuhumii muchako gwa Goliate, nganhekita muto ku upanga gwenio. Akafilichite pibhamweina jwangajhoghopa gwabhe akomitwe, ngabhakumwila lubhelo.<verse eid="1SA 17:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1SA 17:52" />Peniya, ndi bhando bhuku Yuda nuku Ichilahele ngabhatumbwila kuchobhela kukuhanganila, ngabhabhutwiya Akafilichite, ade ku Gati mulitangala gwa Ekiloni, na Akafilichite bhibhakocholinwe ku ngondo ngabhagwelila mundela jhihumii ku Shaalimo ade jhijhenda ku Gati nu ku Ekiloni. <verse eid="1SA 17:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1SA 17:53" />Akaichilahele pibhahumita kwabhutuwa Akafilichite, ngabhajhenda kutola kila kilebhe chikibhii mu kighono chabhe cha Akafilichite. <verse eid="1SA 17:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1SA 17:54" />Daude ngatoila muto gwa Goliate, ngakipelika kubomane jhuku Yeluchalemo. Nambo chilaha jha Goliate ngaibhekita mu lihema lyake.<verse eid="1SA 17:54" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daude ipelekwa kwa Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1SA 17:55" />Sauli pamweina Daude pajhenda kubulana na Goliate jhola Mfilichite, ngankonyita kilongoche jwa akakomana ngondo bhake Abineli, “Abineli kangombo jhonjo ndi mwana jwa ghane?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:55">Abineli ngajhangwila, “Munahota, ne nimanyii jhe.”<verse eid="1SA 17:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1SA 17:56" />Munahota nkolongwa ngannobholila, “Bhahe, mukonye jwenio kangombo ndi mwana jwa ghane.”<verse eid="1SA 17:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="1SA 17:57" />Daude pakelehwika tu kukighono kubhoke pukunkoma Goliate, Abineli ngampelika kwa Sauli. Kipinde chenio Daude akibha amela akamwii muto gwa Goliate. <verse eid="1SA 17:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1SA 17:58" />Sauli ngankonyita, “Mwe ma mwana jwa ghane?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:58">Daude ngajhangwila, “Ne namwana jwa Yese, ntumiche gwino, kuhumii ku muche gwa ku Betelehemo.”<verse eid="1SA 17:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1SA 18" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 18:1" />Sauli pajhomolila kulonge na Daude, Yonasani mwana jwa Sauli ngahutilwa hake na Daude, ngampalita Daude kwa mwojho gwake gwoha ngita chakipala jwenie. <verse eid="1SA 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 18:2" />Kubhoke lichiko lyenio, Sauli ngantolita Daude nu kutamanako kajhake na akannekekii jhe abhujhe kabhele kwa tate mundo. <verse eid="1SA 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 18:3" />Bhahe, Yonasani ngatehila lilaghano na Daude, ku nhwalo akampahile ngita chakipahila jwene. <verse eid="1SA 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 18:4" />Peniya, ndi Yonasani ngahulita lijhoho lyake lyawalite, ngampila Daude pamonga na chilaha yake upanga gwake na upinde gwake na luhunga lwake. <verse eid="1SA 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 18:5" />Chehemo jhojhoha jhatumitwa kujhenda na Sauli, Daude ngahotwila. Bhahe, Sauli ngantenda kubhehe nkolo jwa akakomana ngondo bhake. Kilebhe chenio chakanganiche bhando bhoha, ata akatumiche bha Sauli hele.<verse eid="1SA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sauli immone wiho Daude</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 18:6" />Akakomana ngondo pibhakibha bhikelebhuka ukajha pamonga na Daude kubhoke pukunkoma Mfilichite jhola, akakeghe kuhumii ku miche yoha yuku Ichilahele ngabhabhoka kujhenda kumpokela munahota nkolongwa Sauli. Akakeghe bheniya ngabhajhembita mihambo jhu kuhangana, kuhona matale na lilimba. <verse eid="1SA 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 18:7" />Pibhakibha bhakinita bhajhembita naha, “Sauli akomite maelufo na Daude akomite makome elufo.”<verse eid="1SA 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 18:8" />Sauli ngachimwita hake, nhwalo nhwambo gwenio ujhembitwa kukubhujhila bhujhila. Ngalongila, “Bhampekii Daude makome elufo, nambo nenga bhambekii bhando elufo ndo. Chikiighalile kumpela Daude unahota nkolongwa. <verse eid="1SA 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 18:9" />Kubhoke lichiko lyenio, Sauli ngammonela wiho Daude.”<verse eid="1SA 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 18:10" />Lichiko lilikengime, limbembela kuhumi kwa Chapanga ngalinnyingila Sauli kwa makakala, ngatumbwila kulonge kanjika chake ngita jhuna ngholoka pakajhake. Daude akibha ahonita lilimba ngita chatenda machiko ghoha. Na Sauli akamwii nkowa mulubhoko lwake, <verse eid="1SA 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 18:11" />Sauli nganhuchila Daude nkowa mala ibhele kukulonge, “Naninyundukula nkowa nuighalila papa pa lipamanda.” Nambo Daude ngajhepita nkowa gwenio mala yoha ibhele.<verse eid="1SA 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 18:12" />Sauli ngannyogwipa Daude, kunhwalo Bhambo Chapanga akibha pamo na jwenie, nambo annekite Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 18:13" />Peniya, Sauli ngammohita Daude kajhake, ngantenda abhehe nkolo jwa akakomana ngondo elufo jhimo. Jwenie Daude ngabhalongocha chiipalwa ku ngondo. <verse eid="1SA 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 18:14" />Kila kilebhe chateila Daude, akateila telatela, ku nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga akibha pamonga na jwene. <verse eid="1SA 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 18:15" />Sauli pabhonita Daude itenda telatela mu kila kilebhe, ngachochita kunyoghopa hake. <verse eid="1SA 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 18:16" />Nambo bhando bhuku Ichilahele na bhuku Yuda ngabhahutilwa hake na Daude, nhwalo abhalongwicha mbone ku ngondo nu kwabhujhicha ku uhotolo.<verse eid="1SA 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daude itolela kamwale jwa Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 18:17" />Sauli ngannobholila Daude, “Jhonjo ndi kamwale jwango nkolo Melabu, nanintolakicha, anda naundumikila kukubhehe nkomana ngondo jwango jwangajhoghopa nu kukomana ngondo ya Bhambo Chapanga. Sauli ngawachila kwa ndela jhenje, Akafilichite ndi bhibhapala kunkoma Daude.”<verse eid="1SA 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 18:18" />Daude ngannobholila Sauli, “Ne ndi meneke ata munahota nkolongwa abhaha nkohano gwango? Lukolo lwango na nyumba jha tate gwango bhimanyikana ng'o mu kilambo chuku Ichilahele. <verse eid="1SA 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 18:19" />Nambo kipinde cha Melabu puhikita kunkamuya Daude, Sauli ngantolanikicha kamwale jwenio kwa Adiliele, kuhumii ku muche gwa Mehola.”<verse eid="1SA 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 18:20" />Nambo Mikale kamwale jhonge jwa Sauli, ngahalalichwa hake na Daude. Sauli palobholilwa kilebhe chenio, ngahanganila hake. <verse eid="1SA 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 18:21" />Sauli ngahwachita, “Denda nitolanikiche jhonjo, kupala abhaha ntambo kwake.” Na changa kiholo Akafilichite nabhankoma. Peniya, Sauli ngannobholila Daude kwa mala jhenge “Ngohe nama nkohano gwino.” <verse eid="1SA 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 18:22" />Sauli ngabhalaghila akatumiche bhake bhakapwepwe na Daude kubhehe, “Munahota nkolongwa ahalalichwe na mwenga, hele akatumiche bhake bhoha bhimpala. Ngohe nnyetekele kuntolela kamwale gwake.”<verse eid="1SA 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 18:23" />Bhahe, akatumiche bheniya ngabhanyendila Daude nu kunnobholela ghala ghalongila munahota nkolongwa, nambo Daude ngabhalobholila, “Ne nanhocho, na nimanyikana jhe. Bho, mihambuka munahota nkolongwa kubhehe nkohano gwango ndi kilebhe kijhojhoho?”<verse eid="1SA 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 18:24" />Na akatumiche bhala ngabhannobholila Sauli ngita chalongila Daude. <verse eid="1SA 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 18:25" />Sauli ngabhalobholila, bhannobholele Daude naha, “Munahota nkolongwa apala magovi miya gha Akafilichite, ngita kinyaghabhule cha kamwale jwake, kupala alepechela lilaka kwa akamakoko bhake.” Naha ndi Sauli chapata Daude akomwa na Akafilichite. <verse eid="1SA 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 18:26" />Akatumiche bhake pibhannobholila Daude nhwalo gwenio Daude ngahanganila hake kubhehe munahota nkolongwa nabha nkohano mundo, kabula jha lichiko lya unyagho gwa ndowa kuhika, <verse eid="1SA 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 18:27" />Daude na bhando bhake ngabhajhenda ngabhakoma Akafilichite miya ibhele, na Daude ngatoila magovi ghabhe nukughapeleka ghoha kwa munahota nkolongwa Sauli. Peniya, Sauli ngantolanikicha Daude, kamwale jwake Mikale, abhehe nhwanamundo.<verse eid="1SA 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 18:28" />Sauli ngamanya kubhehe Bhambo Chapanga abhii pamonga na Daude, na Mikale mwanamundo ngampala hake Daude. <verse eid="1SA 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 18:29" />Sauli ngachochita kunnyoghopa Daude, jwenie ngabhila likoko lyake Daude machiko ghoha gha ughome gwake.<verse eid="1SA 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 18:30" />Akakomana ngondo bha Akafilichite ngalijhendilila kukomana ngondo na Akaichilahele, nambo kila pibhakomina ngondo, Daude ngabhahotwila kuliku akatumiche bha Sauli, yene liina lya Daude ngalichochita kumanyikana nu kujhokanikika hake.<verse eid="1SA 18:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1SA 19" />
  <para style="s">Sauli ipala kunkoma Daude</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 19:1" />Sauli ngannobholila Yonasani mwana mundo na akatumiche bhake bhoha panane jha mpangu gwake ghu kunkoma Daude. Nambo Yonasani, ngampalita hake Daude. <verse eid="1SA 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 19:2" />Jwenie ngannobholila Daude, “Tate gwango apakunkoma, yene, mma miho. Kilabho lukela, nnyobha pi kijhobho. <verse eid="1SA 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 19:3" />Nenga nahika na tate gwango kwenio ku nng'onda nu kujhema pahina na pumpakujhobha na nanongela nako kunhwalo gwino, na peniya chaninobholela kila kilebhe chimbakuhumbula kuhumii kwake.”<verse eid="1SA 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 19:4" />Yonasani ngannumbilila Daude nnonge jha tate mundo kukulonge, “Nkoto kuntende ubhoho ntumiche jwino Daude, nhwalo jwenie kibhii jhe kibhoho chochoha chantendii, machiko ghoha itendwa yake yoha yakibha yambone pantumikila. <verse eid="1SA 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 19:5" />Pankomita Goliate Mfilichite, akajhogwipe jhe kuwe, na Bhambo Chapanga ngabhapila Akaichilahele uhotolo nkolongwa ata mwenga punnolita kilebhe chenio nguhanganila hake. Kunhwalo ghane mpala kutenda uhakaho kwa mundo ngita Daude, kwa kunkoma changalilemwa?”<verse eid="1SA 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 19:6" />Sauli ngannyokanikiya Yonasani, mwana mundo, peniya, ngalapila, “Nilapii kwa Bhambo Chapanga jwabhii ghome, ninkoma jhe Daude.” <verse eid="1SA 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 19:7" />Bhahe, Yonasani ngankemita Daude nu kunnobholela malobhe ghenio ghoha. Peniya, Yonasani ngampelika Daude kwa Sauli, na jwenie Daude ngantumikila munahota nkolongwa Sauli ngita makacho.<verse eid="1SA 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 19:8" />Pughapetita gheniya, ngondo ngaipitila kabhele pakate jha Akafilichite na Akaichilahele. Daude ngabhokita nu kukomana nabho ngabhakomita Akafilichite hoko na bhibhahighilika ngabhatilita.<verse eid="1SA 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 19:9" />Peniya, uhuke mmoho ghulekekilwe kuhumii kwa Bhambo Chapanga ngaujhingilila Sauli pakibha atamite kajhake, mulibhoko lyake akibha akamwii nkowa, kipinde Daude ahonita kinube. <verse eid="1SA 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 19:10" />Sauli ngajhighita kunnyundukula Daude kwa nkowa gwenio, nambo Daude ngajhepita nkowa gwa Sauli na nkowa gwenio ngaujhundwikila mulipamanda. Daude ngatilita nu kughomboka kilo jhenio.<verse eid="1SA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 19:11" />Kilo jhenio, Sauli ngatumita akatumiche bhake bhakanninge Daude kajhake, kupala kilabho lukela ankome. Mikale ngannobholila Daude ungana mundo, anda mikighombwii jhe deleno, kilabho lukela nabhankoma. <verse eid="1SA 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 19:12" />Bhahe, Mikale nganhulwiya Daude nngana mundo kupete palidilicha, jwenio ngabhokita nu kutila. <verse eid="1SA 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 19:13" />Mikale ngatoila kinyagho ngakighonika pakindanda na pamuto gwa kinyagho chenio ngawalicha mangoma gha mbuhe. Peniya, ngakiyekita kwa libulangete. <verse eid="1SA 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 19:14" />Sauli patumita bhando kunkamuu Daude, Mikale ngabhalobholila Daude itenda kulwalwa. <verse eid="1SA 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 19:15" />Bhahe, Sauli ngabhalaghila kabhele bhakelebhuke kuntola Daude kukulonge, “Munneta pamba Daude ata atenda kulwalwa kupala ninkome.” <verse eid="1SA 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 19:16" />Akatumiche bheniya pibhajhingila nkate mwa Daude, ngabhakikolela kinyagho pakindanda chenio na mutwe gwake kibhekitwe mangoma gha mbuhe. <verse eid="1SA 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 19:17" />Sauli ngankonyita Mikale, mwana mundo, “Kwanike undei kungolowa? Kilebhe ghane munnekite likoko lyango atile?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 19:17">Jwenie Mikale ngajhangwila, “Anobholila, nangoma anda nakunneka jhe ajhende.” <verse eid="1SA 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 19:18" />Daude panyogholwika, ngajhenda ku Lama kwa Chamwele. Nganchimulila malobhe ghoha ghantendii Sauli. Bhahe, Chamwele na Daude ngabhabhokita nu kujhenda kutama ku muche ghuku Nayote. <verse eid="1SA 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 19:19" />Malobhe gheniya nganhikilila Sauli, kubhehe Daude abhii ku Nayote, kwenio ku Lama. <verse eid="1SA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 19:20" />Peniya, Sauli ngabhatuma akatumiche bhakankamuu Daude. Nambo pibhaliweina lilongo lya akalondole bhikilondola na Chamwele ndi kilongoche jwa lilongo lyenio, uhuke gwa Bhambo Chapanga ujhakwahikilila akatumiche bheniya bha Sauli, bheniya hele ngabhatumbwila kulondola. <verse eid="1SA 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 19:21" />Sauli palobholilwa malobhe gheniya, ngatumita akatumiche bhange, bheniya ngabhatumbwila tulondola. Sauli ngatumita akatumiche bhange mala jhutato, bheniya hele ngabhatumbwila kulondola. <verse eid="1SA 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 19:22" />Peniya, ngajhenda jwene ku Lama. Pahikita kukilibha kikolongwa chikibhii ku Seku, ngankolila mundo jhumo nukunkonya, “Bho, Chamwele na Daude bhabhiko?” Mundo jwenio ngannyangwila, “Bhabhii ku Nayote, kwenio ku Lama.” <verse eid="1SA 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 19:23" />Bhahe, Sauli ngajhahwila ku Nayote, kwenio ku Lama. Uhuke gwa Chapanga ngaunhikilila pakibha mundela, jwenie ngatumbwila kulondola ade pahikita ku Nayote. <verse eid="1SA 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 19:24" />Ngahulita ngobho yake ngalondwila nnonge jha Chamwele. Ngaighilika makengele muhe na kilo, lichiko lela. Yene, bhando ngabhakonyina, “Bho, Sauli ndi jhumo jwa milondole?”<verse eid="1SA 19:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1SA 20" />
  <para style="s">Yonasani intangatii Daude</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 20:1" />Bhahe, Daude ngatila kuhumii ku Nayote kwenio ku Lama, ngannyenila Yonasane nukunkonya, “Bho, ndei kilebhe ghane? Bho, nike lilemwa lyango? Bho, ninemwii nike tate gwino ata ajhighe kubhoha ughome gwango?”<verse eid="1SA 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 20:2" />Yonasane nganyangwila, “Aka! Lyenie libhaha kutale na mwe. Miwe jhe. Tate gwango atenda jhe kilebhe chochoha changanobholela, libhaha likolongwa amu lichokombe, ata nhwalo ghongo ahoto jhe kunhiya. Ibhii jhe naha.”<verse eid="1SA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 20:3" />Nambo Daude ngalapila nu kulonge, “Chakaka tate gwino, aimanye njwe chumbaile na apahi jhe, mwe umanye chela chapakutenda, kupala nkoto kubhehe ngolongonde. Nambo nilapii kwa Bhambo Chapanga jwabhii ghome na kwino hele, kubhehe kuwe kwango kubhandikii hake.”<verse eid="1SA 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 20:4" />Yonasani ngannobholila Daude, “Chochoha chumpakulonge ndende, chandenda.”<verse eid="1SA 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 20:5" />Bhahe, Daude ngannobholila, “Dola, kilabho ndi unyagho gwa kupitii kwa mbalamwehe, na nenga nipalwa kulye pamonga na munahota nkolongwa, nambo uneke nakajhobhe kunng'onda ade pamalabho kimiye. <verse eid="1SA 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 20:6" />Anda tate gwino amwei jhe nu munnobholela, Daude annyopite ninnekekiye, ajhende kajhake ku Betelehemo, akapiye litambiko lya kila chaka pamonga na akalongo mundo bha pakajhake. <verse eid="1SA 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 20:7" />Anda alongii, ‘Tela,’ bhahe, ntumiche gwino abhii njelembo. Nambo anda achimwite mihoto kumanya kubhehe chakaka ayengite kumengwa. <verse eid="1SA 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 20:8" />Yene, undendela ghambone nenga ntumiche gwino, ku nhwalo ntei lilaghano na nenga nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. Nambo, anda ndeii lilemwa, bhahe, ungome mwenga mabhene! Bhahe, mangambeleka jhe kwa tate gwino, kupala angome.”<verse eid="1SA 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 20:9" />Yonasani ngannyangwila, “Liwacho lyenio libhaha kutale na mwenga. Chakaka, anda ngamanya kubhehe tate gwango apangine mabhoho panane jhino, nganinnongalile.”<verse eid="1SA 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 20:10" />Daude ngankonyita “Bho, nanimanya bhole anda tate gwino, nanyangula ku kumpwatalila?”<verse eid="1SA 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 20:11" />Yonasani ngannobholila Daude, “Hika, tijha kunng'onda.” Bhahe, ngabhalongohina pamonga kujhenda kwenio kunng'onda. <verse eid="1SA 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 20:12" />Peniya, Yonasani ngannobholila Daude, “Ninnapii nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jhuku Ichilahele. Kilabho amu pamalabho kipinde ngita chenje, naninkonya tate gwango. Anda mawacho ghake ghambone panane jhino, naninnobholela.” <verse eid="1SA 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 20:13" />Nambo anda tate gwango apala kungomelekeya na nenga nanninobholela jhe, bhahe, Bhambo Chapanga angoma. Bhambo Chapanga abhaha pamonga na mwenga ngita chabhii na tate gwango. <verse eid="1SA 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 20:14" />Anda nanyendelela kubhehe naghome, bhahe, undendela ghambone machiko ghoha ngita ghala gwa Bhambo Chapanga, machiko ghoha ghu ughome gwango, nambo anda hwile, <verse eid="1SA 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 20:15" />mangaleka jhe kwatende ghambone akalongo bhango machiko ghoha. Ata kipinde Bhambo Chapanga papakwakomelekeya okwe akamakoko bhino bhoha, bhumii pannema. <verse eid="1SA 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 20:16" />Yonasani ngabhekita lilaghano na Daude kukulonge, “Bhambo Chapanga na abhakomelekeye akamakoko bhino.”<verse eid="1SA 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 20:17" />Yonasani ngannobholila Daude alapila kupala kulenganikiya champaila, kunhwalo Yonasani akampai hake Daude ngita chakipala jwene. <verse eid="1SA 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 20:18" />Peniya, Yonasani ngannobholela Daude, kilabho ndi unyagho gwa kupitila kwa mbalamwehe, bhando nabhamanya kubhehe mmii jhe nhwalo kigoda chino nakibhaha changa mundo. <verse eid="1SA 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 20:19" />Pamalabho kimiye, nnyenda chehemo jhinyobhita pintumbwila kipinde kindokole chenje pikitumbwila, makajhobhe munyuma jha lighanga lya Ezele. <verse eid="1SA 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 20:20" />Nenga nahucha mahonga matato puupele jhake, ngita nengite telatela. <verse eid="1SA 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 20:21" />Peniya, nanintuma ntumiche gwango ajhenda kupalaha mahonga gheniya. Anda ninnobholile, “Dola, mahonga gheniya ghabhii upandi ghongo gwino, mitola mileta pamba, yenio ndi nibhaha nginyililo kubhehe mmi njelembo, na mwenga namikipiya chehemo jhinnyobhita nhwalo nilapii kwa Bhambo Chapanga jwabhii ghome, kubhehe namma njelembo changakibhangwa chochoha. <verse eid="1SA 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 20:22" />Nambo anda ninnobholile, Dola, mahonga ghabhii nnonge jhino, bhahe mipalwa mmoka, ku nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga impala nnyende kutale. <verse eid="1SA 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 20:23" />Panane jha ghala ghitulongile mwenga na nenga, Bhambo Chapanga ndi jwalola pakate jhito mwenga na nenga nukututenda tukoto kujhehwa, machiko ghoha ghangapeta.”<verse eid="1SA 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 20:24" />Bhahe, Daude ngajhobhita munng'onda, na unyagho gwa kupitii kwa mbalamwehe, munahota nkolongwa Sauli ngatamita kupala alya. <verse eid="1SA 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 20:25" />Ngatamita pa kigoda chake chikibhii pahina na lipamanda, mwiye na mwiye na Yonasani, na Abineli ngatamita pahina na munahota nkolongwa. Nambo kigoda cha Daude kikibha changa mundo. <verse eid="1SA 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 20:26" />Lichiko lyenio, Sauli akalongi jhe chochoha, ahambwika pange Daude unkoli nhwalo amu jwanga jheketelwa kunnyinami Bhambo Chapanga, kujhenda ku unyagho gwenio. <verse eid="1SA 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 20:27" />Lichiko lilikengime lya unyagho gwa kupitila kwa mbalamwehe, kigoda cha Daude kikibha changa mundo kabhele. Peniya, Sauli ngankonyita mwanamundo Yonasani, “Kwanike, Daude mwana jwa Yese dicho na deleno, ahikite jhe kulyegha?”<verse eid="1SA 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 20:28" />Yonasani ngannyanguu, “Daude annyopita ninnyeketele ajhenda ku Betelehemo. <verse eid="1SA 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 20:29" />Alongila unyeketela nyende kwa akalongobhango ku nhwalo bhitenda unyagho gwa kupiya litambiko kwenio ku bomane, na nhwacha gwango ambaii monekane. Yene, anda nanyeketela unyeketele, nyende kwa akalongo bhango. Ndi nhwalo abhii jhe pamba kulye pamonga na munahota nkolongwa.”<verse eid="1SA 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 20:30" />Peniya, Sauli ngabhila na lilaka panane jha mwanamundo Yonasani, ngannobholila, “Mwe mamwana jwa mwikeghe jhuna mitaho na nnyambila” Bho, mihambuka nimanyi jhe kubhehe muhagwii mwana jwa Yese kwa hone jhino na kwa hone jha majhe gwino? <verse eid="1SA 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 20:31" />Bho, mimanya jhe kubhehe Daude pabhe ghome mwe mihoto jhe kubhehe munahota nkolongwa pikilambo chenje? Ngohe, nnyenda makanneta pamba, chakaka ipalwa ahwa.<verse eid="1SA 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 20:32" />Yonasani ngankonyita tate gwake, “Bho, kunhwalo ghane akomwe? Bho, kilebhe ghane chateile?”<verse eid="1SA 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 20:33" />Nambo Sauli ngantaghila nkowa Yonasani kwa makakala kupala ankoma. Ndi Yonasani ngamanyita kubhehe tate gwake ate kuyenga kunkoma Daude. <verse eid="1SA 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 20:34" />Yonasani ngajhemita chehemo pu kulele chakulya kwa lilaka. Lichiko lyenio lyu ubhele lya unyagho gwa kuhembukii kwa mwehe akalii jhe chochoha, akibha ngolongonde ku nhwalo tate gwake antendi ghanganandela Daude. <verse eid="1SA 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 20:35" />Lichiko lilikengima lukela, Yonasani ngajhenda kunng'onda, kukongana na Daude ngita chibhalaghina. Ajhendita kwenio na kangombo jhumo munalome. <verse eid="1SA 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 20:36" />Pahikita kwenio ngannobholila kangombo jhola, “Bhutuka makapalahe mihonga jhambakubula.” Kangombo jhola pabhutwika mbelo, Yonasani ngahuchita mihonga nnonge jhake. <verse eid="1SA 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 20:37" />Kangombo jhola pahikita tu chehemo pugwelii nhonga, Yonasani ngankemita nukulonge, “Nhonga ubhii nnonge jhino.” <verse eid="1SA 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 20:38" />Yonasani nganchobhilila njobhelo kangombo jwenio, “Hajha jhomboteka tyanga kajhombe mangajhema jhe!” Kangombo jhola ngalokwita mihonga nu kubhujha kwa munahota gwake. <verse eid="1SA 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 20:39" />Nambo kangombo jwenio amanyita jhe chochoha, mana jha kitendwa chenio. Yonasani na Daude kanjika ndi bhamanyita kitendwa chenio. <verse eid="1SA 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 20:40" />Yonasani ngankamukiya kangombo jhola chilaha yake nu kunnobholela “Ngohe nnyenda mibhujhicha ku bomane.”<verse eid="1SA 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 20:41" />Pabhokita kangombo jhola, Daude ngajhinuka kuhumii chehemo jhake jhajhobhita pahina na lighanga. Ngajhinima pahe mala tato nnonge jha Yonasani. Ngabhakumbatilina, ngabhalelita pamonga. Nambo Daude akibha na lipyanda hake kuliku Yonasani. <verse eid="1SA 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 20:42" />Peniya, Yonasani ngannobholila Daude, “Nnyenda ku uteeke, kunhwalo tulapiine kilapo chu ukoche pakate jhito nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, kulonge Bhambo Chapanga ndi jwalola kwito na pakate jha ibhelukwa ino na yango, machiko ghoha ghangapeta.” Peniya, Daude ngabhokita na Yonasani hele ngakelehwika ku bomane.<verse eid="1SA 20:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1SA 21" />
  <para style="s">Daude intila Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 21:1" />Daude ngajhenda kwa mpiya litambiko Ahimeleki kwenio ku Nobo, Ahimeleki ngapita kumpokela kongo ipeta kulendema, ngankonyita, “Bho, ku nhwalo ghane nhwikite kanjika chino?”<verse eid="1SA 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 21:2" />Daude ngannyangwila Ahimeleke, “Mi pamba kwa malaghalikilo gha munahota nkolongwa. Anobholila ngoto kunnobholela mundo jhojhoha kilebhe chandumite. Naghine na bhando bhango tukongane chehemo jhikiteno. <verse eid="1SA 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 21:3" />Bho, nkwete kilebhe chochoha? Ninnyopa mabumunda nhwano amu chochoha chikibhile.”<verse eid="1SA 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 21:4" />Mpiya litambiko Ahimeleke ngannyangwila Daude, “Pamba ngwete jhe libumunda lyamulimanya. Mabumunda ghighapihwa ndi ghighabhii pamba. Mihoto kupekewa mabumunda gheniya anda tu bhando bhino bhagholwike jhe na akakeghe machiko ghanga ghapahina.”<verse eid="1SA 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 21:5" />Daude ngannyangwila mpiya litambiko, ngannobholila, “Chakaka machiko ghandina ghano tugholwike jhe na akakeghe, ngita chibhile pinijhenda kulihengo lya kila lichiko lya ulonda. Anda bhando bhango bhijheketelwa nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga mulihengo lya kila lichiko, bho, ichocha jhe mu lihengo lende likolonga lyandumitwe na munahota nkolongwa?”<verse eid="1SA 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 21:6" />Peniya, mpiya litambiko ngampila mabumunda ghala gha kumpiikiya Bhambo Chapanga, nhwalo pakibha jhe na mabumunda ghange, nambo jhela tugha jhukubheka nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. Kila lichiko lukela, mpiya litambo ajhangingina mabumunda gheniya nu kubheka mayono kuhumii pi kiinja.<verse eid="1SA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 21:7" />Bhahe, lichiko lyenio pakibha na jhumo jwa akatumiche bha Sauli, akibha pena kupala kumpiikiya Bhambo Chapanga litambiko likukomelekeya. Ntumiche jwenio akemitwa, Doege Mwedome, nnyemelela jwa bhalucha inyama ya Sauli.<verse eid="1SA 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 21:8" />Bhahe, Daude ngannobholila mpiya litambiko Ahimeleke, “Bho, mihoto kumbela upanga amu nkowa? Nhwalo Nge'ghite jhe upanga hilu chilaha jhojhoha, nhwalo lihengo lya munahota nkolongwa lindei nyomboteke.”<verse eid="1SA 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 21:9" />Ahimeleke ngannyangwila, “Ngwete upanga ghola gwa Mfilichite Goliate jhunkomita ku lulambo lwa Ela, ubhii unyuma jha kichubao cha mpiya litambiko ukongitwe mu kitambala. Anda mpakutola ntola, nhwalo pamba ubhiii jhe upanga ghonge, Daude ngannobholila,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 21:9">“Ubhii jhe upanga ghonge gwambone ngita gwenio, umbekeye.”<verse eid="1SA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 21:10" />Lichiko lyenio, Daude ngantilita Sauli, ngajhenda kwa munahota nkolongwa Akishi jhu ku Gati. <verse eid="1SA 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 21:11" />Akatumiche bha munahota nkolongwa Akishi ngabhannobholila, “Jhonjo Daude jhe munahota nkolongwa jwa kilambo chake? Jhonjo chi jhubhannyembita mung'oma yabhe nukulonge,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 21:11">“Sauli akomite maelufo ghake, na Daude akomite makome elufo ghake?”<verse eid="1SA 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 21:12" />Daude akahotwii jhe kughajhehwa malobhe gheniya ghibhalongila akatumiche bha Akishi, ngannyogwipa hake Akishi, munahota nkolongwa jhu ku Gati. <verse eid="1SA 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 21:13" />Bhahe, Daude ngakitenda nng'oloka nnonge jhabhe kila pabhehe nabho, ngakinyaghila mu mbau ya litangala, nu mata ghake ghanyolwila chwii mundeho yake. <verse eid="1SA 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 21:14" />Akishi ngabhalobholila akatumiche bhake, “Mimanya kubhehe mundo jhonjo jhuna ngholoka, kwanike minneta kwanenga? <verse eid="1SA 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 21:15" />Pamba bhabhii bhina ngholoka bhamahele, kwanike munnetite mundo jhonjo pakajhango?”<verse eid="1SA 21:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1SA 22" />
  <para style="s">Sauli ikoma akapiya matambiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 22:1" />Daude ngabhokita ku Gati nu kutilii mu linkwembe, pahina na muche gwa Adulamo. Akahacha mundo na akalongomundo bhange pubhajhoina mihalo jhenio, ngabhankengima nukulombana nako. <verse eid="1SA 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 22:2" />Bhando bhoha bhibhabhii nilipyanda na ulongoche gwa Sauli na bhibhabhonelwa, ngabhalombina na Daude. Na bhoha bhibhalombina nako bhakibha bhando miya ncheche na jwenio ndi jwakibha kilongoche gwabhe.<verse eid="1SA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 22:3" />Kubhoke kwenio, Daude ngajhenda ade ku Misipa kukilambo chuku Moabo. Ngannobholila munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Moabo, “Chonde ninnyopa tate na majhe gwango bhatame pamba ade pambakumanya chapakundendela Bhambo Chapanga.” <verse eid="1SA 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 22:4" />Yene, Daude ngabhaleka atate na amajhe mundo, bhatame kwa munahota nkolongwa jwaku Moabo, bheniya ngabhatama kwajhake pamonga na jwenie, kipinde choha Daude chakibha ajhobhite mu linkwembe.<verse eid="1SA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 22:5" />Peniya, nnondole jwa Chapanga Gade ngannobholila Daude, “Nkoto kutama mu linkwembe mone, mmoka na nnyenda ku kilambo chuku Yuda.” Yene Daude ngabhokita nu kujhenda kutama mu litogholo lya Helete.<verse eid="1SA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 22:6" />Lichiko limo, Sauli akibha atamite pahe jha nkongo nkwajho ghukibha pikitombe kwenio ku Gebeya, kongo akamwii nkowa mulubhoko lwake na akatumiche bhake bhantindikii puupele jhake. Ngabhalobholilwa kubhehe Daude na bhando bhake bhamanyikine pabhile, <verse eid="1SA 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 22:7" />yene Sauli ngabhalobholila akatumiche bhake, “Nnyokanikiya Akabenjamine! Bho, Daude mwana jwa Yese nampela mangota mwenga mighonda na mighonda jha michabibo? Bho, nantenda mangota kubhehe ilongoche ya akakomana ngondo bha maelufo na ilongoche ya akakomana ngondo mamiya? <verse eid="1SA 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 22:8" />Bho, ndi nhwalo mangota mpangita nginyika jhukung'alambuka? Abhii jhe mundo ata jhumo panakate jhino jwahikite kunnobholela ghanga, kubhehe mwanango jwene ateii lilaghano na mwana jwa Yese. Helehela abhii jhe mundo jhojhoha jwangokolekeya, hilu jwannobholela kubhehe Daude kupala kungoma ngita chibhii deleno.”<verse eid="1SA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 22:9" />Ndi Doege mundo jhuku Edomu jwajhemita pahina na akatumiche bha Sauli, ngalongila, “Nakamwene mwana jwa Yese akijhenda ku Nobo, kwa mpiya litambiko Ahimeleke, mwana jwa Ahitobo. <verse eid="1SA 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 22:10" />Ahimeleke ngannyopela Daude kwa Bhambo Chapanga, na ngampila chukulya nu upanga ghola gwa Mfilichite Goliate.”<verse eid="1SA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 22:11" />Peniya, munahota nkolongwa Sauli, ngatuma bhando bhajhenda kunkema mpiya litambiko Ahimeleke, mwana jwa Ahitobo, pamonga na akalongo bha tate mundo bhibhakibha akapiya matambiko, kwenio ku Nobo. Bhoha ngabhannyendila munahota nkolongwa. <verse eid="1SA 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 22:12" />Sauli ngalongila, “Ngohe jhokonikiya mwe ma mwana jwa Ahitobu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 22:12">“Na jwenie ngajhangwila, Ena,” munahota nkolongwa gwango. <verse eid="1SA 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 22:13" />Sauli ngankonyita “Kwanike mwenga na mwana jwa Yese, mmekingine nginyika kupala ungome? Kwa nike mukampekii mabumunda nu upanga na peniya ngamnyopela kwa Chapanga? Kukutenda yene, deleno ang'alambwike na atenda kunnyobhela nukupala kungoma.”<verse eid="1SA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 22:14" />Ahimeleke ngannyanguu munahota nkolongwa, “Ghane panakate jha akatumiche bhino jwahobholeka kuliku Daude? Jwenie ndi nkohano gwino na nkolo jwa akakomana ngondo bhino bhibhannonda na jwatopela hake kuliku bhoha mu nyumba jhino. <verse eid="1SA 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 22:15" />Bho, lichiko lyenio ndi likibha lichiko lintumbwila kunnyopa Bhambo Chapanga ku nhwalo gwake? Nai jhe! Munahota nkolongwa, nkoto kutuhwachii ghanganandela nenga hilu akalongo bha tate gwango. Nhwalo nenga ntumiche gwino manyii jhe chochoha kibhaha kikolongwa amu kichokombe.”<verse eid="1SA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 22:16" />Nambo munahota nkolongwa Sauli ngannobholila, “Ahimeleke chakaka nankomwa mwenga pamonga na akalongo bha tate gwino.” <verse eid="1SA 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 22:17" />Ndi Sauli ngabhalobholila akalonda bhubhakibha pahina nabho, “Nng'alambuke makome akapiya matambiko bha Bhambo Chapanga, nhwalo bheniya bhabhii ndela jhimo na Daude, na bhakamanyite kubhehe andilite, nambo ngabhatamita nuu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 22:17">Nambo akalonda bheniya ngabhakanita kwakoma, akapiya matambiko bha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="1SA 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 22:18" />Bhahe, Sauli ngannobholila Doege, “Mwe ghalambuka makome akapiya matambiko.” Yene, Doege ngaghalambwika nu kwakoma. Lichiko lyenio, ngabhakomita akapiya matambiko makome nane nu nhwano bhibhawala ichubao ya kitambala kinhuo chu upiya litambiko. <verse eid="1SA 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 22:19" />Peniya, Sauli ngabhakoma ku upanga akolo muche bhoha bhuku Nobo, ndi muche gwa akapiya matambiko, ngabhakomita akanalome na akakeghe na yana na yana ijhonga na ng'ombi na maponda na mambelele.<verse eid="1SA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 22:20" />Nambo Abiazale mwana munalome jwa mpiya litambiko Ahimeleke, Ahimeleke mwana jwa Ahitubo, nganyogholwika nu kukilombanicha na Daude. <verse eid="1SA 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 22:21" />Abiazale ngannobholila Daude kubhehe Sauli abhakomite akapiya matambiko bha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="1SA 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 22:22" />Daude ngannobholela, “Lichiko lela panimmonita tu Doege Mwidomu, nakamanyite njwe, nannobholela Sauli. Nenga ndi kihokola cha tate na amajhe gwino na akalongo gwino bhakomwe. <verse eid="1SA 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 22:23" />Nhwalo mundo jwapala kungoma nenga ndi jwapakunkoma mwenga. Anda mwe nantama na nenga namma njelembo.”<verse eid="1SA 22:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="1SA 23" />
  <para style="s">Daude aughombo muche gwa Keila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 23:1" />Bhahe, Daude ngalobholilwa, “Dola, Akafilichite bhaujhingilile muche gwa Keila nu kukwatula mahuno muikoko yukubheke mahuno.” <verse eid="1SA 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 23:2" />Bhahe, Daude ngankonyita Bhambo Chapanga, “Bho, nnyende nakakomane na Akafilichite abha?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:2">Bhambo Chapanga ngannyanguu, “Jhenda makajhingilile Akafilichite nu kuughombo muche gwa Keila.” <verse eid="1SA 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 23:3" />Nambo Daude ngalobholilwa na bhando bhake, “Dola, pa Yuda pano tutama ku kujhoghopa, naibha bho, anda tujhahwii kwajhingilila akakomana ngondo bha Akafilichite ku Keila?” <verse eid="1SA 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 23:4" />Daude ngankonyita kabhele Bhambo Chapanga, najwenio ngannyanguu, “Mmoke nnyenda ku Keila, nhwalo nanintangatila mahotole Akafilichite.” <verse eid="1SA 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 23:5" />Bhahe, Daude na bhando bhake ngabhajhenda ku Keila, kwenio ngabhabulina na Akafilichite nu kupukila kwa makakala inyama yabhe hoku. Yene, Daude ngabhaghombwila akolo muche ghuku Keila.<verse eid="1SA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 23:6" />Abiazale, mwana jwa Ahimeleke, patilila kwa Daude kwenio ku Keila, ajhahwii na kichubao chu upiya litambiko.<verse eid="1SA 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 23:7" />Sauli palobholilwa kubhehe Daude ajhahwii ku Keila, ngalongila, “Bhambo Chapanga andei ninkamule, ku nhwalo akidindile jwene kukujhingii mu muche ghutindikilwe na mapamanda na ghubhii na matangala ghighabhii na makomeo.” <verse eid="1SA 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 23:8" />Bhahe, Sauli ngabhakemita akakomana ngondo bhake bhajhende ku Keila kupala bhakannyobhele Daude na bhando bhake.<verse eid="1SA 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 23:9" />Daude pajhoina mpangu gwa Sauli pakate jhake, ngannobholila Abiazale mwana jwa mpiya litambiko, “Kileta pamba kichubao chu upiya litambiko.” <verse eid="1SA 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 23:10" />Peniya, Daude ngajhopita, “Ma Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwa ku Ichilahele, chakaka ntumiche gwino, nyohine kubhehe Sauli apangite kuukomelekeya muche gwa Keila, kunhwalo ne mii pamba. <verse eid="1SA 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 23:11" />Bho, bhando bhuku Keila nabhambeleka kwa Sauli? Bho, chakaka Sauli nahika ngita channyohine? Mwe ma Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwa ku Ichilahele, nijhopa unyangule ntumiche gwino.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:11">Bhambo Chapanga ngannyangwila, “Sauli, nahika.” <verse eid="1SA 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 23:12" />Daude ngankonyita kabhele, “Bho, bhando bhuku Keila nabhameka nabhambeleka kwa Sauli, nenga pamonga na bhando bhango?” Bhambo Chapanga ngalongila,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:12">“Ena, nabhatendeya yenio.” <verse eid="1SA 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 23:13" />Bhahe, Daude na bhando bhake ngita miya chita, ngabhabhoka ku Keila na ngabhajhenda chehemo jhimo ade jhenge. Peniya, Sauli palobholilwa Daude anyogholwike ku muche gwa Keila, akajhahwii jhe kwenio.<verse eid="1SA 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daude mu kilambo chi itombe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 23:14" />Bhahe, Daude atamita kukujhobha mu kilambo chi itombe yuku Zifo. Sauli ngampaliha kila lichiko, nambo Bhambo Chapanga ngamambiya Daude akoto kukamulwa na Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 23:15" />Daude ngang'amwiya kubhehe Sauli ahikite kupala angome. Bhahe, Daude ngatamita panjenga jhuku Zifo, kwenio ku Holeshi.<verse eid="1SA 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 23:16" />Yonasani mwana jwa Sauli ngankengima Daude kwenio ku Holeshi ngankwimicha mwojho kubhehe Chapanga innonda. <verse eid="1SA 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 23:17" />Yonasani ngannobholila, mangajhoghopa jhe Daude, tate gwango nampata jhe. Mwe namma munahota nkolongwa jwaku Ichilahele nane nama pahe jhino. Jwenie Sauli tate gwango alimanya hele. <verse eid="1SA 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 23:18" />Bhoha bhabhele ngabhabhekita lilaghano nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. Peniya, Yonasani ngajhenda ukajha nambo Daude ngahighilika pabomane ku Holeshi.<verse eid="1SA 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 23:19" />Bhahe, Akazifo ngabhannyendila Sauli kwenio ku Gebeya, nu kunnobholela, “Daude ajhobhite mu kilambo chito, mu maboma kwenio ku Holeshi, ku kitombe chuku Hakila, chikibhii upande gwa kuchine mwa Yeshimoni. <verse eid="1SA 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 23:20" />Ngohe, tijha makalenganikiye ghala ghighabhii umwojho gwino, natwenga natuntangatila munkamule.”<verse eid="1SA 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 23:21" />Sauli ngalongila, “Bhambo Chapanga na ampe mota nhwalo mingole kiya. <verse eid="1SA 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 23:22" />Nnyendangane makalingulile kabhele, kupala kumanya chehemo jhakihiya na ghane jwamweine chehemo jhenio, nhwalo nobholilwe kubhehe akalamwike hake. <verse eid="1SA 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 23:23" />Nningukiya kila upandi kupala kumanya chehemo jha pakijhobhite, peniya, munetela malobhe ghilenganikii. Anda ammela abhii kwenio, bhahe nanyenda pamonga na mangota mwe, na nenga nanimpalaha pakate jha ngolo yoha ya bhando bhuku Yuda.”<verse eid="1SA 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 23:24" />Bhahe, ngabhabhujhita ku Zifo kone bhannongolile Sauli, nambo Daude na bhando bhake bhakibha kunjenga jhuku Maone, mu lulambo lwa Alaba, kuchine mwa Yeshimoni. <verse eid="1SA 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 23:25" />Sauli na bhando bhake ngabhatumbwila kumpalaha Daude, nambo pajhohina malobhe gheniya Daude ngajhenda kujhobha mu lindalabho nu kutama munjenga jhuku Maone. Sauli pajhoina malobhe gheniya, ngajhenda kumpalaha koko. <verse eid="1SA 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 23:26" />Sauli na bhando bhake bhakibha upande ghumo gwa kitombe, na Daude pamonga na bhando bhake bhakibha upande ghonge gwa kitombe. Daude paghaghita kutila, ndi Sauli pabhandikila kunkamula. <verse eid="1SA 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 23:27" />Peniya, mundo jhumo ngannyendila Sauli nu kunnobholela, “Hika kajhombe, Akafilichite bhikijhingilila kilambo.” <verse eid="1SA 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 23:28" />Yene, Sauli ngalekita kunkengamila Daude, ngajhenda kukomana na Akafilichite. Ndi nhwalo chehemo jhenio pikemwa, Sela Hamalekote, mana ghake, “Lindalabho lya kunyogholoka.” <verse eid="1SA 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 23:29" />Najwenie Daude ngahohwika nu kujhenda kujhobha mu kilambo cha Engedi.<verse eid="1SA 23:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="1SA 24" />
  <para style="s">Daude ileka kunkoma Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 24:1" />Sauli pakelehwika kuhumii kubulana na Akafilichite, ngalobholilwa kubhehe Daude abhii ku njenga jhuku Engedi. <verse eid="1SA 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 24:2" />Sauli ngatoila akakomana ngondo elufo itato bhangajhoghopa, bhibhahaghulilwe kuhumii mukilambo chuku Ichilahele. Kujhenda kumpalaha Daude na bhando bhake, mu mandalabho ghibhatama ipalama. <verse eid="1SA 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 24:3" />Ngahikita ade pa kibhajha cha mambelele muupele mwa ndela, peniya, pakibha na nkwembe, na Sauli ngajhingila mu linkwembe lyenio kubhehe ngita cholo. Daude na bhando bhake bhakibha bhakiwininike nkate hake jha linkwembe lyenio. <verse eid="1SA 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 24:4" />Bhando bha Daude ngabhannobholila, “Lende ndi lichiko lyalongila Bhambo Chapanga, kukulongela, ‘Nanintenda likoko lino ahike kwino, na mwenga chamuntenda chimibhona chamaha.’ ” Bhahe, Daude ngannyendila Sauli kukunyalila kuhumii ku kihogho na kudumula lubhiniko lwa lijoho lya Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 24:5" />Bhahe, Daude akibha ngolongonde mwojho ku nhwalo adumwile lubiniko lwa lijoho changamanya jwenie Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 24:6" />Ngabhalobholila bhando bhake, “Bhambo Chapanga, na anhibhilile nangatenda jhe kitendwa ngita chenje kwa munahota gwango jwa miminilwe mahuta na Bhambo Chapanga abhaha munahota nkolongwa jhuku Ichilahele. Nangahatambuu jhe lubhoko lwango kunkoma mundo jwa miminilwe mahuta na Bhambo Chapanga abhaha munahota nkolongwa jhuku Ichilahele.” <verse eid="1SA 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 24:7" />Bhahe, Daude ngabhapwatalila bhando bhake bhakoto kunnyingilila Sauli. Peniya, Sauli ngapitita mu linkwembe lyenio nukujhendele na mwanja gwake.<verse eid="1SA 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 24:8" />Ndi Daude ngabhokita mu linkwembe nukunkema Sauli, “Mwe manahota bhango nkolongwa!” Munahota nkolongwa Sauli palolikiya unyuma, Daude ngatama makilikite ade pahe kukunnangiya ichima Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 24:9" />Daude ngankonyita Sauli, Bho, ku nhwalo ghane majhokanikiya bhando bhibhannobholela, kubhehe mbala kummengwa? <verse eid="1SA 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 24:10" />Deleno nnolite kwa miho ghino mabhene Bhambo Chapanga, channetite kwango, mu linkwembe. Bhando bhango bhange ngabhanobholila ninkome nambo nenga nganinnekita, nganongila, “Nimmengwa jhe munahota gwango, nhwalo jwenie ndi jwahaghulilwe na Bhambo Chapanga kukumiminilwa mahuta kubhehe munahota nkolongwa. <verse eid="1SA 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 24:11" />Dola, kipandi cha lilombolo lya ngobho jhino mu lubhoko lwango! Nakadumwii lubiniko lwa ngobho jhino nambo nakankomite jhe. Ngohe, mihoto kumanya kubhehe ne namundo jwanganandela jhe hilu kibhii jhe kilebhe chochoha chinnemwiye. Nambo mwenga umbala kungoma. <verse eid="1SA 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 24:12" />Bhambo Chapanga atemula pakate jhango nenga na mwenga. Na jwenie Bhambo Chapanga alepecha mabhoho ghundendela, nambo nenga nanintendela jhe kilebhe kibhoho. <verse eid="1SA 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 24:13" />Nkomboka, luhomo lwa makacho lululonge, Kwa mmoho upita ghanganandela, yene, nenga nanintendela jhe kilebhe kibhoho. <verse eid="1SA 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 24:14" />Mwe ndi munahota nkolongwa jwaku Ichilahele, kilibhe ghane chikintenda umbalahe mundo ngita nenga? Ne ndi ngita ghimbwa jhiwile amu ngita upapane. <verse eid="1SA 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 24:15" />Bhahe, Bhambo Chapanga abhaha ntemula pakate jhango na mwenga. Jwenie alingukiya nhwalo ghongo, angengelela nu kungombola kubhoke mumabhoko ghino.”<verse eid="1SA 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 24:16" />Daude pajhomolila kulongela, Sauli ngankonyita, “Bho, mwe ndi chakaka ma Daude?” Bhahe, Sauli ngalelita kanonowa, <verse eid="1SA 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 24:17" />kukulonge, “Mwenga ndi jwambone hake kuliku nenga, undendii ghambone, nambo nenga nintendii ghanganandela. <verse eid="1SA 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 24:18" />Deleno unangiye chimmii bhambone kwango, Bhambo Chapanga nganetita kwino, nambo mwenga ungomite jhe. <verse eid="1SA 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 24:19" />Bho, anda mundo ankamwi likoko lyake, ahoto kunneka ajhenda njelembo? Bhambo Chapanga antendele ghambone kwa umbone ghundendii deleno. <verse eid="1SA 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 24:20" />Ngohe, manyite kubhehe chakaka namma munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Ichilahele. Na unahota nkolongwa gwa ku Ichilahele unajhema nganganga pahe jha ulongoche gwino. <verse eid="1SA 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 24:21" />Bhahe, unnapalile kwa Bhambo Chapanga kubhehe namakomelekeya jhe ibheluko yango, hilu kuputilii okwe liina lyango kuhumii kwa akalongo bha tate gwango. <verse eid="1SA 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 24:22" />Daude ngannapila Sauli.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 24:22">“Peniya, Sauli ngakelehwika kajhake, nambo Daude na bhando bhake ngabhakelehwika mu chehemo jhibhajhobhita.<verse eid="1SA 24:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="1SA 25" />
  <para style="s">Kuwe kwa Chamwele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 25:1" />“Bhahe, Chamwele ngajhomwika, Akaichilahele bhoha ngabhakonganika pamonga kulela malelo. Ngabhanchika kajhake kwenio ku Lama.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="1SA 25:1">Daude na Abigaeli</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 25:1">Pighapetita gheniya, Daude ngajhenda ku njenga jhuku Palane.<verse eid="1SA 25:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 25:2" />Pakibha na mundo jhumo kubomane jhuku Maone, kwenio ku Palane, jwenio akibha achuluchila ilebhe yake kwenio ku Kalimeli. Mundo jwenio akibha na mambelele elufo itato na mbuhe elufo jhimo Kwenio ku Kalimeli nu kwaheketa mangoma. <verse eid="1SA 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 25:3" />Mundo jwenio akemitwa Nabale na nhwana mundo akemitwa, Abigaeli. Abigaeli akibha mwikeghe jhuna malango na lembulembu hake. Nambo Nabale akibha na mwojho nnyundapahu na jwanganandela, kabhele akibha jwa lukolo lwa Kalebo.<verse eid="1SA 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 25:4" />Bhahe, Daude pakibha kunjenga ngajhoina kubhehe Nabale ahekita mangoma mambelele kwenio ku Kalimeli. <verse eid="1SA 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 25:5" />Daude ngatumita ingombo kome, ngabhalobholila, “Nnyendengane kwa Nabale kwenio ku Kalimeli, mukannobholele malobhe ghango.” <verse eid="1SA 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 25:6" />Munnobholela malobhe ghanga. Uteeke ubhaha na mwenga, na ubhaha kwa akalongo bhino na yoha yubhii nayo. <verse eid="1SA 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 25:7" />Nyoine kubhehe miheketa mangoma mambelele ghino. Mbala umanye kubhehe akalucha bhino bhakibha pamonga na twenga, twenga twakabhengwite jhe na kipinde choha chibhakibha ku Kalimeli, kibhii jhe kilebhe chochoha chikihobhite. <verse eid="1SA 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 25:8" />Anda makonyite akatumiche bhino nabhannobholela. Ngohe, matendela ghambone bhando bhango, nhwalo tuhikite kipinde chu unyagho. Chonde mapele kilebhe chochoha chunkwete akatumiche bhino, na nenga mwana gwino Daude.<verse eid="1SA 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 25:9" />Bhahe, ingombo ya Daude ngabhajhahwila nu kunnobholela Nabale ngita chibhalaghalikilwe na Daude. Peniya, ngabhalendelila ujhangulo gwa Nabale. <verse eid="1SA 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 25:10" />Peniya, Nabale ngabhajhanguu akatumiche bha Daude, “Daude ndi meneke? Mwana jwa Yese ndi meneke?” machiko ghanga bhabhii akatumiche bhamahele bhatila akanahota bhabhe. <verse eid="1SA 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 25:11" />Bho, ndole mabumunda ghango na mache ghango na nyama yanachinjile bhando bhango, bhibhaheketa mangoma gha mambelele ghango, nukwapee bhando nangamanya kubhahumila?<verse eid="1SA 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 25:12" />Bhahe, ingombo ya Daude ngabhakelehwika nukunnobholela Daude ghala ghibhajhangulilwe na Nabale. <verse eid="1SA 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 25:13" />Peniya, Daude ngabhalobholila bhando bhake, “Kila mundo akikonga upanga gwake pakibhuno!” Kila mundo ngatenda yene na Daude ngabheka upanga gwake hele, bhando miya ncheche ngabhankengima Daude na bhando miya ibhele ngabhahighilika na mihigho.<verse eid="1SA 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 25:14" />Kangombo jhumo jwa Nabale ngannobholila Abigaeli, nhwana mundo Nabale, “Daude akatumite ingombo yake kuhumii kunjenga kupala kunnyambucha munahota gwito. Nambo jwenie ate kwaligha. <verse eid="1SA 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 25:15" />Nambo bhando abha bhakibha bhambone hake kwito, bhakatutendii jhe kibhoho, kipinde choha chitukibha nabho kwenio ku njenga, kibhii jhe kilebhe chito chochoha chituhobhiye. <verse eid="1SA 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 25:16" />Bheniya bhatulondita muhe na kilo, kipinde choha chitukibha kukulucha mambelele ghito. <verse eid="1SA 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 25:17" />Ngohe, nhwachila nhwalo ghongo na nhwaghula chukuhenga. Kilebhe chenje kihoto kuleta ngondo kwa munahota gwito na kwa akalongo mundo bhoha. Nabale ndi mundo jwanganandela na abhii jhe jwannyokanikiya jhojhoha.”<verse eid="1SA 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 25:18" />Abigaeli ngajhombotika, ngatoila mabumunda miya ibhele, na mahako gha mambendela mabhele ghigatwelii divaye, na nyama jha mambelele nhwano ghighalenganikilwe mbone na ndolotolo kilo kome na chaba na ihagho miya jhimo ya chabibo nyomo na mabumunda gha tine miya ibhele, ilebhe yenio yoha ngakwelicha muliponda. <verse eid="1SA 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 25:19" />Ngabhalobholila akatumiche bhake, “Nnongohe ndela! Ne naninkengamila.” Nambo Abigaeli akannobholii jhe unganamundo.<verse eid="1SA 25:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 25:20" />Pakibha ahelila, kongo ahobhokii liponda lyake nu kuhelela pu lulambo lwa kitombe, ngabhapwitikilina pwitu na Daude, na bhando bhake bhikijhenda upande gwahumi jwene. <verse eid="1SA 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 25:21" />Bhahe, Daude akibha akihwachii jwene, “Nenga nikibha nondita ilebhe yoha ya Nabale, na kibhii jhe kilebhe chake chochoha chikihobhite. Bho, naha ndi chanepa?” <verse eid="1SA 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 25:22" />Chapanga na angome nenga anda kilabho lukela nanyenda jhe kwakoma akanalome bhake bhoha.<verse eid="1SA 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 25:23" />Peniya, Abigaeli pammonita Daude ngajhombeteka kuhuluka pa liponda lyake, ngatamita makilikite kukuichimu Daude. <verse eid="1SA 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 25:24" />Ngagwelila mu magholo gha Daude nu kunnobholela, “Munahota gwango, lilemwa lyoha libhaha panane jhango. Chonde, nijhopa nongele na mwenga ne nantumiche gwino. Nijhopa nnyokanikiye chela chalonge ntumiche gwino. <verse eid="1SA 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 25:25" />Manganhwachii jhe Nabale mundo jwanganandela, ngita chilibhi liina lyake na jwene ndi hele chabhii. Jwenie akemwa Nabale, na chakaka jwenie apumbumwike. Munahota gwango, akatumiche bhino pimatumita ne nakamwendeka. <verse eid="1SA 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 25:26" />Ngohe, munahota gwango, nilapii kwa Bhambo Chapanga jwabhii ghome, ngita hela chummii ghome, kukubhehe Bhambo Chapanga anhibhilikiye nkoto kulepecha kukukoma bhando, bhaleka makoko bhino na bhala bhibhanhwachii mabhoho bhabhaha mandindilima ngita Nabale. <verse eid="1SA 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 25:27" />Munahota gwango, ninyopa mpokele hupo jhenje jhaninnetile, na mapele akatumiche bhino bhibhalongohana na mwenga. <verse eid="1SA 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 25:28" />Chonde, unekekeye nenga kwa lilemwa lyatei ntumiche gwino, Bhambo Chapanga, nampela mwe akalongo bhibhabhii nganganga, nhwalo munahota gwango mwenga mikomana ngondo ya Bhambo Chapanga. Kipinde choha cha ughome gwino lyangankole jhe libhoho lyolyoha. <verse eid="1SA 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 25:29" />Anda bhapitii bhando bhapakumpukila nu kupala kunkoma, Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, nankombola. Nambo ughome gwa akamakoko bhino nautaghilwa okwe ngita mundo chatagha lighanga kwa ngumbelo. <verse eid="1SA 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 25:30" />Bhambo Chapanga papakuntendela ghambone ngita channaghile nu kunhaghula kubhehe munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Ichilahele, <verse eid="1SA 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 25:31" />mwe namma jhe ngolongonde hilu kuhadabulwa mwojho, kukujhita myahe jhangamalemwa kwa kukilepechela. Nambo, Bhambo Chapanga papakulenganikiya mambu gheniya ninnyopa manahaota bhango, ungomboke ne nantumiche gwino.”<verse eid="1SA 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 25:32" />Daude ngannobholila Abiagaele, “Alumbalilwe Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwa ku Ichilahele, jwantumite kukongana na nenga deleno. <verse eid="1SA 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 25:33" />Chapanga ampe mota kwa malango ghino ghambone kwa kunhibhilikiya ngoto kukoma nu kulepechela ne namwete. <verse eid="1SA 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 25:34" />Chakaka Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwa ku Ichilahele anhibhilikiye nkoto kummengwa, anda nukuhika jhe kajhombe kukongana na nenga, chakaka abhii jhe ata munalome jhumo jwa ku Nabale angahighii ghome ade kilabho lukela.” <verse eid="1SA 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 25:35" />Bhahe, Daude ngapokela ilebhe yoha yaletite Abigaeli, ngananobholila, “Nnyenda ku uteeke kajhino. Dola, nighajhokanikiye ghoha ghulongile na majhopo ghino nighapokii.”<verse eid="1SA 25:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 25:36" />Peniya, Abigaeli ngakelebhuka kwa Nabale, ngakolila unyagho nkolongwa ngita ghu unahota nkolongwa pakajhake. Nabale ngahanganii hake mwojho, nhwalo akalobhii hake lichiko lyenio. Bhahe, Abigaeli akannobholii jhe kilebhe ade lukela. <verse eid="1SA 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 25:37" />Abigaeli pajhimwika lukela pamweina ughembe uhengwite umuto, ngannobholila ungana mundo ghoha ghighapitii, na papapena mwojho gwa Nabale ngaulekita kundundandunda, ngabhila ngita lighanga. <verse eid="1SA 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 25:38" />Pighapetita machiko kome, Bhambo Chapanga ngatoila ughome gwa Nabale.<verse eid="1SA 25:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 25:39" />Daude pajhoina Nabale ajhomwike, ngalongila, “Alumbalilwe Bhambo Chapanga, jwanepechile kwa Nabale kukunigha, na Bhambo Chapanga amambiye nenga natumiche gwake kutenda malemwa. Bhambo Chapanga, anhadabwii Nabale ku uhakaho gwake.” Peniya, Daude ngatumita bhando kupala antolele Abigaeli.<verse eid="1SA 25:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 25:40" />Akatumiche bha Daude ngabhajhenda ade ku Kalimeli kwa Abigaeli, nu kunnobholela, “Daude atulaghile tuhike kunnobholela kubhehe apakuntolela.”<verse eid="1SA 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 25:41" />Abigaeli ngajhemita nukutama makilikite nnonge jhabhe, ngalongila, “Nenga na ntumiche tugha, nyekatile kuntumikila na kugholola magholo gha akatumiche bha munahota gwango. <verse eid="1SA 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 25:42" />Abigaeli ngatenda kajhombe, ngajhinwika nu kuhobhekela pi liponda lyake, ngalongohina na akatumiche bhake akakeghe nhwano, ngajhenda na akatumiche bha Daude na jwenie ngabhila nhwana gwa Daude.<verse eid="1SA 25:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 25:43" />“Kabhele Daude ngantolila Ainoamo kuhumii ku Yezileele. Yene, bhoha bhabhele ngabhabhila akahanamundo. <verse eid="1SA 25:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 25:44" />Kipinde chenio, Sauli akantolanikiche kamwale jwake Mikale, jwakibha nhwana gwa Daude, kwa Paliti mwana jwa Laishi, kuhumii ku muche gwa Galemo.<verse eid="1SA 25:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="1SA 26" />
  <para style="s">Daude inneka ghome kabhele Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 26:1" />“Akanalome bhange kuhumii ku muche gwa Zifo ngabhannyendila Sauli, kwenio ku Gebeya nu kunnobholela kubhehe, Daude akibha akihiya mu kitombe chuku Hakila, upande ghulihumii lyobha mwa Yeshimoni. <verse eid="1SA 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 26:2" />Bhahe, Sauli ngabhokita nu kujhenda kunjenga jhuku Zifo kumpalaha Daude, kongo abhii na akakomana ngondo bhibhamanya kukomana elufo itato bhibhahaghulilwe kubhoke ku Ichilahele. <verse eid="1SA 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 26:3" />Sauli ngabhekita kighono panane jhi kitombe cha Hakila, pahina na ndela, upande ghulipitii lyobha mwa Yeshimoni. Kipinde chenio Daude akibha amela ku njenga. Daude pamanyita kubhehe Sauli ahikite ku njenga kumpalaha, <verse eid="1SA 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 26:4" />ngabhatuma akalingukiya, na bheniya, ngabhannobholela kubhehe chakaka Sauli abhii kwenio. <verse eid="1SA 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 26:5" />Daude ngabhokita nu kujhenda chehemo jhabhekite kighono Sauli. Ngapahweina chehemo jhagholwike Sauli na Abineli mwana jwa Neli, kilongoche jwa akakomana bha Sauli, akibha agholwike pahina na Sauli. Na Sauli akibha agholwike panakate jha lihema kongo atindilwe na akakomana ngondo bhake.”<verse eid="1SA 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 26:6" />Bhahe, Daude ngabhakonya Ahimeleke jwakibha, Nhite, na Abishai nnongo mundo Yoabo, majhe gwabhe akemitwa Cheluya, “Ghane jwapakujhenda nanenga kukighono cha Sauli? Abishai ngalongila,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:6">“Nenga nanyenda pamo na mwenga.” <verse eid="1SA 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 26:7" />Bhahe, lichiko lyenio kilo, Daude na Abishai ngabhajhingila kukighono cha Sauli, ngabhankolila Sauli agholwike panakate jha kighono chenio, na nkowa gwake uhomikwe pahe na pahina na mutwe gwake. Abineli pamonga na akakomana ngondo bhange bhakibha bhagholwike kuntindii Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 26:8" />Peniya, Abishai ngannobholila Daude, “Ngohe, unekekeye ninyundukule libulo limo lya nkowa ade pahe, yene, nibhujhii jhe pabhele.”<verse eid="1SA 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 26:9" />Nambo Daude ngannobholila Abishai, “Nkoto kunkoma, nhwalo chakaka Bhambo Chapanga nanhadabula mundo jhojhoha jwapakujhigha kunkoma mundo jwanhagwile ku kumpaka mahuta. <verse eid="1SA 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 26:10" />Nilapii kwa Bhambo Chapanga jwabhii ghome, kubhehe Bhambo Chapanga jwenie nankoma Sauli, amu lichiko lyake lyukuwe libhandikile, amu pajhenda kungondo nukuwelela koko kwenio. <verse eid="1SA 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 26:11" />Nambo Bhambo Chapanga anganakiye nangajhigha jhe kuhatambuu lubhoko lyango kwa mundo jwanhagwile ku kumpaka mahuta. Nambo tutole nkowa gwake ghubhii pahina namutwe gwake pamonga na ligudulia lyake lya mache, peniya tujhende. <verse eid="1SA 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 26:12" />Yene, Daude ngatoila nkowa na ligudulia lela lya mache pahina na mutwe gwa Sauli, na bheniya ngabhajhahwila. Nambo pakibha jhe na mundo jhojhoha jwalolite amu kumanya nhwalo gwenio. Akibha jwakajhimwike, nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga akabhapekii lughono tipitipi.”<verse eid="1SA 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 26:13" />Peniya, Daude ngajhombwika upande ghonge gwa lulambo lwenio, ngajhemita pi kitombe kutale na kighono cha Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 26:14" />Bhahe, Daude ngabhakemita kanonowa akakomana ngondo bha Sauli na Abineli mwana jwa Neli kukulonge, “Bho, Abineli mmii kunyoha?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:14">Abineli ngakonyita, “Bho, mwe maghane jhuminyimuha munahota nkolongwa?” <verse eid="1SA 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 26:15" />Daude ngannyanguu, Bho, mwe ndi mamundo jwangajhoghopa? Bho, ghane jwabhii ngita mwenga pa Ichilahele pano? Ku nhwalo ghane mukannondite jhe bhambo munahota gwino? Mundo jhumo akahikite kunkomelekeya bhambo munahota nkolongwa gwino. <verse eid="1SA 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 26:16" />Ntei jhe lihengo lino mbone. Nilapii ngita chabhii ghome Bhambo Chapanga impalwa nkomwa mwenga na bhando bhino, nhwalo munnondite jhe munahota gwino, jwapakitwe mahuta gha Bhambo Chapanga. Dolekeya pummile nkowa na liguduliya lya mache lilikibha pahina na mutwe gwa munahota gwino, bho, lammela libhile?<verse eid="1SA 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 26:17" />Sauli ngamanyita lilobhe lya Daude, ngalongila, “Bho, lyenio ndi lilobhe lino mwanango Daude?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:17">Daude ngannyangwila, “Ena, bhambo gwango munahota nkolongwa ndi lilobhe lyango.”<verse eid="1SA 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 26:18" />Daude ngajhendilila kulonge, “Bho, kilebhe ghane mwenga munahota gwango mingengamii nenga ntumiche gwino? Bho, nintei kilebhe ghane? Bho, nintendii lilemwa ghane? <verse eid="1SA 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 26:19" />Ngohe, munahota gwango nkolongwa nijhopa unnyokanikiye malobhe gha ntumiche gwino. Anda chakaka Bhambo Chapanga ndi jwantei uhyeme pakate jhango, bhahe apokela litambiko lilipakuntenda aghalambuu mawacho ghake. Nambo anda bhando ndi bhabhatei yene, bhakola likoto nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, kunhwalo bhande kumenga ku kilambo chatupekii Bhambo Chapanga, kukulonge, ‘Nnyenda makaitumikile ichapanga henge.’ <verse eid="1SA 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 26:20" />Nkoto kuneka nhwelela ku kilambo chikighene, kutale na Bhambo Chapanga. Bho, kilebhe ghane munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Ichilahele miyema ughome gwango ngita mundo chayema ngwale kuitombe?”<verse eid="1SA 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 26:21" />Ndi Sauli palongila, “Ndei malemwa. Kelebhuka mwanango Daude. Nintenda jhe kilebhe chochoha changapalwa nhwalo unekite ghome deleno. Chakaka ndei ngita nalindindilima na nemwite hake.”<verse eid="1SA 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 26:22" />Daude ngajhangwila, “Mwe munahota nkolongwa, nkowa gwino ubhii pamba, muntume kangombo jhumo ahike atole. <verse eid="1SA 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 26:23" />Bhambo Chapanga nanepa kila mundo kwa chela chambone chatenda nu kukuhobholeka kwake. Deleno Bhambo Chapanga akamekite pahe jha ukindendeke gwango nambo nenga nimmengwite jhe kunhwalo Bhambo Chapanga ahagwii kubhehe munahota nkolongwa. <verse eid="1SA 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 26:24" />Chakaka ngita hela chininnekite ghome deleno, ninnyopa Bhambo Chapanga aneke ghome na amohe kuhumii mu mang'ahe na malagho ghoha.”<verse eid="1SA 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 26:25" />Sauli ngannobholila Daude, “Chapanga ampe mota Daude mwanango. Nantenda malobhe makolongwa, na mwe mu kila kilebhe chimipakuhenga nakinyendela telatela.” Yene, Daude ngabhokita na Sauli ngabhujhita kajhake.<verse eid="1SA 26:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="1SA 27" />
  <para style="s">Daude itama kwa Akafilichite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 27:1" />Bhahe, Daude ngakilongelila umwojho gwake, “Lichiko limo, Sauli nangoma. Nhwalo gwambone kwango ndilile kukilambo cha Akafilichite. Sauli nakotoka kungengamila mu mipaka jha kilambo chuku Ichilahele, nane nama njelembo.” <verse eid="1SA 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 27:2" />Ku yene, Daude na bhando bhake miya chita ngabhajhahwila kwa Akishi mwana jwa Moake, munahota nkolongwa jwaku Gati. <verse eid="1SA 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 27:3" />Daude pamonga na akalongo mundo na bhando bhake ngabhatama na Akishi, kwenio ku Gati. Daude akibha na akahanamundo bhabhele. Ainoamo kubhoka ku Yezileeli na Abigaeli jwakibha lipwela lya Nabale, kubhoke ku muche gwa Kalimeli. <verse eid="1SA 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 27:4" />Sauli pajhoina kubhehe Daude atilii ku Gati, akankengimi jhe kabhele.<verse eid="1SA 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 27:5" />Lichiko limo, Daude ngannobholila Akishi, “Anda chakaka nyeketilwe na mwenga, ninnyopa umbe chehemo jha muche ghumo pikilambo chino, kupala ibha chehemo jhango jhukutama. Nhwalo nitope jhe kutama pamo namwe pa muche ghongo ghu unahota nkolongwa.” <verse eid="1SA 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 27:6" />Lichiko lyenio, Akishi ngampila Daude muche gwa Sikilage. Kubhoke lichiko lyenio, muche gwenio ngaubhila ghu munahota nkolongwa jhuku Yuda ade ngohe. <verse eid="1SA 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 27:7" />Daude ngatamita kukilambo cha Akafilichite kwa kipinde cha chaka chimo na myehe ncheche.<verse eid="1SA 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 27:8" />Kwa kipinde chenio, Daude na bhando bhake ngabhajhenda kwajhingilila Akagechule na Akagilize na Akaameleke. Bheniya bhakibha ndi akolo kilambo. Kuhumii makacho bhando bheniya bhakibha mu kilambo ghabhajhingilila kuhumii ku Chule ade ku Michile. <verse eid="1SA 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 27:9" />Kila kipinde, Daude pakibha akijhingilila kilambo ngabhakoma bhando bhoha nu ngapukila kwa makakala mambelele na ng'ombi na maponda na ngamiya na ngobho peniya ngakelehwika kwa Akishe. <verse eid="1SA 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 27:10" />Akishe kila pakibha ankonyita, “Bho, deleno, majhingilii kojhe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 27:10">Daude ngannobholila, najhingilile bhando bha kilambo chu upande gwa kuchine mwa Yuda, kipinde chenge ulonge, upande gwa kuchine gwa kilambo chuku Yelemeele amu upande gwa kuchine gwa kilambo chuku Akaakene. <verse eid="1SA 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 27:11" />Daude annekita jhe mundo jhojhoha ghome munalome amu mwikeghe kupala aletwa ku Gati, ngahwachila kumwojho. Bhihoto kuchimulila panane jhito nu kulonge, Daude atei kitendwa chenje na chela. Yene ndi Daude chateila kipinde choha chakibha kukilambo cha Akafilichite. <verse eid="1SA 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 27:12" />Nambo, Akishe akibha jhe nikiholo na Daude, ngakilongolila kumwojho gwake, “Abhayomiche bhando bhake bhuku Ichilahele ku yene, nabhaha ntumiche gwango ughome gwake gwoha.”<verse eid="1SA 27:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="1SA 28" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 28:1" />Machiko ghamahele nnonge, Akafilichite ngabhakonganicha akakomana ngondo bhabhe, kupala kujhenda kukomana ngondo na Akaichilahele. Akishi ngannobholila Daude, “Mipalwa umanya kubhehe mwenga na bhando bhino mma upande gwa nenga kubulana ngondo.”<verse eid="1SA 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 28:2" />Daude ngannyanguu Akishi, “Ena!” Nnola kilebhe chapakutenda ntumiche gwino. Akishi ngannobholila, “Nane nanintenda kubhehe nnonda gwango kanjika machiko ghoha ghangapeta.”<verse eid="1SA 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sauli annyende mundo jwalondola.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 28:3" />Kipinde chenio, Chamwele akibha ahwile njwe, na Akaichilahele bhoha ngabhannelila nu kunchika ku muche gwake, kwenio ku Lama. Sauli ngabhabhenga akalondola na akahabhe kukilambo chuku Ichilahele.<verse eid="1SA 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 28:4" />Akafilichite ngabhakonganika nu kubheka kighono chabhe, kwenio ku Shunemu, na Sauli ngabhakonganicha akakomana ngondo bhoha Akaichilahele nu kubheka kighono chabhe kukitombe chuku Gilibowa. <verse eid="1SA 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 28:5" />Sauli pahweina tu nchambe gwa akakomana ngondo bha Akafilichite ngatumbwila kulendema kwa kiholo chakibha nacho umwojho gwake. <verse eid="1SA 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 28:6" />Peniya, ndi Sauli ngankonyita Bhambo Chapanga, nambo Chapanga akannyangwii jhe ku kulota hilu kwa maghanga ghukukonyakeya gha ulimu na sumimu kwa akalondole bha Chapanga. <verse eid="1SA 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 28:7" />Peniya, Sauli ngabhalobholila akatumiche bhake, “Umbalakiye mwikeghe jhuna nchuka gwa kulondola, kupala ninyendele nakankonyekehe.” Akatumiche bhake ngabhannobholila, “Abhii mwikeghe jhumo kwenio ku Endole, jhuna nchuka gwa kulondola.” <verse eid="1SA 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 28:8" />Bhahe, Sauli ngakighalambula kukuwala ngobho henge kupala bhando bhakoto kummanya, kilo pikijhingila ngabhajhenda pamonga na bhando bhabhele kwenio kwa mwikeghe, ngannobholila, “Unnetela jhola jhumba kunnobholela liina lyake.”<verse eid="1SA 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 28:9" />Mwikeghe jhola ngannobholila, “Mwe umanye chakiteile munahota nkolongwa Sauli, abhakomilikiye njwenjwe akalondole na akahabhe bhoha, pa kilambo chuku Ichilahele. Ngohe, kunhwalo ghane umeke ntambo ghu kunyonja nu kungoma?”<verse eid="1SA 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 28:10" />Sauli ngalapila ku liina lya Bhambo Chapanga, kukulonge, “Nilapii kwa Bhambo Chapanga jwabhii ghome, nachwapulwa jhe jhipakunkolela, kuhwalo jha kilebhe chenje.”<verse eid="1SA 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 28:11" />Mwikeghe jhola ngankonyita, “Bho, ninnetela ghane kubhoka kwenio?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:11">Sauli ngajhangwila, “Nnetela Chamwele.” <verse eid="1SA 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 28:12" />Mwikeghe jhola pamweina Chamwele ngalelita kanonowa, ngannobholila Sauli, “Kwanike ungolwiye? Mwenga ndi Sauli!”<verse eid="1SA 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 28:13" />Munahota nkolongwa Sauli ngannobholila, “Mangajhoghopa jhe!” “Bho, mibhona nike?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:13">Mwikeghe jhola ngajhanguu, “Nikibhona kichapanga kipitii paundope.” <verse eid="1SA 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 28:14" />Sauli ngankonyita, “Bho, ilandana na kilebhe ghane?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:14">Mwikeghe jhola ngajhangwila, “Munalome jwaghogholwike jwahobhoka kunane kone akipukite lijoho.” Peniya, Sauli ngamanyita kubhehe jwenio ndi Chamwele. Sauli ngalitita ade pahe tipi kukunyenyekeya. <verse eid="1SA 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 28:15" />Chamwele ngankonyita Sauli kunhwalo ghane mindotowa kukunneta panane?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:15">Sauli ngannyanguu, “Ne ning'ahika hake! Akafilichite bhibulana ngondo pakate jhango, na Bhambo Chapanga anekite, annyanguu jhe kabhele kupete kwa akalondole bhake amu kwa maloto. Ndi nhwalo ninkemite mwenga, unobholele kilebhe ghane ndende.” <verse eid="1SA 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 28:16" />Chamwele ngankonyita kunhwalo ghane minyopa ninnobholele chukuhenga, kongo Bhambo Chapanga anekite na abhii likoko lino? <verse eid="1SA 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 28:17" />Bhambo Chapanga antendii chela channobholile kupete nenga. Bhambo Chapanga atoi unahota nkolongwa kuhumii kwino, nu kumpe Daude, Mwichilahele nnyino. <verse eid="1SA 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 28:18" />Ku nhwalo, mwenga makajhokanikii jhe Bhambo Chapanga hilu makatehii jhe chela chapalita matendele Akameleke. Ndi nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga antendii ghanga deleno. <verse eid="1SA 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 28:19" />Kuchocha kwa gheniya, Bhambo Chapanga nantenda mwenga pamonga akakomana ngondo bha Akaichilahele nkamulwe na Akafilichite. Kilabho, mwe pamonga na yana ino namma pamonga na nenga, na Bhambo Chapanga natenda akakomana ngondo bha Akaichilahele bhakamulwe na Akafilichite.<verse eid="1SA 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 28:20" />Pwitu, Sauli ngagwila mangukama kunhwalo jha kiholo na malobhe gha Chamwele. Helahela akibha jhe na makakala kunhwalo akalii jhe kilebhe chochoha kwa lichiko limo, kilo na muhe. <verse eid="1SA 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 28:21" />Mwikeghe jwenio ndi pannyendila Sauli pamweina akamwilwe na kiholo hake, ngannobholila, “Ne nantumiche gwino ngawile deleno, kukutenda chela chunnobholila nintendele.” <verse eid="1SA 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 28:22" />Ngohe, unyokanikiye ne nantumiche gwino, nanenganikiya chakulya nkomalila, kupala nkola makakala gha kujhendele na mwanja gwino.<verse eid="1SA 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 28:23" />Nambo Sauli ngakanita nukulonge, “Na niya jhe.” Nambo akatumiche bhake pamonga na mwikeghe jhola, ngabhampembelikiya akomalile, na jwenie ngabhajhokanikiya. Yene, ngajhinwika nu kutama pakindanda. <verse eid="1SA 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 28:24" />Mwikeghe jwenio akibha na litohe limo lya ng'ombi pakajhake lilihatite, nganchinjita kajhombe, ngatoila ukobha gwa ngano ngahunyita, ngatendekiya chakulya. <verse eid="1SA 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 28:25" />Ngampila Sauli, ngabhapila hele akatumiche bhake, na bheniya ngabhalila. Peniya, ngabhabhokita nu kutumbuu mwanja kilo jhejhe.<verse eid="1SA 28:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="1SA 29" />
  <para style="s">Daude ikanilwa na Akafilichite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 29:1" />Akafilichite ngabhakonganicha akakomana ngondo bhabhe bhoha, kwenio ku Afeka, na Akaichilahele ngabhabheka kighono chabhe pahina na chembwe chu lulambo lwaku Yezileele. <verse eid="1SA 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 29:2" />Akanahota akakolongwa nhwano bha Akafilichite pibhakibha kukupeta na ibhogha yabhe ya akakomana ngondo mamiya na maelufo, Daude na bhando bhake pamonga na Akishi bhakibha unyuma bhaukengamila nchambe gwa akakomana ngondo bheniya. <verse eid="1SA 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 29:3" />Akakomana ngondo bhangajhoghopa bha Akafilichite ngabhakonya, “Akaebulaniya abha bhihenga nike pamba?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 29:3">Akishi ngabhajhangwila akakomana ngondo bheniya, “Jhonjo ndi Daude, ntumiche jwa Sauli munahota nkolongwa jwaku Ichilahele, jwenie atamite na nenga kupeta chaka. Kubhoke lichiko lyatilila kwango ninkamwii jhe na lilemwa lyolyoha.” <verse eid="1SA 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 29:4" />Nambo akakomana ngondo bheniya bhangajhoghopa ngabhanchimwita hake Akishi, ngabhannobholila, “Nkelebhuha ajhende akatame chehemo jhumpile atame. Angajhenda jhe pamonga na twenga ku ngondo, anda jhe naghalambuka nukubhehe likoko lito, kipinde cha ngondo nukwakoma akakomana bhito. Bho, mibhona jhe mundo jhonjo napata ndela jhu kujheketelana na munahota gwake kabhele? <verse eid="1SA 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 29:5" />Nkomboka, jhonjo ndi Daude jhola jwajhembilwa mihambo na akakeghe kubhehe, Sauli akomite elufo jhake, nambo Daude akomite makome elufo ghake.”<verse eid="1SA 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 29:6" />Akishi ngankemita Daude nu kunnobholela, “Nilapii kwa Bhambo Chapanga jwabhii ghome kubhehe mwe ndi jhuna kuhobholeka kwango. Nakahwene mbone tulongohane pamonga nanenga ku ngondo nhwalo libhii jhe lilemwa lyolyoha kubhoke lichiko lela lyuhikite kwa nenga ade deleno. Nambo ilongoche ya akakomana bhampai jhe. <verse eid="1SA 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 29:7" />Ku yene, nkelebhuke ukajha ku uteeke. Na mangayomecha jhe akanahota akakolongwa bha Akafilichite.”<verse eid="1SA 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 29:8" />Daude ngankonyita Akishi, “Ngohe ne ndei bho? Ngita chimilongela hilu lichiko limo minawai jhe kungolela na lilemwa kubhoke lichiko lela landumbwila kuntumikila ade deleno, kunhwalo ghane ngoto kujhenda kubulana na akamakoko bha munahota gwango munahota nkolongwa?”<verse eid="1SA 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 29:9" />Akishi ngannyanguu Daude, “Nimanye kubhehe ubhii mbone pa miho jhango, ngita ntumiche jwa kunane kwa Bhambo Chapanga” nambo ilongoche bha Akafilichite bhalongile, “Jhonjo impala jhe ajhenda pamonga na twe ku ngondo.” <verse eid="1SA 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 29:10" />Ngohe, mwe pamonga na akatumiche bhino bhibhannekita munahota gwino Sauli, bhibhahikite pamonga na mwe, kilabho putepute, pu kuchegha nnyendangana ukajha.<verse eid="1SA 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 29:11" />Yene, lichiko lilikengime lukela, Daude pamonga na bhando bhake ngabhabhujhita ku kilambo cha Akafilichite. Nambo Akafilichite ngabhajhenda ku Yezeleele.<verse eid="1SA 29:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="1SA 30" />
  <para style="s">Daude abhabula Akameleke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 30:1" />Machiko matato nnonge, Daude na bhando bhake ngabhahikita ku Sikilage. Ngabhakolela Akameleke bhaujhingilile muche gwa upande gwa kuchine jha Yuda na muche gwa Sikilage nu kutiniya mwotu. <verse eid="1SA 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 30:2" />Ngabhapukila akakeghe na bhando bhoha bhibhakibha pa bomane peniya, bhakolo kwa akachoko. Bhoha bhakapukile ngabhabhokita nabho, nambo bhakankomite jhe mundo jhojhoha, bhoha ngabhaighalila ghome. <verse eid="1SA 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 30:3" />Daude na bhando bhake pibhahikita ku bomane ngabhaukolila muche gwabhe uhangabhinwe nu utiniwe mwotu na Akaameleke, na akaana bhabhe na yana yabhe inalome na ikeghe yoha ipukilwe. <verse eid="1SA 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 30:4" />Peniya, Daude na bhando bhake bhoha ngabhagwiya kilelo, ngabhalelita ade mahituhitu. <verse eid="1SA 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 30:5" />Akaana bhoha bha Daude, Ainoamo kuhumii ku Yezileele na Abigaeli nahwela jwa Nabale, ngabhapukilwa kwa makakala.<verse eid="1SA 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 30:6" />Daude akibha na malola makolongwa, nhwalo bhando bhake bhakibha na lipyanda mu uhuke yabhe kukuhobheya yana yabhe, yene, ngabhayengila kumbula maghanga. Nambo Daude ngakilekila mwojho kukunhobholela Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwake. <verse eid="1SA 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 30:7" />Daude ngannobholila mpiya litambiko Abiatale mwana jwa Ahimeleke, “Nnetele kichubao cha mpiya litambiko, Na jwenie ngampelikila.” <verse eid="1SA 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 30:8" />Daude ngankonyita Bhambo Chapanga, “Bho, bhando abha nakengame? Bho, chanakamula?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 30:8">Bhambo Chapanga ngannyanguu, “Bhakengame nhwalo namakolela nu kwaghombola bhibhapukilwe kwa makakala.” <verse eid="1SA 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 30:9" />Bhahe, Daude ngabhokita na bhando bhake miya chita bhakibha nabho. Pubhahikita kukipela chuku Besole, na akakomana ngondo bhange bha Daude ngabhahighilika peniya. <verse eid="1SA 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 30:10" />Nambo Daude ngajhendelela kwakengama bhando bheniya, abhii na bhando miya ncheche, akakomana ngondo miya ibhele ngabhaighilika peniya, nhwalo bhakatotokii hake, ngabhalepelila kujhomboka kipela chenio. <verse eid="1SA 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 30:11" />Akakomana ngondo bhala bhibhakibha na Daude ngabhankolila mundo jhumo, Mmichile ku njenga, na bheniya ngabhantoila nu kumpeleka kwa Daude. Ngabhampila libumunda na mache mundo jwenio. <verse eid="1SA 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 30:12" />Helehela ngabhampila kipande cha libumunda lya tine na ikonyo ibhele ya chabibo nyomo, pajhomolila kulyegha makakala ngaghabhujhilina. Ku nhwalo akali jhe hilu kunywe chochoha kwa kipinde cha machiko matato, kilo na muhe. <verse eid="1SA 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 30:13" />Daude ngankonyita, “Munahota gwino ndi ghane? Mihumii kojhe?” Na jwenie nganyangula,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 30:13">Ne Namichile. Ntumiche jwa Mmeleke jhumo. “Munahota jwango annekita unyuma machiko matato ghighapetite, ku nhwalo ndeila kulwalwa.”<verse eid="1SA 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 30:14" />Twenga tukaijhingilii chehemo jha ku njenga upande gwa kuchine mwa kilambo cha Akakelete, na chehemo jha Yuda pamonga na chehemo jha kuchine jhibhatama lukolo lwa Kalebo, na ngatukomelikiya muche gwa ku Sikilagi kwa mwotu.<verse eid="1SA 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 30:15" />Daude ngankonyita, “Bho, mihoto kumbeleka kwa nchambe gwenio?” Kangombo jwenio ngannyangwila, “Anda unnapile kwa Bhambo Chapanga kubhehe naungoma jhe hilu naumbeleka jhe kwa munahota gwango.”<verse eid="1SA 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 30:16" />Kangombo jhola ngannongocha Daude ade pukibha nchambe gwenio. Pubhahikita kwenio ngabhakolila bhando bheniya bhapechengine kila chehemo, nhwalo bhakibha bhakinomenekeya nu kunywe nu kukihanga, kunhwalo ilebhe yabhakatoile ikibha yamahena hake kuhumii kukilambo cha Akafilichite na kuhumii kukilambo chuku Yuda.<verse eid="1SA 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 30:17" />Daude ngakomina nabho kutumbulii lukela ade lichiko lilikengime kimiye. Abhii jhe munalome jhojhoha jwakahighilike, nambo akangombo miya ncheche bhibhahobhokii ngamiya nu kutila. <verse eid="1SA 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 30:18" />Daude ngaghombwila kila kilebhe chibhakapukile Akaameleke, pamonga na akaanamundo bhoha bhabhele. <verse eid="1SA 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 30:19" />Kibhii jhe chochoha chikihobhite. Daude ghabhaghombwila akakolo na bhandina, yana inalome na ikeghe na yoha itoilwa na Akaameleke. <verse eid="1SA 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 30:20" />Daude ngabhujhicha michambe jhoha jha mambelele na ng'ombi, na bhando bhake ngabhahakalila nnonge inyama yenio, kukulonge, “Henge ndi inyama ya Daude!”<verse eid="1SA 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 30:21" />Peniya, Daude ngabhapetila bhala bhando miya ibhele bhibhahighilike pakipela cha Besole, nhwalo bhibhakibha bhatotokile. Bhando bheniya pibhamweina Daude pamo na bhala bhibhakibha pamonga na jwenie, ngabhajhenda kumpokela. Na jwenie pibhabhandikila bhando bheniya ngabhanyambucha kukuhangana. <verse eid="1SA 30:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 30:22" />Pa nchambe ghola gwa Daude, pakibha na akatumiche bhinamilomo na bhanganandela panakate jhabhe, ngabhalongila, “Natwape jhe kilebhe chochoha chitukighombwile nhwalo bhakajhahwii jhe pamonga na twenga. Nambo bhatola akaanamundo na yana yabhe bhajhende.”<verse eid="1SA 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 30:23" />Daude ngabhalobholila, “Nai jhe akalongo bhango.” Mihoto jhe kutenda yene kwa chela chatupii Bhambo Chapanga. Atulondita mbone nu kututenda twahotole nchambe ghola ghuhikita kutujhingilila. <verse eid="1SA 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 30:24" />Abhii jhe mundo jhojhoha jwapakujheketelana na mangota! Jhola jwajhendite ku ngondo na jhola jwahighilike kulonda mihigho jhito, bhoha nabhapata chehemo jhiilengana na nnyake. <verse eid="1SA 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 30:25" />Kubhoke lichiko lyenio, Daude ngatenda kilebhe kubhehe malaghalikilo na lilaghalikilo kwa kilambo chuku Ichilahele ade deleno.<verse eid="1SA 30:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 30:26" />Daude pahikita ku Sikilagi, ngabhapelikila akakochemundo bhibhakibha ighogholo bhuku Yuda, chehemo jha ilebhe, kukulonge, “Napelekela hupo kubhoke mu ilebhe ya akamakoko bha Bhambo Chapanga.” <verse eid="1SA 30:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 30:27" />Hupo jhenio ikibha ku nhwalo gwa ilongoche yuku Beteli na ilongoche ibhii upande gwa kuchine mwa Lamoti na ilongoche bhibhatama ku Yatili, <verse eid="1SA 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 30:28" />ilongoche yuku Aloeli na ilongoche yuku Sifumoti na ilongoche yuku Eshitemoa, <verse eid="1SA 30:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 30:29" />na ilongoche yuku Lakali na ilongoche yuku miche jha Akayelameeli na ilongoche yuku miche jha Akakeni, <verse eid="1SA 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 30:30" />na ilongoche yuku muche gwaku Holima na ilongoche yuku muche gwa Bolashani na ilongoche yuku muche gwa Ataki, <verse eid="1SA 30:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 30:31" />na ilongoche yuku muche gwa Hebiloni. Helahela Daude ngabhapelikila ilongoche yoha yatyangila jwenio na bhando bhake pibhajhahwila kujhobha.<verse eid="1SA 30:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="1SA 31" />
  <para style="s">Kuwe kwa Sauli na yanamundo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="DEU 10:1-12">Kombokela 10:1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 31:1" />Bhahe, Akafilichite ngabhakomina na Akaichilahele. Na Akaichilahele ngabhakomilwa kukitombe chuku Gilibowa na bhange ngabhatilita nnonge jha Akafilichite. <verse eid="1SA 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 31:2" />Nambo Akafilichite ngabhakolila na ngabhatindikiya Sauli na yana yake, na bheniya, ngabhankomita Yonasani na Abinadabo na Malikishuwa, yanamundo Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 31:3" />Ngondo ngainunganila hake kuntindii Sauli. Akahucha mahonga bha Akafilichite pubhamweina Sauli, ngabhanhuchila mihonga. <verse eid="1SA 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 31:4" />Peniya, Sauli ngannobholila jhola jwanng'eghila chilaha, “Ulumula upanga gwino ungome kupala nangakomwa jhe na bhangajhingii jhando.” Nambo ntumiche jhola jwang'eghii chilaha yake akajhighite jhe kutenda yene, nhwalo ajhogwipa hake. Yene, Sauli ngaholomwlila upanga gwake nu kukigwelekeya. <verse eid="1SA 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 31:5" />Peniya, ntumiche jhola jwanng'eghii chilaha pahweina kubhehe Sauli awii, najwehele ngakigwelikiya mupanga gwake, ngawila pamonga na Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 31:6" />Yene, ndi chawila Sauli na yanamundo itato, helahela ntumiche jwake jwanng'eghila chilaha jhake, pamo na bhange bhando, ngabhawila lichiko lele. <verse eid="1SA 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 31:7" />Akaichilahele bhibhakibha upande gwu ubhele gwa lulambo, na bhange bhibhakibha upande gwa ghulihumii lyobha mwa lukemba lwa Yoludane, pubhalolita kubhehe Akaichilahele bhatilite, kongo Sauli na yanamundo, bhawile, ngabhailekita miche jhabhe, na bhene ngabhatilita. Akafilichite ngabhajhenda nu kutama ku miche jhenio.<verse eid="1SA 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 31:8" />Lichiko lilikengime Akafilichite ngabhajhenda kutola ilebhe kuhuma kwa bhando bhibhawile, ngabhakolila malelo gha Sauli na yanamundo, kukitombe chuku Gilibowa. <verse eid="1SA 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 31:9" />Ngabhahekita muto gwa Sauli nukunhula chilaha yake, peniya ngabhatumita bhando mu kilambo chabhe choha, kutangacha malobhe munyumba jha ichapanga yabhe na kwa bhando bhabhe. <verse eid="1SA 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 31:10" />Ngabhaibhekita chilaha jhake munyumba jha Maashitalote, yane kichapanga kikeghe, peniya ngabhaujhenjiya mmele gwake mu lipamanda lya muche gwa Beteshane.<verse eid="1SA 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 31:11" />Nambo bhando bhuku muche gwa Yabeshi gileadi, pibhajhoina ghala ghatendilwe Sauli na Akafilichite, <verse eid="1SA 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 31:12" />akakomana ngondo bhibhamanya kukomana, bhoha ngabhabhokita, ngabhakelukiya kilo ndaa kutyanga, ngabhajhenda kutola yegha jha Sauli na yegha jha yanamundo kuhumii mu lipamanda lya Beteshane, na ngabhaipelika ade Yabeshi na kwatiniya kwa mwotu. <verse eid="1SA 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 31:13" />Peniya, ngabhatoila mihupa jhabhe, nu kuichika pahe jha nkongo gwa nkwajho, kwenio ku Yabeshi, na peniya ngabhalekita kulyegha kwa machiko chaba.<verse eid="1SA 31:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 31" />
</usx>